    # mc "(Yeah... what the hell did I get myself into?)"
    mc "（是啊……我到底把自己搞进什么坑里了？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1594
translate schinese story01_3_272a8881:

    # Mi "(Did I just get outplayed...?)"
    Mi "（我刚才是被摆了一道……？）"

