    # Mi "Teams on the right."
    Mi "组好队的往右边。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1626
translate schinese story01_3_9aa2e0d4:

    # Mi "No team, left."
    Mi "没组到队的往左边。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1627
translate schinese story01_3_d3462f21:

    # mc "(Although there's one thing I still don't get...)"
    mc "（不过有件事我还是没想明白……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1629
translate schinese story01_3_35a26cce:

    # mc "Wait, how did you..."
    mc "等等，你是怎么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1631
translate schinese story01_3_6d818e30:

    # r "I sent ya a request before time ran out."
    r "我在时间到之前给你发了申请。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1632
translate schinese story01_3_edce7d97:

    # r "But acceptin' it meant I had to work around the system a little. Used the radio waves..."
    r "但要接受就得稍微绕过系统。我用了无线电波……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1634
translate schinese story01_3_6cc8c46c:

    # r "End result? You're on the team. Rest doesn't matter."
    r "结果呢？你已经在队伍里了。其他的不重要。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1637
translate schinese story01_3_1baf3339:

    # mc "Alright, team meeting."
    mc "好，队伍会议。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1638
translate schinese story01_3_afc6c913:

    # mc "Let's clear a few things up."
    mc "先把几件事说清楚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1639
translate schinese story01_3_91302231:

    # mc "First: what each of us is good at."
    mc "第一：我们各自擅长什么。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1640
translate schinese story01_3_95930b9c:

    # mc "Second: what we think about this whole mess."
    mc "第二：我们怎么看眼下这堆烂摊子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1641
translate schinese story01_3_d1d9c13c:

    # mc "We'll figure out the rest as we go."
    mc "剩下的走一步看一步。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1646
translate schinese story01_3_c868e390_1:

    # bot "..."
    bot "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1648
translate schinese story01_3_59572f9c:

    # mc "Beep-beep."
    mc "哔哔。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1649
translate schinese story01_3_308bf01a:

    # mc "Name's [mc]."
    mc "我叫[mc]。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1652
translate schinese story01_3_595b7aaa:

    # mc "Ability: I can't lie."
    mc "能力：不能说谎。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1653
translate schinese story01_3_6ef48178:

    # mc "Otherwise, just your average talentless clown with a bad sense of humor."
    mc "其余方面，就是个没天赋、幽默感还差的小丑。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1656
translate schinese story01_3_3a0bf794:

    # an "N-no... d-don't talk about yourself like that..."
    an "不、不……别、别那样说自己……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1657
translate schinese story01_3_043e749b:

    # an "J-just... uh... have a l-little more confidence, y'know?"
    an "就、就是……呃……多、多一点自信啦。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1658
translate schinese story01_3_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1668
translate schinese story01_3_ec1546f0:

    # an "Wh-wh-what are ya..."
    an "你、你要干什……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1669
translate schinese story01_3_d20cc8cf:

    # an "S-stop..."
    an "住、住手……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1670
translate schinese story01_3_e2ebdfec:

    # an "Wh-why?"
    an "为、为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1673
translate schinese story01_3_9f4c16b0:

    # mc "Ever get the feeling your life depends on something?"
    mc "有没有过那种“人生就取决于某件事”的感觉？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1674
translate schinese story01_3_6fab3ede:

    # mc "'Cause just now, I felt like I'd die from cuteness if I didn't pat your head."
    mc "因为刚才我有一种冲动——不摸一下你的头，我会因为太可爱而死掉。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1676
translate schinese story01_3_a851a194:

    # an "D-don't m-make fun of me..."
    an "别、别取笑我……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1677
translate schinese story01_3_596badb5:

    # an "I-I may be kinda n-nervous, b-but I'm n-not stupid..."
    an "我、我只是有点紧、紧张，但、但我不蠢……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1680
translate schinese story01_3_b82d8798:

    # r "(Am I doin' this right?)"
    r "（我这样算是对了吗？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1681
translate schinese story01_3_5cdb95f4:

    # r "(Pretty sure that's what he did.)"
    r "（应该是这个意思吧。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1682
translate schinese story01_3_a7a212ef:

    # r "(Still feels kinda weird, though.)"
    r "（不过还是怪怪的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1684
translate schinese story01_3_d27c1831:

    # r "I'm with Alice on this one."
    r "这点上我站艾丽西亚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1685
translate schinese story01_3_71cc698f:

    # r "Life might be shitty, but that ain't a reason to tear yourself down."
    r "日子再烂，也不是否定自己的理由。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1686
translate schinese story01_3_9923f000:

    # r "Ma always said: ya become what ya keep tellin' yourself ya are."
    r "我妈总说：你会变成你一直告诉自己的那个人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1689
translate schinese story01_3_f5cc62cc:

    # mc "Surprisingly, you and I have a lot in common."
    mc "没想到，你我之间有不少共同点。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1690
translate schinese story01_3_60415bf6:

    # r "(Don't get it... Why's she turnin' so red? 'Cause he patted her head?)"
    r "（搞不懂……她怎么脸这么红？因为他摸了她的头？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1693
translate schinese story01_3_c2afde5a:

    # r "Got a lot in common, huh? Maybe."
    r "共同点啊。也许吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1695
translate schinese story01_3_1bd0d269:

    # r "Name's Rose. Skill's super-analysis."
    r "我叫罗丝。技能是超级分析。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1698
translate schinese story01_3_1a17b0e0:

    # r "Long as this team ain't messin' with my scholarship, I'm in."
    r "只要这队不克扣我的奖学金，我就加入。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1700
translate schinese story01_3_9370e4a1:

    # mc "Super-analysis? What's that supposed to mean?"
    mc "超级分析？那是什么意思？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1702
translate schinese story01_3_a5db523f:

    # r "Any kind of calculations or network stuff. Don't matter what."
    r "各种计算或者网络方面的东西。什么类型都行。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1703
translate schinese story01_3_f3b1f7e9:

    # r "I can run through it in seconds."
    r "我几秒钟就能跑完。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1705
translate schinese story01_3_51e1171a:

    # mc "Like what you did with my phone?"
    mc "就像你对我手机做的那样？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1707
translate schinese story01_3_0eddebc0:

    # r "Somethin' like that, yeah."
    r "差不多吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1709
translate schinese story01_3_6743882a:

    # mc "Wait a second."
    mc "等一下。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1710
translate schinese story01_3_0158bdea:

    # mc "Abilities come from intense emotional experiences, right..."
    mc "能力来自强烈的情感经历，对吧……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1712
translate schinese story01_3_36dfb725:

    # r "What're ya gettin' at?"
    r "你想说什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1714
translate schinese story01_3_c9e809a0:

    # mc "But you're an android. How did you even get an ability?"
    mc "可你是安卓机器人。你哪来的能力？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1716
translate schinese story01_3_a8e80ff3:

    # r "Let's get one thing straight."
    r "有件事先说清楚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1717
translate schinese story01_3_be01ed28:

    # r "We ain't pokin' around in each other's personal lives. This is strictly business. Got it?"
    r "我们不打听对方的私生活。纯公事。明白？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1718
translate schinese story01_3_d5ae2301:

    # mc "Fair enough."
    mc "说得也是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1720
translate schinese story01_3_c868e390_2:

    # bot "..."
    bot "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1722
translate schinese story01_3_99cce269:

    # mc "(That leaves our final piece.)"
    mc "（那就剩最后一块拼图了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1730
translate schinese story01_3_f5fcfb08:

    # r "Hey, maybe we oughta turn around?"
    r "喂，我们要不要转个身？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1731
translate schinese story01_3_c447cb62:

    # r "Seen folks do that in movies all the time."
    r "电影里老这么演。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1732
translate schinese story01_3_6233b4db:

    # mc "(Movies? And she's the one lecturing me about personal boundaries?)"
    mc "（电影？刚才教训我别打听私生活的居然是她？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1735
translate schinese story01_3_d1b8b7de:

    # an "N-no... i-it's okay."
    an "不、不……没、没关系。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1736
translate schinese story01_3_8d40e023:

    # an "I-I can d-do it..."
    an "我、我可以做……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1737
translate schinese story01_3_55073871:

    # an "M-my name is... A-Alice."
    an "我、我叫……艾、艾丽西亚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1739
translate schinese story01_3_0b54fed2:

    # an "M-my ability is... K-killer."
    an "我、我的能力是……杀、杀人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1740
translate schinese story01_3_4c22be45:

    # an "I-I hope we can g-get along..."
    an "希、希望能和你们处、相处得好……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1758
translate schinese story01_3_089a371c:

    # bot "KILLER!?"
    bot "杀人犯？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1759
translate schinese story01_3_fcd249f7:

    # r "I ain't hearin' things, right? Killer?"
    r "我没听错吧？杀人犯？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1762
translate schinese story01_3_bee6ab7c:

    # mc "An android obsessed with money."
    mc "一个满脑子钱的安卓机器人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1764
translate schinese story01_3_16ca2ac2:

    # r "Honest clown."
    r "老实的小丑。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1766
translate schinese story01_3_2b88dd65:

    # mc "And a shy little assassin."
    mc "还有一个害羞的小刺客。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1767
translate schinese story01_3_f48c1420:

    # mc "The irony... What a dream team."
    mc "这反差……真是梦幻组合。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1768
translate schinese story01_3_824e23c2:

    # r "So... ya kill people?"
    r "所以……你杀人？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1770
translate schinese story01_3_1bc83834:

    # an "I-I can..."
    an "我、我能……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1771
translate schinese story01_3_82234c67:

    # an "B-but I usually t-try not to, y'know..."
    an "但、但我一般会、尽量不那样，你、你知道吧……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1773
translate schinese story01_3_6d72b5e6:

    # mc "So what exactly does your ability do?"
    mc "那你的能力具体是怎么用的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1775
translate schinese story01_3_edc596b0:

    # an "I... I-I think it'd be easier if I j-just showed you."
    an "我……我、我觉得还是直接演示给你看比较快。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1783
translate schinese story01_3_a7eacf1a:

    # an "A-and now you're d-dead..."
    an "现、现在你已经死、死了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1784
translate schinese story01_3_abe94e7b:

    # an "S-something like that."
    an "大、大概就是这样。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1785
translate schinese story01_3_55df4fd0:

    # mc "(You have got to be kidding me. Yesterday some crazy elf girl tried to carve me up, and now a cat girl...)"
    mc "（开玩笑吧。昨天还有个疯精灵姑娘想把我切片，现在又来个猫娘……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1786
translate schinese story01_3_3bccae9e:

    # mc "(Then again, to be fair, I kinda asked for it both times.)"
    mc "（不过话说回来，这两次某种程度上都是我自己找的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1789
translate schinese story01_3_4d46cea2:

    # r "Speed: nine hundred twenty-three kilometers an hour."
    r "速度：每小时九百二十三公里。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1790
translate schinese story01_3_7e462485:

    # r "Impressive. Damn near the speed of sound."
    r "了不得。都快赶上音速了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1793
translate schinese story01_3_5f47b933:

    # mc "Y-you know... next time, maybe don't put a needle to my throat."
    mc "你、你下次……能不能别把针顶在我脖子上。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1794
translate schinese story01_3_a1152b41:

    # mc "My will to live just made a miraculous recovery."
    mc "我求生的意志奇迹般地恢复了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1796
translate schinese story01_3_e352730a:

    # r "Needle to the throat works wonders."
    r "一针扎脖子上，疗效显著。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1799
translate schinese story01_3_db6291e4:

    # an "Ohhh... I-I'm s-soh-ry..."
    an "哦……我、我很抱歉……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1800
translate schinese story01_3_8ace349c:

    # an "I... I c-can't really control myself wh-when I get like that..."
    an "我……我、我真的控制不住自己那、那种时候……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1802
translate schinese story01_3_a75a132d:

    # mc "It's fine."
    mc "没关系。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1804
translate schinese story01_3_7c2089ed:

    # an "Y-you're not m-mad at me?"
    an "你、你不生我的气？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1807
translate schinese story01_3_610537f1:

    # mc "Mad about the needle? C'mon. Yesterday some terrifying elf girl nearly split my head in half with a katana."
    mc "为了那根针生气？得了吧。昨天一个吓人的精灵姑娘差点用太刀把我脑袋劈成两半。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1808
translate schinese story01_3_dbbb38af:

    # mc "Compared to that, this barely even counts."
    mc "跟那个比起来，这根本不算什么。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1810
translate schinese story01_3_c96de9bd:

    # an "Wh-what...?"
    an "什、什么……？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1811
translate schinese story01_3_d03e2d14:

    # an "A-and you're n-not scared?"
    an "而、而且你不害怕？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1812
translate schinese story01_3_1965633a:

    # an "I-I'll protect ya..."
    an "我、我会保护你的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1813
translate schinese story01_3_51b7c9cd:

    # an "I-I promise."
    an "我、我保证。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1814
translate schinese story01_3_40dc56e6:

    # r "(He ain't got a hero's strength. Makes that human strength of his all the more impressive.)"
    r "（他没有英雄的力量。正因如此，他那股凡人的劲儿才更让人刮目相看。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1816
translate schinese story01_3_b1495f6e:

    # mc "Alice, you don't have to. I can take care of myself."
    mc "艾丽西亚，不用这样。我能照顾好自己。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1817
translate schinese story01_3_ddc7cfec:

    # mc "(Last thing I need is a shy girl protecting me.)"
    mc "（我可不需要一个害羞的女孩来保护。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1819
translate schinese story01_3_4c49551f:

    # mc "Looks like we're... the last ones here."
    mc "看来我们是……最后剩下的了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1824
translate schinese story01_3_8860a3d3:

    # r "Not quite. Eight other groups. Twenty-four people total."
    r "不止。还有八个组。总共二十四个人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1826
translate schinese story01_3_1fa1b44e:

    # mc "Not bad. Thoughts on the situation?"
    mc "还不错。对眼下情况怎么看？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1828
translate schinese story01_3_d38f591e:

    # r "Shitty."
    r "一塌糊涂。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1829
translate schinese story01_3_288ff37b:

    # r "I was expectin' a walk in the park, not... whatever the hell all this is."
    r "我本来以为是公园散步，不是……现在这鬼样。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1832
translate schinese story01_3_42dfc55f:

    # r "(Lipstick's a little smudged. Eyeshadow still looks alright...)"
    r "（口红有点花了。眼影倒是还行……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1833
translate schinese story01_3_af09fb6b:

    # r "(Think it looks pretty good...)"
    r "（我觉得应该挺好看的……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1835
translate schinese story01_3_87ee3cc1:

    # mc "Y'know, there's one thing that's been bugging me."
    mc "你知道，有件事一直困扰我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1836
translate schinese story01_3_3ae18daf:

    # mc "Why do you wear makeup?"
    mc "你为什么要化妆？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1837
translate schinese story01_3_a3027d1e:

    # mc "Yeah, I know you told me to stay outta your personal life, but..."
    mc "是啊，你说过让我别打听你的私事，可是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1840
translate schinese story01_3_a4fab2fb:

    # r "Ya already know the answer. Don't test my patience."
    r "你心里已经有答案了。别考验我的耐心。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1841
translate schinese story01_3_37ec0306:

    # r "I'll help ya out, but do me a favor: shut it and stay outta my business."
    r "我帮你一把。但你欠我个人情：闭嘴，别管我的事。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1842
translate schinese story01_3_2fd5b00d:

    # r "(Damn it. Went a little outside the line 'cause of him.)"
    r "（该死。因为他多越了一点线。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1844
translate schinese story01_3_06f9cfb4:

    # an "U-um... R-Rose?"
    an "那、那个……罗、罗丝？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1845
translate schinese story01_3_89322dc8:

    # an "C-could I b-borrow—"
    an "能、能借一下——"

# game/story01en.rpy:1846
translate schinese story01_3_b190a890:

    # r "Compact mirror?"
    r "小化妆镜？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1847
translate schinese story01_3_8a4b4f88:

    # an "Y-yeah..."
    an "嗯、嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1849
translate schinese story01_3_72bad41f:

    # r "(Well, damn. Just like a real person!)"
    r "（嚯。还挺像个正常人的！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1850
translate schinese story01_3_989d51cf:

    # r "(More or less.)"
    r "（也差不多吧。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1852
translate schinese story01_3_e8e38ec1_4:

    # an "..."
    an "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1855
translate schinese story01_3_6b1e314e:

    # an "Th-thank ya..."
    an "谢、谢谢你……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1857
translate schinese story01_3_d93b1007:

    # an "(J-just a little touch-up...)"
    an "（就、就稍微补一下……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1858
translate schinese story01_3_c5946164:

    # an "(B-but... ohhh, I-I think it looks pretty good.)"
    an "（可、可是……哦，我觉得我看起来挺好看的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1859
translate schinese story01_3_84cfee77:

    # mc "(An android who cares about her looks... What an interesting world we live in.)"
    mc "（一个在意自己长相的安卓机器人……我们活在一个多有意思的世界啊。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1860
translate schinese story01_3_356c93ec:

    # mc "(Judging by that reaction, though, it really matters to her.)"
    mc "（不过看她那个反应，这事对她真的很重要。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1862
translate schinese story01_3_fab39a23:

    # mc "(Gotta admit, I'm a little curious why, but...)"
    mc "（说真的，我有点好奇为什么，不过……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1863
translate schinese story01_3_da7641ae:

    # mc "(Eh. Maybe I'll get a chance to ask someday.)"
    mc "（算了。也许哪天会有机会问。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1865
translate schinese story01_3_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1870
translate schinese story01_3_bfd0dd3a:

    # mc "Can I borrow your lipstick?"
    mc "你的口红能借我用一下吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1873
translate schinese story01_3_9d73a399:

    # Mi "Even knowin' you wear make-up, hearin' that from a lad's still a bit creepy."
    Mi "明知道你有化妆，从一个小伙子嘴里听到这话还是有点怪。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1875
translate schinese story01_3_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1877
translate schinese story01_3_c94b5cee:

    # Mi "I can see it in your eyes. You don't much like me."
    Mi "我从你眼睛里看得出来。你不太喜欢我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1878
translate schinese story01_3_3083e387:

    # Mi "Not that I give a damn."
    Mi "我可不在乎。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1879
translate schinese story01_3_6e698aab:

    # Mi "And I won't be goin' easy on ya just 'cause of my daughter."
    Mi "我也不会因为我女儿就对你手下留情。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1881
translate schinese story01_3_0f049e54:

    # mc "Wow. You really have a talent for sneaking up on people."
    mc "哇。你还真是擅长突然出现在别人背后。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1882
translate schinese story01_3_92aaa280:

    # mc "Still, there's one thing I don't get. How the hell did you become a hero?"
    mc "不过有件事我还是想不通。你到底是怎么当上英雄的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1883
translate schinese story01_3_6a7ff648:

    # mc "You look more like a villain who wandered onto the wrong set."
    mc "你看起来更像是走错片场的反派。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1884
translate schinese story01_3_da3fdbf1_1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1886
translate schinese story01_3_dae13390:

    # an "M-mom?"
    an "妈、妈妈？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1887
translate schinese story01_3_86cd25c8:

    # mc "(She's not taking me seriously at all...)"
    mc "（她根本没把我当回事……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1897
translate schinese story01_3_1ecec072:

    # Mi "(Oh, I've been waitin' for this moment...)"
    Mi "（哦，我一直在等这一刻……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1899
translate schinese story01_3_d702e193:

    # Mi "There's my precious girl!"
    Mi "我的宝贝女儿！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1900
translate schinese story01_3_c0d4d17c:

    # Mi "But what're you doin' here?!"
    Mi "可你怎么会在这儿？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1902
translate schinese story01_3_acffe900:

    # an "I-I... wanted to surprise ya..."
    an "我、我……想给你个惊喜……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1903
translate schinese story01_3_fb2b0369:

    # mc "Give me back my phone."
    mc "把我的手机还我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1905
translate schinese story01_3_8f990da7:

    # Mi "Why, sweetheart?"
    Mi "怎么了，宝贝？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1906
translate schinese story01_3_538b5096:

    # Mi "This place'll swallow you whole."
    Mi "这个地方会把你整个吞下去。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1907
translate schinese story01_3_52c996e5:

    # Mi "It'll tear apart everythin' you love."
    Mi "它会撕碎你的一切。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1909
translate schinese story01_3_5b2ce0ef:

    # mc "My phone?"
    mc "我的手机？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1911
translate schinese story01_3_ebee5cd5:

    # Mi "Choose somewhere else."
    Mi "换个地方吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1912
translate schinese story01_3_f88dc56a:

    # Mi "Please, love."
    Mi "求你了，宝贝。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1914
translate schinese story01_3_b3c0b2f3:

    # an "S-stop treatin' me like I'm a little kid."
    an "别、再把我当小孩子了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1915
translate schinese story01_3_730453b6:

    # an "I'm not a child anymore, Mom!"
    an "我已经不是小孩子了，妈！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1916
translate schinese story01_3_315612ee:

    # an "...a-and not in front of them."
    an "……而、而且别当着他们的面。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1917
translate schinese story01_3_bacabc9b:

    # an "I-it's embarrassing..."
    an "很、很丢人的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1920
translate schinese story01_3_3bf74a7e:

    # mc "Hello? My phone?"
    mc "喂？我的手机呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1922
translate schinese story01_3_1e30496d:

    # Mi "We've already talked about this, sweetheart..."
    Mi "宝贝，我们刚才说过了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:1923
translate schinese story01_3_e2548154:

    # Mi "This Academy'll take everythin' you hold dear!"
    Mi "这所学院会夺走你珍视的一切！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1926
translate schinese story01_3_fa5f24aa:

    # mc "Yeah, this family drama's fascinating and all—"
    mc "是是，你们这家庭剧挺精彩的——"

# game/story01en.rpy:1927
translate schinese story01_3_7de212d6:

    # mc "but would you kindly give me my phone back?"
    mc "不过能不能麻烦你把我手机还我？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1929
translate schinese story01_3_8ad2aae7:

    # Mi "Can't ya see I'm talkin' to my daughter?"
    Mi "没看见我在跟我女儿说话吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1931
translate schinese story01_3_a66fdeff:

    # mc "Oh, really? Good for you. Except, unless somebody missed the memo, my phone is still in her pocket."
    mc "哦，真的吗？那你可真是走运。除非有人错过了通知，我的手机还在她口袋里。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1932
translate schinese story01_3_7dc43607:

    # mc "And somehow, that somebody looks an awful lot like you."
    mc "而那个人，碰巧长得跟你挺像。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1935
translate schinese story01_3_67da6de2:

    # mc "I'm not leaving you alone until you give back what belongs to me!"
    mc "你不把我东西还我，我就不走！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1940
translate schinese story01_3_3ecc5aae:

    # r "Just a reminder: Article Three, Clause Twenty-Seven. Stealin' somebody's personal property is a criminal offense."
    r "提醒一下：第三条第二十七款。偷走他人私人物品属刑事犯罪。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1941
translate schinese story01_3_abd835ec:

    # r "Especially for heroes. And since we got your heartfelt confession on record, kindly—"
    r "英雄尤其适用。而我们手上有你情真意切的认罪记录，所以麻烦你——"

# game/story01en.rpy:1942
translate schinese story01_3_0310da94:

    # r "Give him back his phone."
    r "把手机还给他。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1945
translate schinese story01_3_835a5729:

    # an "S-stop e-embarrassing me, M-Mom!"
    an "别、别让我这么丢人了，妈、妈妈！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1946
translate schinese story01_3_1f34bb58:

    # an "A-and give him his phone back!"
    an "还、还有把手机还给他！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1952
translate schinese story01_3_8d58918e:

    # mc "(Barely caught it. She tossed it like it was nothing, but it damn near tore my arm off.)"
    mc "（勉强接住了。她扔得轻描淡写，可差点把我整条胳膊拽脱臼。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1954
translate schinese story01_3_d89d64e8:

    # mc "(Better be careful around h—)"
    mc "（接下来在她面前可得小——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1955
translate schinese story01_3_7dc94aa8:

    # Mi "You."
    Mi "你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1956
translate schinese story01_3_fb5aee9d:

    # Mi "You're responsible for Alice."
    Mi "艾丽西亚交给你负责。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1957
translate schinese story01_3_46d501fe:

    # Mi "If anythin' happens to her, you'll have only yourself to bl—"
    Mi "她要是出了任何事，就怪你自己——"

# game/story01en.rpy:1966
translate schinese story01_3_701f23f4:

    # mc "Whoa, whoa. Time-out."
    mc "喂喂，打住。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1967
translate schinese story01_3_80090af3:

    # mc "Before you start making demands, let's clear something up."
    mc "在你开始提条件之前，有件事得先说清楚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1970
translate schinese story01_3_ceeca26c:

    # mc "First!"
    mc "第一！"

# game/story01en.rpy:1971
translate schinese story01_3_9057fbef:

    # mc "Yeah, we're a team. But I ain't carrying everyone on my back."
    mc "是，我们是一队。但我没打算把所有人都扛在背上。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1973
translate schinese story01_3_10054cfd:

    # mc "No offense. We barely know each other."
    mc "不是针对谁。我们才刚认识。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1975
translate schinese story01_3_9e7ca3e8:

    # r "Don't worry. Feelin's mutual."
    r "放心。我也有同感。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1979
translate schinese story01_3_225c777a:

    # an "Mhm."
    an "嗯。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1982
translate schinese story01_3_431cd92d:

    # mc "Second."
    mc "第二。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1984
translate schinese story01_3_e08423fb:

    # mc "What exactly do you mean by 'if something happens to her'?"
    mc "你说的“她要是出了事”，到底什么意思？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1986
translate schinese story01_3_28cfdd1a:

    # Mi "Pardon?"
    Mi "你说什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:1988
translate schinese story01_3_bb79d369:

    # mc "You were trying way too hard to keep Alice outta this Academy."
    mc "你之前拼命想把艾丽西亚拦在这所学院外面。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1989
translate schinese story01_3_9646dd31:

    # mc "And that's giving me some interesting ideas."
    mc "这倒是给了我一些有意思的想法。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1992
translate schinese story01_3_d8a4f00f:

    # mc "And one question: what's wrong with this place? 'Cause apparently, a whole crowd of arrogant asshol—"
    mc "还有个问题：这地方有什么不对的？毕竟显然有一大群自大的混——"

# game/story01en.rpy:1993
translate schinese story01_3_bb00c2e0:

    # mc "I mean, heroes and their sugar dad—"
    mc "我是说，英雄和他们的干爹——"

# game/story01en.rpy:1994
translate schinese story01_3_6a84996c:

    # r "(You're doin' that on purpose.)"
    r "（你是故意的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:1995
translate schinese story01_3_aefe8df9:

    # mc "Oh, my apologies. Their parents. Apparently, those aren't enough."
    mc "哦，抱歉。是他们的父母。显然这还不够。"

# game/story01en.rpy:1997
translate schinese story01_3_b0621e31:

    # Mi "Hmph..."
    Mi "哼……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2000
translate schinese story01_3_517fd9d5:

    # Mi "Who knows?"
    Mi "谁知道呢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2001
translate schinese story01_3_672ade2f:

    # mc "YOU DO!"
    mc "你知道！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2002
translate schinese story01_3_8054cc70:

    # Mi "Get my little girl through the exams..."
    Mi "帮我女儿通过考试……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2003
translate schinese story01_3_b69dfa9e:

    # Mi "Then we'll talk."
    Mi "再说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2006
translate schinese story01_3_16416633:

    # mc "(Irritating woman. Although, if I figure out the right way to deal with her...)"
    mc "（烦人的女人。不过，要是我能想出对付她的正确方法……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:2008
translate schinese story01_3_51621825:

    # r "First off, what the hell was that?"
    r "首先，刚才那是怎么回事？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2009
translate schinese story01_3_d837d445:

    # r "Second, no offense, Alice, but your ma's kinda outta her mind."
    r "其次，不是针对你，艾丽西亚，但你妈脑子有点不太正常。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2011
translate schinese story01_3_d1e05bc7:

    # mc "Rude. But fair."
    mc "话说得难听。"
    mc "不过倒也没错。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2012
translate schinese story01_3_44b6c332:

    # mc "Alice, what did she mean by that last part?"
    mc "艾丽西亚，她最后那句是什么意思？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2022
translate schinese story01_3_63415c96:

    # mc "You don't know either, huh?"
    mc "你也不知道？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2030
translate schinese story01_3_78d01aa7:

    # mc "(Maybe it has something to do with the final stage of the exam.)"
    mc "（也许跟最后一场试炼有关。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:2032
translate schinese story01_3_2d02c5b2:

    # mc "Alright, alright! We'll figure that out later. For now, onward to conquer the Academy!"
    mc "好了好了！这个以后再说。现在，向学院进发！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2034
translate schinese story01_3_4c1e7dda:

    # mc "Forward!"
    mc "前进！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2036
translate schinese story01_3_c868e390_3:

    # bot "..."
    bot "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2048
translate schinese story01_4_3657e683:

    # "A few minutes later, in the hallway leading to the interview rooms."
    "几分钟后，通往面试室的走廊。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2051
translate schinese story01_4_c0c32eef:

    # r "Mind tellin' me what the hell we're starin' at?"
    r "说说我们到底在看什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2052
translate schinese story01_4_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2055
translate schinese story01_4_d825785a:

    # mc "It's beautiful..."
    mc "太美了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2057
translate schinese story01_4_cbf0114c:

    # r "Hold up. Why're ya cryin'?"
    r "等等。你哭什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2058
translate schinese story01_4_3c130cc5:

    # mc "It's..."
    mc "这是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2060
translate schinese story01_4_d6432e3f:

    # mc "An absolute masterpiece..."
    mc "堪称杰作……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2061
translate schinese story01_4_d69f4d21:

    # mc "The men in these portraits are legends. Every last one of 'em."
    mc "这些画里的人都是传奇。一个都不例外。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2063
translate schinese story01_4_86e5678f:

    # r "Are they? Look like regular half-naked dudes to me."
    r "是吗？在我看来就是一群普通的半裸男。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2064
translate schinese story01_4_597946a0:

    # r "But hey, ain't my place to judge what you're into."
    r "不过话说回来，我不该评价你的喜好。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2066
translate schinese story01_4_c83ccde7:

    # an "Wh-what are ya talking about...?"
    an "你、你在说什么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2067
translate schinese story01_4_7bcba812:

    # r "Nothin' much. Just tryin' to kill some time."
    r "没什么。就是在打发时间。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2070
translate schinese story01_4_844dab80:

    # mc "(Guess even heroes can't escape standing in line...)"
    mc "（看来连英雄也逃不过排队……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:2071
translate schinese story01_4_05777a0b:

    # mc "(Twenty-three minutes already.)"
    mc "（已经二十三分钟了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:2073
translate schinese story01_4_933fff17:

    # an "Th-then..."
    an "那、那么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2074
translate schinese story01_4_d3a16623:

    # an "U-um... s-soh-ry, [mc]..."
    an "那、那个……对、对不起，[mc]……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2075
translate schinese story01_4_27eef16f:

    # an "C-can I ask ya something?"
    an "我、我能问你一件事吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2077
translate schinese story01_4_34f653ed:

    # mc "Hm? Shoot."
    mc "嗯？说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2078
translate schinese story01_4_d6c9859d:

    # mc "Just keep it simple. Clown, remember?"
    mc "简单点。别忘了，我是个小丑。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2080
translate schinese story01_4_725ff3a2:

    # an "I-I'll try."
    an "我、我试试。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2081
translate schinese story01_4_d5953a46:

    # mc "So what's the question?"
    mc "那问题是什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2082
translate schinese story01_4_07878346:

    # an "I-it's about your face..."
    an "是、是关于你的脸……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2083
translate schinese story01_4_67f6b4d4:

    # an "Wh-why do ya wear makeup?"
    an "你、你为什么化妆？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2085
translate schinese story01_4_f838e29e:

    # r "Yeah, I'm curious too."
    r "我也好奇。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2089
translate schinese story01_4_f41a02ce:

    # r "Alright, ain't that curious anymore."
    r "算了，我不好奇了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2090
translate schinese story01_4_802b2cfa:

    # r "What the hell happened to your face?"
    r "你脸上到底发生了什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2100
translate schinese story01_4_a8a8ea93:

    # mc "Part of my ability. It doesn't work properly without the makeup."
    mc "是我能力的一部分。不化妆就没法正常运作。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2101
translate schinese story01_4_33c4c42d:

    # r "Got it."
    r "知道了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2102
translate schinese story01_4_b2d46f84:

    # r "Alright, the face I can wrap my head around."
    r "好，这个我还能理解。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2103
translate schinese story01_4_c200dc85:

    # r "But why're ya naked?"
    r "那你为什么光着身子？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2104
translate schinese story01_4_b77eb169:

    # mc "It's complicated."
    mc "说来话长。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2105
translate schinese story01_4_e18056bd:

    # r "And where'd all that muscle with music come from?"
    r "那你这一身肌肉和刚才哼的歌又是从哪来的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2106
translate schinese story01_4_f2ba1d8b:

    # mc "Told you. Complicated."
    mc "说过了。说来话长。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2108
translate schinese story01_4_e13dae36:

    # r "And what d'ya mean by “not properly”?"
    r "那你说的“没法正常运作”又是什么意思？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2109
translate schinese story01_4_25dd01c4:

    # mc "Remind me what you said earlier."
    mc "提醒我一下你之前说的话。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2110
translate schinese story01_4_b7e5f2bb:

    # mc "No digging into each other's personal lives. Your words, remember?"
    mc "不打听对方的私生活。是你的原话，记得吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2115
translate schinese story01_4_60ec4627:

    # r "Yeah, those were my words. Which makes this sting even worse."
    r "是我的原话。所以才更让人不爽。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2117
translate schinese story01_4_a29c9dad:

    # r "(Whispering) ...ain't a fan of havin' my own strategy used against me."
    r "（低声）……我可不喜欢自己的招数被人拿来对付自己。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2119
translate schinese story01_4_f1840681:

    # an "S-so... y-your ability..."
    an "那、那么……你、你的能力……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2120
translate schinese story01_4_078186c0:

    # an "I-is it trickin' people's senses?"
    an "是、是能让人的感官产生错觉吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2122
translate schinese story01_4_25232196:

    # r "Trickin' the senses? An illusion?"
    r "感官欺骗？幻象？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2123
translate schinese story01_4_31828b53:

    # mc "*Sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/story01en.rpy:2124
translate schinese story01_4_22730cf4:

    # mc "That's the one."
    mc "就是那个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2125
translate schinese story01_4_56785fc8:

    # r "Hold up, seriously?"
    r "等等，真的假的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2127
translate schinese story01_4_5204f088:

    # an "Oh... wh-what rank is your ability?"
    an "哦……你、你的能力是什么等级？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2128
translate schinese story01_4_674a41ba:

    # mc "Ranks, huh..."
    mc "等级啊……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2129
translate schinese story01_4_19a3c773:

    # mc "Relatively speaking, I'm somewhere between an ant and a beetle."
    mc "这么说吧，我的水平大概介于蚂蚁和甲虫之间。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2130
translate schinese story01_4_42eebcac:

    # mc "Leaning heavily toward the ant."
    mc "而且更接近蚂蚁。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2131
translate schinese story01_4_6ebbb76a:

    # an "I... I-I don't get it."
    an "我……我、我不明白。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2134
translate schinese story01_4_07bfced0:

    # r "He's sayin' he ain't much different from a regular person."
    r "他的意思是，他跟普通人差不了多少。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2137
translate schinese story01_4_3edede3a:

    # r "My guess? E-rank. Maybe D."
    r "我猜？E级吧。可能D级。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2138
translate schinese story01_4_e8c14daf:

    # r "If I'm rememberin' right, illusionists sit pretty low on the list."
    r "如果我没记错，幻术师在榜上排名相当靠后。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2141
translate schinese story01_4_21b4063b:

    # r "Yep, there it is. C-rank's the ceiling, and even that's like winnin' the lottery."
    r "就在那儿。C级就是天花板了，而且那还得靠中彩票。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2143
translate schinese story01_4_561e5a0c:

    # r "But knowin' even part of the side effects his ability's got..."
    r "可既然连他能力的一部分副作用都知道了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2144
translate schinese story01_4_adf8eb71:

    # r "Yeah, no. This whole situation's a dead end."
    r "算了。这事没戏。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2146
translate schinese story01_4_b597e196:

    # r "I'm leanin' toward E."
    r "我还是倾向E级。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2147
translate schinese story01_4_f04a418d:

    # mc "Oh, I'm flattered. You think so highly of me."
    mc "哦，真荣幸。你这么看得起我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2149
translate schinese story01_4_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2162
translate schinese story01_4_170e8466:

    # r "Hold up... ya ain't..."
    r "等等……你不是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2163
translate schinese story01_4_22730cf4_1:

    # mc "That's the one."
    mc "就是那个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2165
translate schinese story01_4_11133c25:

    # r "You're kiddin' me?!"
    r "你开什么玩笑？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2167
translate schinese story01_4_b8f16a8b:

    # an "Wh-what are ya talking about?"
    an "你、你们在说什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2168
translate schinese story01_4_d7342811:

    # mc "I'm F-rank. Won the lottery."
    mc "我是F级。中彩票了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2171
translate schinese story01_4_55f06991:

    # r "Damn. You really are one lucky bastard..."
    r "见鬼。你还真是走运到家了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2173
translate schinese story01_4_07edeb04:

    # r "(Accordin' to my analysis, the odds of runnin' into an F-rank are damn near zero.)"
    r "（按我的分析，碰见F级的概率几乎为零。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:2174
translate schinese story01_4_2f7457ff:

    # r "(And the odds of one landin' on my team? Don't even get me started.)"
    r "（而这种概率落到我队里的？别提了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:2175
translate schinese story01_4_2b3d6a8d:

    # mc "Go on. I can see it in your eyes. This is eating you alive."
    mc "说吧。我看你眼神就知道，这事快把你逼疯了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2177
translate schinese story01_4_90d2a1f0:

    # r "There are about two billion people in the world."
    r "世界上大约有二十亿人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2178
translate schinese story01_4_e16bebef:

    # r "Roughly two million registered heroes."
    r "注册英雄大约两百万。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2179
translate schinese story01_4_e66bde8a:

    # r "A-rank heroes make up only 3.2 percent of them."
    r "A级英雄只占其中的百分之三点二。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2180
translate schinese story01_4_d617df66:

    # r "F-ranks..."
    r "F级……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2181
translate schinese story01_4_2b8bd039:

    # r "Twenty. Worldwide."
    r "全世界二十个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2182
translate schinese story01_4_60b4e419:

    # an "T-twenty...?"
    an "二、二十个……？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2185
translate schinese story01_4_089a69de:

    # r "Twenty registered F-ranks outta two million heroes."
    r "两百万英雄里，只有二十个注册F级。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2186
translate schinese story01_4_29882bef:

    # r "That's zero point zero zero one percent."
    r "那就是百分之零点零零零一。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2187
translate schinese story01_4_042729b3:

    # r "One in a hundred thousand heroes."
    r "十万英雄里才有一个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2189
translate schinese story01_4_3a0076b3:

    # r "And now my program's glitchin'. Am I the lucky one here, or are you just that damn unlucky?"
    r "现在我的程序都出错了。所以到底是我运气好，还是你倒霉到家？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2191
translate schinese story01_4_78209b8f:

    # mc "How ironic. The worst rank in the world is rarer than the best one."
    mc "真讽刺。全世界最差的等级反而比最好的还稀有。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2193
translate schinese story01_4_af9c09e2:

    # r "Ya didn't answer the question."
    r "你还没回答我的问题。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2196
translate schinese story01_4_f8334147:

    # mc "Oh, c'mon. What exactly do you expect me to say?"
    mc "哎哎哎。你到底想让我怎么说？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2197
translate schinese story01_4_a8b58182:

    # mc "Mom always told me I was special. Just... from the wrong end of the list."
    mc "我妈总说我很特别。只是……特别在榜单的错那头。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2198
translate schinese story01_4_970645ab:

    # mc "Gotta admit, it's got a certain charm."
    mc "不得不说，还挺有味道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2201
translate schinese story01_4_5021f6b8:

    # r "But hold on. Think about it for a second..."
    r "但等等。你先想一秒……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2202
translate schinese story01_4_8a3d4049:

    # r "If an A-rank ability counts as a strategic weapon..."
    r "如果A级能力算战略武器的话……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2203
translate schinese story01_4_40592259:

    # r "Then yours... ya literally ain't any better than a regular person?!"
    r "那你的……你真的一点都不比普通人强？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2206
translate schinese story01_4_51facaef:

    # mc "Ding-ding! We have a winner!"
    mc "叮咚！答案揭晓！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2208
translate schinese story01_4_ee98a720:

    # mc "What, you got a problem with that?"
    mc "怎么，你有意见？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2210
translate schinese story01_4_b9b755e5_1:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2211
translate schinese story01_4_3332c218:

    # an "B-but..."
    an "可、可……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2213
translate schinese story01_4_e83fad5f:

    # an "B-but... th-that's even more amazing."
    an "可、可……那不是更厉害了吗。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2214
translate schinese story01_4_2e811e94:

    # an "D-don't ya think?"
    an "你、你不觉得吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2217
translate schinese story01_4_5af2b34a:

    # an "I-if the odds reeeally are that low..."
    an "如、如果概率真那么低的话……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2218
translate schinese story01_4_d1aa486a:

    # an "Th-then we m-must be awfully l-lucky!"
    an "那、那我们一定超级幸运！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2220
translate schinese story01_4_4639c2ae:

    # mc "You really think so?"
    mc "你真这么想？"

# game/story01en.rpy:2222
translate schinese story01_4_a8e1cd4b:

    # mc "Careful with the compliments. I might get used to 'em."
    mc "夸人小心点。我会习惯的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:2224
translate schinese story01_4_2bb3e632:

    # an "N-no! I-I mean it!"
    an "不、不！我是认真的！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2225
translate schinese story01_4_a081180a:

    # an "Y-you're amazing!"
    an "你、你很厉害！"

# game/story01en.rpy:2227
translate schinese story01_4_ffab1c86:

    # an "I-I'm soh-ry if th-that sounded like I was m-making fun of ya..."
    an "对、对不起，如果那听起来像是在取笑你的话……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2228
translate schinese story01_4_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:2230
translate schinese story01_4_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

