    r "有件事我想说清楚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3622
translate schinese story01_7_e64f66a3:

    # r "That alright with ya?"
    r "你不介意吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3624
translate schinese story01_7_af353eb6:

    # mc "Go ahead."
    mc "说吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3626
translate schinese story01_7_5ad8f911:

    # r "It's... about the woman who created me."
    r "是……关于创造我的那个女人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3627
translate schinese story01_7_e1d8ff45:

    # r "And the one I'm tryin' to take care of now."
    r "以及我现在正在照顾的那一个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3630
translate schinese story01_7_8b9e6ab3:

    # mc "Your mother?"
    mc "你母亲？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3632
translate schinese story01_7_be813540:

    # r "Somethin' like that."
    r "差不多吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3636
translate schinese story01_7_76cd36d7:

    # r "Tell me... can a robot have feelings?"
    r "告诉我……机器人能有感情吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3638
translate schinese story01_7_22f11caa:

    # mc "After today? Kinda hard to doubt."
    mc "经历今天之后？很难不信。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3639
translate schinese story01_7_d9c6a6ae:

    # mc "How do I put this... Are you human?"
    mc "我该怎么说……你是人吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3640
translate schinese story01_7_4df13ca5:

    # mc "Well, you sure don't seem any different from one. Maybe a little smarter."
    mc "你跟人还真看不出什么区别。也许还聪明那么一点点。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3642
translate schinese story01_7_c9d4dcae:

    # r "Ya really think so?"
    r "你真这么想？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3645
translate schinese story01_7_d0d915f5:

    # mc "I can't lie, but I could give it a shot if you'd like."
    mc "我说不了谎，不过你要是愿意，我可以试试。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3648
translate schinese story01_7_f035bc8b:

    # r "I'd pay good money to watch ya try."
    r "我愿意花大价钱看你表演。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3649
translate schinese story01_7_c0a38b96:

    # r "By the way, is that a side effect of your skill? Or..."
    r "对了，那是你技能的副作用吗？还是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3652
translate schinese story01_7_a79a83fa:

    # mc "More or less. But what's with the question about feelings?"
    mc "差不多吧。不过你突然问感情是怎么回事？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3654
translate schinese story01_7_b9b755e5_3:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3656
translate schinese story01_7_5eeeedc6:

    # r "I ain't got feelings."
    r "我没有感情。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3660
translate schinese story01_7_5971a4c7:

    # mc "Then what're we doing here?"
    mc "那我们在这儿干嘛？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3662
translate schinese story01_7_d0c8808b:

    # r "That's the problem. I don't know..."
    r "问题就在这儿。我不知道……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3666
translate schinese story01_7_93e3575d:

    # mc "You like beer, right?"
    mc "你喜欢啤酒，对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3667
translate schinese story01_7_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3669
translate schinese story01_7_4565f1de:

    # r "I don't like beer."
    r "我不喜欢啤酒。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3670
translate schinese story01_7_fdc4a98b:

    # r "But when I drink it, my optics start goin' haywire."
    r "可一喝，我的视觉系统就开始出故障。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3671
translate schinese story01_7_69926b5a:

    # r "And I see Ma. Young, healthy, and..."
    r "然后我就看见我妈。年轻的、健康的，还有……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3675
translate schinese story01_7_a653df1a:

    # mc "That's called feelings."
    mc "那就叫感情。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3676
translate schinese story01_7_60cdf3ab:

    # mc "Sure sounds like 'em, anyway."
    mc "反正听起来就是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3677
translate schinese story01_7_adc02c61:

    # mc "Speaking of which... Is that why you got so mad about the beer?"
    mc "话说回来……所以你刚才才那么为啤酒发火？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3679
translate schinese story01_7_91066a2e:

    # r "Ain't sure, but..."
    r "不确定，不过……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3683
translate schinese story01_7_bbab8602:

    # r "[mc]?"
    r "[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3686
translate schinese story01_7_83da6a72:

    # r "About that punch earlier..."
    r "关于刚才那一拳……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3687
translate schinese story01_7_6fb7a72c:

    # r "I'm sorry."
    r "对不起。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3689
translate schinese story01_7_d5a411b3:

    # mc "Forget it. I'm not mad."
    mc "算了。我没生气。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3690
translate schinese story01_7_7bea8899:

    # mc "Lena's kicked me way harder plenty of times. I've built up an immunity."
    mc "莉娜踢我比你狠多了。我早就免疫了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3692
translate schinese story01_7_1a7d45c3:

    # r "So... we square?"
    r "所以……我们扯平了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3694
translate schinese story01_7_c269a004:

    # mc "Not quite."
    mc "还不算。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3695
translate schinese story01_7_ca76a530:

    # mc "Let's make a deal. If something bothers you, tell me."
    mc "我们做个约定。有什么事让你不舒服，就告诉我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3697
translate schinese story01_7_d49ac393:

    # r "I... alright."
    r "我……好吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3700
translate schinese story01_7_797c339e:

    # r "By the way, what's that?"
    r "对了，那是什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3702
translate schinese story01_7_e0523bef:

    # mc "Oh, that? Just a little mood lighting. Nothing important."
    mc "哦，那个？只是点氛围灯。没什么重要的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3704
translate schinese story01_7_6fb04d89:

    # mc "Wanna go?"
    mc "要去吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3706
translate schinese story01_7_555666ff:

    # r "Yeah."
    r "嗯。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3715
translate schinese story01_7_bd74b940:

    # r "(Whispering) Y'know, that talk wasn't half bad."
    r "（低声）你知道吗，刚才那番谈话还挺不错。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3716
translate schinese story01_7_7bb6876e:

    # r "(Whispering) Maybe... we could do that more often?"
    r "（低声）也许……我们可以多来几次？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3717
translate schinese story01_7_56c3991c:

    # mc "Why not?"
    mc "为什么不呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3720
translate schinese story01_7_09ade6b5:

    # L "And there he is! Our hero returns!"
    L "啊，那边！我们的英雄回来啦！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3721
translate schinese story01_7_2920df4e:

    # L "Alright, what took you two so long?"
    L "说吧，你们俩磨蹭什么呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3724
translate schinese story01_7_d8dc57cb:

    # mc "Just a heart-to-heart."
    mc "谈心而已。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3725
translate schinese story01_7_c8bafc02:

    # mc "We had a couple things to clear up between us."
    mc "我们之间有几件事要说清楚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3727
translate schinese story01_7_b52af642:

    # L "...but whatever. Alicia filled me in on most of it."
    L "……算了。艾丽西亚已经跟我说得差不多了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3728
translate schinese story01_7_f6287248:

    # L "Mia's always been a real bitc—"
    L "米娅一直都很讨人厌——"

# game/story01en.rpy:3731
translate schinese story01_7_9f92a837:

    # mc "Whoa, whoa. No insults."
    mc "喂喂。不许骂人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3733
translate schinese story01_7_9c821542:

    # L "Who are you, and what've you done with [mc]?"
    L "你是谁？把[mc]弄到哪儿去了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3738
translate schinese story01_7_0331aac8:

    # mc "Bit late, I admit..."
    mc "我承认，是晚了点……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3739
translate schinese story01_7_6d406a91:

    # mc "Ladies! Allow me to introduce Alice!"
    mc "女士们！请允许我介绍艾丽西亚！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3740
translate schinese story01_7_d8aed884:

    # mc "Daughter of the Beast herself!"
    mc "“东境猛兽”本人的千金！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3742
translate schinese story01_7_8353f661:

    # L "Alright. Which of the three daughters are ya?"
    L "好。你是三姐妹里的哪一个？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3744
translate schinese story01_7_c08fd374:

    # an "I-I'm the y-youngest..."
    an "我、我是最小那个……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3745
translate schinese story01_7_3f52bc85:

    # L "Got it."
    L "知道了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3747
translate schinese story01_7_ffc17102:

    # L "So. What's your plan for tomorrow?"
    L "那么。明天的计划是什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3749
translate schinese story01_7_aee32209:

    # mc "We'll talk about tomorrow when it gets here."
    mc "等明天来了再说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3750
translate schinese story01_7_92e5b0ca:

    # mc "Still gotta survive the written exam first."
    mc "不过首先还得熬过笔试。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3751
translate schinese story01_7_893d0406:

    # L "It's easy. No harder than the entrance exam."
    L "很简单。比入学考试还简单。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3753
translate schinese story01_7_3f6465cd:

    # L "By the way, how many points have you gotten so far?"
    L "对了，你们现在多少分？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3756
translate schinese story01_7_e4b5d462:

    # mc "Enough. Probably. No clue."
    mc "够了吧。大概。不知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3757
translate schinese story01_7_8ed182b2:

    # mc "Thought they were gonna announce the scores at the end."
    mc "我还以为他们会在最后公布分数。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3760
translate schinese story01_7_acb2b0ff:

    # mc "By the way, what're you doing?"
    mc "对了，你在干嘛？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3762
translate schinese story01_7_1fac9bd8:

    # L "Y'know, today's been pretty exhausting..."
    L "你知道吧，今天挺累的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3763
translate schinese story01_7_64cb0fc9:

    # L "Think I earned a little comfort."
    L "我觉得我也该犒劳一下自己了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3766
translate schinese story01_7_12a2cac3:

    # mc "Oh no. What if somebody decides to make a move on the clown..."
    mc "不好。万一有人对小丑主动出击……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3769
translate schinese story01_7_9364789b:

    # L "Boop."
    L "啵。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3770
translate schinese story01_7_2f3bf647:

    # L "What'd I tell you? Don't talk about yourself like that."
    L "我说什么来着？别那么贬低自己。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3772
translate schinese story01_7_2336547d:

    # L "Or I'm gonna pout!"
    L "不然我就要撅嘴了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3773
translate schinese story01_7_d7794dd8:

    # L "*Pouts*"
    L "*鼓起腮帮子*"

# game/story01en.rpy:3776
translate schinese story01_7_dbfe77cd:

    # L "Aww..."
    L "啊……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3777
translate schinese story01_7_fa2a4047:

    # mc "Knock it off. You're gonna ruin your reputation."
    mc "别闹了。你的名声要毁了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3780
translate schinese story01_7_b9b755e5_4:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3781
translate schinese story01_7_94bc8731:

    # r "(She's doin' that on purpose...)"
    r "（她是故意的……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3782
translate schinese story01_7_89579657:

    # r "(Alright, hold up.)"
    r "（好了，等等。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3783
translate schinese story01_7_4ed4ddec:

    # r "(There it is again.)"
    r "（又来了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3786
translate schinese story01_7_ef4f6eec:

    # r "(Temperature spike. Focus drift.)"
    r "（体温上升。注意力涣散。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3788
translate schinese story01_7_e5b9e580:

    # r "(Diagnostic didn't fix a damn thing.)"
    r "（诊断一点用都没有。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3790
translate schinese story01_7_a9f859dc:

    # r "We still gotta discuss tomorrow's physical exam."
    r "我们还得讨论明天的体测。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3791
translate schinese story01_7_86f1806d:

    # r "Unless this is somehow part of the strategy."
    r "除非这也是什么策略的一部分。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3793
translate schinese story01_7_e48275dc:

    # L "Easy there. Don't get mad."
    L "冷静。别生气。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3794
translate schinese story01_7_2738695d:

    # L "I know what I'm doing."
    L "我知道我在做什么。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3796
translate schinese story01_7_360fde00:

    # mc "Lena, you're making this weird."
    mc "莉娜，你这样很奇怪。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3801
translate schinese story01_7_121684fc:

    # L "Hmm..."
    L "嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3802
translate schinese story01_7_6724a16c:

    # L "(She's definitely acting strange.)"
    L "（她肯定是不对劲。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3803
translate schinese story01_7_8c3b88d3:

    # L "(Whatever. Not my problem.)"
    L "（算了。不关我的事。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3806
translate schinese story01_7_43be0a53:

    # mc "(Whispering) What the hell's gotten into you all of a sudden?"
    mc "（低声）你这是突然怎么了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3808
translate schinese story01_7_13c28664:

    # L "Who knows?"
    L "谁知道呢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3811
translate schinese story01_7_b59ddf2e:

    # L "Hey... you didn't forget about our date tonight, did ya?"
    L "喂……你没忘了我们今晚的约会吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3812
translate schinese story01_7_d4db2bee:

    # L "I've really been looking forward to it..."
    L "我可是一直很期待的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3818
translate schinese story01_7_473f0dc5:

    # an "(Sh-she's m-mad again...)"
    an "（她、她又生气了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3819
translate schinese story01_7_7049e8f3:

    # an "(M-maybe I should t-try to calm her down?)"
    an "（我、我要不要试着让她冷静点？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3820
translate schinese story01_7_1b96148e:

    # r "(This can't keep goin' on.)"
    r "（这样下去不行。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3821
translate schinese story01_7_65134353:

    # r "(Need beer.)"
    r "（需要啤酒。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3824
translate schinese story01_7_7e5ece48:

    # r "TIME TO GET WASTED!"
    r "该灌醉了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3825
translate schinese story01_7_6b45ba58_1:

    # L "Wh—"
    L "什——"

# game/story01en.rpy:3826
translate schinese story01_7_2a15ab96:

    # mc "Rose, this is gonna end badly..."
    mc "罗丝，这样下去会出事的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3831
translate schinese story01_7_f64c558d:

    # "Moments later."
    "片刻之后。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3837
translate schinese story01_7_3f3ad879:

    # r "Why the hell'd he take his clothes off...?"
    r "他他妈干嘛脱衣服……？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3838
translate schinese story01_7_f2c9d014:

    # L "Old habit from his teenage years, I guess."
    L "我猜是青春期留下的老毛病。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3841
translate schinese story01_7_bd69ea6f:

    # an "(Th-those m-muscles are sooo..."
    an "（那、那些肌肉好……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3842
translate schinese story01_7_6a7d8796:

    # an "(A-attractive...)"
    an "（好、好看……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3843
translate schinese story01_7_1b615f48:

    # r "(Ain't got a clue what he's doin'.)"
    r "（完全搞不懂他在干什么。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3844
translate schinese story01_7_e30ae477:

    # r "(But the show's pretty damn entertaining.)"
    r "（不过这场面还真他妈好看。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3846
translate schinese story01_7_c01d8252:

    # L "(Okay... he actually looks pretty good dancing around in those boxers...)"
    L "（好吧……他穿着内裤乱跳的样子其实挺帅的……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3848
translate schinese story01_7_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3850
translate schinese story01_7_db50fac8:

    # L "(Wait. I don't like the way they're looking at him.)"
    L "（等等。我不喜欢她们看他的眼神。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3851
translate schinese story01_7_2ea6cf8b:

    # L "(Do I want them looking?)"
    L "（我能接受她们那样看吗？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3854
translate schinese story01_7_de41b166:

    # L "NO!"
    L "不！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3857
translate schinese story01_7_c16b407a:

    # r "Wipe the drool off your face first."
    r "先把口水擦了吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3858
translate schinese story01_7_d1ee3373:

    # r "Your objection's inconsistent with your own behavior."
    r "你的抗议跟你自己的表现完全对不上。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3859
translate schinese story01_7_096e26d8:

    # L "What?"
    L "什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3860
translate schinese story01_7_dfc0e084:

    # r "Nothin'. Just an observation."
    r "没什么。只是观察。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3862
translate schinese story01_7_1dfaf50c:

    # an "D-don't f-fight..."
    an "别、别吵架……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3863
translate schinese story01_7_cb409b27:

    # an "(Whispering) B-but... I-I kinda agree with R-Rose."
    an "（低声）可、可是……我、我有点同意罗、罗丝。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3864
translate schinese story01_7_e2754933:

    # r "You're blushin' again."
    r "你又脸红了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3866
translate schinese story01_7_fe4dc105:

    # L "No means NO!"
    L "不行就是不行！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3867
translate schinese story01_7_183bd99b:

    # L "I'm the only one allowed to see him like this!"
    L "只有我才能这样看他！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3870
translate schinese story01_7_51228032:

    # mc "Lena, enough."
    mc "莉娜，够了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3871
translate schinese story01_7_75260c7b:

    # mc "Why d'ya think I'm showing off over here?"
    mc "你以为我在这边干嘛呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3872
translate schinese story01_7_812029eb:

    # mc "(Whispering) So your teasing doesn't tear the team apart."
    mc "（低声）这样你闹归闹，也闹不到拆散队伍的地步。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3875
translate schinese story01_7_e61583f3:

    # L "Oh, yeah?"
    L "哦，是吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3876
translate schinese story01_7_de256e40:

    # L "I dunno, I kinda figured you just wanted to show off."
    L "我还以为你只是想显摆呢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3879
translate schinese story01_7_3557611e:

    # mc "Dominance display!"
    mc "展示支配欲！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3880
translate schinese story01_7_69f27f4b:

    # mc "I mean, yeah, that too. But the main goal was something else."
    mc "嗯，也对。但主要目的其实是别的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3882
translate schinese story01_7_a06dcc5d:

    # L "I'm tellin' ya, I don't like other girls staring at you like that."
    L "我跟你说了，我不喜欢别的女孩那样盯着你看。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3883
translate schinese story01_7_f604d35d:

    # L "But... fine."
    L "不过……好吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3884
translate schinese story01_7_489f4645:

    # L "Say, don't ya wanna know how you did on the tests?"
    L "对了，你不想知道自己考得怎么样吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3886
translate schinese story01_7_88c58669:

    # r "Ya got access to our scores?!"
    r "你能看到我们的分数？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3887
translate schinese story01_7_d01a48e2:

    # mc "How?!"
    mc "怎么做到的？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3890
translate schinese story01_7_d97ebfcd:

    # L "Secret."
    L "秘密。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3891
translate schinese story01_7_06182463:

    # L "So? Wanna know?"
    L "所以？想知道吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3893
translate schinese story01_7_ab7654d4:

    # mc "Depends on the results. I do enjoy feeding my poor, starving ego."
    mc "看结果吧。我还挺喜欢喂一喂我那可怜又饥渴的自尊心。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3895
translate schinese story01_7_ae3e95e0:

    # r "I'm more curious how they're tallyin' the results."
    r "我更好奇他们是怎么统计分数的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3897
translate schinese story01_7_98324861:

    # r "Y'all notice the teachers at the start? They were writin' down everythin' we did."
    r "你们注意到一开始那些老师了吗？他们把我们做的每件事都记下来了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3899
translate schinese story01_7_6577601d:

    # L "I didn't really pay much attention to that."
    L "我当时没太在意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3900
translate schinese story01_7_b72e9da2:

    # mc "Of course. You're not the one applying..."
    mc "当然了。你又不是来应征的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3906
translate schinese story01_7_8a4b4f88:

    # an "Y-yeah..."
    an "嗯、嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3907
translate schinese story01_7_2f94f5bc:

    # an "I-I saw 'em too."
    an "我、我也看到了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3908
translate schinese story01_7_bc9f8dc3:

    # an "R-right up until s-someone started a f-fight..."
    an "一、一直接到有人打、打起来……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3910
translate schinese story01_7_1e0f4582:

    # r "I heard folks talkin' about some blue-haired girl and a clow—"
    r "我听人说过什么蓝头发女孩和一个小——"

# game/story01en.rpy:3913
translate schinese story01_7_11336289:

    # r "WAIT, THAT WAS YOU TWO?!"
    r "等等，那说的就是你俩？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3916
translate schinese story01_7_9993b94e_1:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3918
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3921
translate schinese story01_7_7b8a3d89:

    # L "(With her eyes) Why's she reacting like that?"
    L "（用眼神）她为什么反应这么大？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3922
translate schinese story01_7_8b576031:

    # mc "(With his eyes) No clue."
    mc "（用眼神）不知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3925
translate schinese story01_7_82946422:

    # L "Just so we're clear, this wasn't my idea."
    L "说清楚，这不是我的主意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3926
translate schinese story01_7_8efa48a0:

    # r "But why?"
    r "可为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3929
translate schinese story01_7_a1e02642:

    # mc "Improvi— hic—sation."
    mc "随机——嗝——应变。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3931
translate schinese story01_7_609de989:

    # L "(I keep looking at him...)"
    L "（我一直看着他……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3932
translate schinese story01_7_606c6378:

    # L "(Still... I'm glad to see him like this.)"
    L "（不过……还是很高兴能这样看到他。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3933
translate schinese story01_7_4fb0564c:

    # L "(After what happened with Isa...)"
    L "（自从伊莎那件事之后……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:3935
translate schinese story01_7_21f3e2e8:

    # mc "(Whispering) Lena? You're staring a little too hard."
    mc "（低声）莉娜？你盯得有点太久了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3936
translate schinese story01_7_9052607f:

    # mc "Anyway, got any good news for me?"
    mc "总之，有好消息吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3940
translate schinese story01_7_e628e3d6:

    # L "Not sure you're gonna be happy about it, but..."
    L "不确定你会高兴，但……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3941
translate schinese story01_7_fcbe9b3e:

    # L "C'mere."
    L "过来。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3944
translate schinese story01_7_7d39ba31:

    # mc "What am I looking at?"
    mc "我看的是什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3946
translate schinese story01_7_cf2e864a:

    # L "Your scores."
    L "你的分数。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3948
translate schinese story01_7_9eb1ad7c:

    # mc "And what does that mean?"
    mc "这意味着什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3950
translate schinese story01_7_9c945d7e:

    # L "You're not in last place."
    L "你不是最后一名。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3952
translate schinese story01_7_b8de06d3:

    # mc "Oh."
    mc "哦。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3953
translate schinese story01_7_dc16ebcd_1:

    # mc "Got it."
    mc "知道了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3955
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3961
translate schinese story01_7_b9a9ec26:

    # mc "NO!"
    mc "不！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3962
translate schinese story01_7_096e26d8_1:

    # L "What?"
    L "什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3963
translate schinese story01_7_dd7fc79e:

    # mc "WHY AM I NOT IN LAST PLACE?!"
    mc "我为什么不是最后一名？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3964
translate schinese story01_7_43e8e38c:

    # L "Isn't that a good thing?"
    L "这不是好事吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3965
translate schinese story01_7_8d1c80ad:

    # mc "No!"
    mc "不！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3966
translate schinese story01_7_d780be17:

    # mc "Now everyone's gonna realize I'm capable of more!"
    mc "现在所有人都会发现我还有更大的潜力！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3967
translate schinese story01_7_d5a6a1a6:

    # L "And?"
    L "然后呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3968
translate schinese story01_7_fddbfb16:

    # mc "People are gonna start expecting things from me!"
    mc "人们就会开始对我有所期待！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3969
translate schinese story01_7_598e9bab:

    # L "Terrifying."
    L "太可怕了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3970
translate schinese story01_7_66843794:

    # mc "Finally, someone understands."
    mc "终于有人懂了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3971
translate schinese story01_7_eb0cdde3:

    # r "Sometimes his behavior's even more random than probability theory."
    r "有时他的行为比概率论还要随机。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3973
translate schinese story01_7_5f7b9b6e:

    # mc "Either way, this is tragic."
    mc "不管怎么说，这都太惨了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3974
translate schinese story01_7_f66ee6d3:

    # mc "Any good news?"
    mc "有好消息吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3975
translate schinese story01_7_a2dd18b9:

    # L "There are sixteen teams with more points than you."
    L "有十六支队伍分数比你高。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3976
translate schinese story01_7_70a27ee9:

    # mc "YES!"
    mc "太好了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3979
translate schinese story01_7_b272506b:

    # r "Ain't that bad news?"
    r "这不是坏消息吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3982
translate schinese story01_7_3c092837:

    # an "I-I think..."
    an "我、我觉得……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3983
translate schinese story01_7_72c88acf:

    # an "H-he just knows how to f-find something good in e-even stuff like that..."
    an "他、他很会在这种事里也找出好的一面……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3984
translate schinese story01_7_3b49b9c3:

    # an "A-and... th-that's a good thing, r-right?"
    an "而、而且……那、那是好事，对、对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3986
translate schinese story01_7_2735befa:

    # r "Nope. He's just weird."
    r "不。他只是古怪。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3989
translate schinese story01_7_09e30cd8:

    # mc "Being weird is a superpower too!"
    mc "古怪也是一种超能力！"

# game/story01en.rpy:3991
translate schinese story01_7_882b8912:

    # r "If there were five hundred people..."
    r "如果一共五百人……"

# game/story01en.rpy:3992
translate schinese story01_7_569c1f6c:

    # r "Divide that by three, and ya get a hundred sixty-six teams."
    r "除以三，就是一百六十六支队伍。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3993
translate schinese story01_7_5854d81f:

    # r "You're in the top ten percent."
    r "你在前百分之十。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3994
translate schinese story01_7_7d104187:

    # r "Better than I expected."
    r "比我预想的强。"

# game/story01en.rpy:3996
translate schinese story01_7_7aa13d7a:

    # mc "And in actual numbers?"
    mc "具体数字呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:3998
translate schinese story01_7_d1ec0977:

    # mc "So we got roughly forty points per stage..."
    mc "我们每阶段大概拿四十分……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4001
translate schinese story01_7_4512f850:

    # r "Ain't much."
    r "不算多。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4002
translate schinese story01_7_03769a50:

    # r "Got any details?"
    r "有明细吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4005
translate schinese story01_7_fc2a85ef:

    # L "Lemme check..."
    L "我看看……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4009
translate schinese story01_7_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4010
translate schinese story01_7_fccbaaec:

    # mc "(Would ya look at that. I'm a damn magnet for trouble.)"
    mc "（瞧瞧。我真是个惹祸精。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4013
translate schinese story01_7_0948bf7d:

    # mc "(Whispering) Clanker?"
    mc "（低声）铁皮？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4014
translate schinese story01_7_95d62f1d:

    # mc "(Whispering) Your friends are here."
    mc "（低声）你的朋友来了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4017
translate schinese story01_7_14171d85:

    # r "(Whispering) I see 'em."
    r "（低声）我看到了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4018
translate schinese story01_7_1e8e3657:

    # r "(Whispering) They're starin' right at us."
    r "（低声）她们正盯着我们。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4020
translate schinese story01_7_04a842ec:

    # mc "(Whispering) Better yet, they're coming straight at us."
    mc "（低声）更要命的是，她们直奔我们来了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4022
translate schinese story01_7_8dee1c04:

    # r "(Whispering) So what're we gonna do?"
    r "（低声）那我们怎么办？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4024
translate schinese story01_7_1ba77376:

    # mc "(Whispering) Same thing we always do."
    mc "（低声）老样子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4026
translate schinese story01_7_b9b755e5_5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4028
translate schinese story01_7_1c3e3055:

    # r "(Whispering) And that is...?"
    r "（低声）那是……？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4030
translate schinese story01_7_846d6ea7:

    # mc "(Whispering) Improvise."
    mc "（低声）随机应变。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4033
translate schinese story01_7_564b5acb:

    # li "We can hear you."
    li "我们听得见。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4035
translate schinese story01_7_7e1b84b9:

    # mc "(Whispering) They say they can hear us."
    mc "（低声）她们说听得见我们。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4036
translate schinese story01_7_0deea4fc:

    # r "(Whispering) No kiddin'."
    r "（低声）不是吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4039
translate schinese story01_7_a896f625:

    # ti "Sisters, he's a fun one."
    ti "姐姐们，这小子挺有意思的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4040
translate schinese story01_7_aedb2a92:

    # ti "And rather... appetisin'."
    ti "而且还相当……让人有食欲。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4042
translate schinese story01_7_3dafeb1e:

    # ti "It's gettin' harder and harder to hold meself back..."
    ti "俺越来越难控制住自个儿了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4043
translate schinese story01_7_222b1bb0:

    # ti "Please, sisters, just once—"
    ti "求你们了，姐姐们，就一次——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4044
translate schinese story01_7_aaf13393:

    # li "No."
    li "不。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4045
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4047
translate schinese story01_7_43f3a2c7:

    # mc "Ahem. How can we help you?"
    mc "咳。有什么可以帮您？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4048
translate schinese story01_7_4687c6eb:

    # an "(I-I don't like this atmosphere...)"
    an "（我、我不喜欢这种气氛……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4049
translate schinese story01_7_a39552bf:

    # an "(I-is she gonna h-hurt him?)"
    an "（她、她会伤到他吗？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4051
translate schinese story01_7_edc6cf01:

    # li "Not bad. For someone like you."
    li "不错。对你这种人来说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4052
translate schinese story01_7_d6bb3f12:

    # mc "Impressive, huh?"
    mc "很了不起，是吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4053
translate schinese story01_7_4dd20cbe:

    # ti "(Surely nothin' bad'll happen if I touch him...)"
    ti "（我碰他一下肯定不会出事……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4056
translate schinese story01_7_fb353e8f:

    # ti "(Just one wee finger...)"
    ti "（就一根小指头……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4057
translate schinese story01_7_9eb7305b:

    # li "Not quite."
    li "还不算。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4060
translate schinese story01_7_b1312220:

    # L "Touch him, and I'll break your fingers."
    L "你敢碰他，我就掰断你的手指。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4061
translate schinese story01_7_2b815467:

    # L "Got it?"
    L "听懂了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4063
translate schinese story01_7_97ed35f1:

    # li "I expected rather more than a pair of B and C-ranks."
    li "我原以为会更强些——一对B级和C级。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4066
translate schinese story01_7_b0f71984:

    # mc "Maybe they look weak to you."
    mc "也许在你眼里她们很弱。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4067
translate schinese story01_7_56ee16da:

    # mc "But from where I'm standing, they're a godsend."
    mc "但在我看来，她们是救星。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4068
translate schinese story01_7_b807cc40:

    # mc "So. What d'ya want?"
    mc "那么。你想要什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4070
translate schinese story01_7_e6cf7fe4:

    # li "On your knees. I rather dislike being looked down upon."
    li "跪下。我很不喜欢被人俯视。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4072
translate schinese story01_7_01b41d20:

    # mc "(Are you serious? You really think I'm gonna listen to—)"
    mc "（你认真的？你真以为我会听——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4074
translate schinese story01_7_4889c7af:

    # li "I shan't ask again."
    li "我不会问第二遍。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4077
translate schinese story01_7_35dce81c:

    # mc "Yes, ma'am."
    mc "是，小姐。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4078
translate schinese story01_7_9533fae0:

    # mc "(Then again, she's A-rank. I can swallow my pride for a minute...)"
    mc "（话说回来，她是A级。我忍辱负重一分钟还是……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4081
translate schinese story01_7_8752678e:

    # li "Good boy."
    li "好孩子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4082
translate schinese story01_7_9f1aa7dc:

    # ti "(Maybe I can do it now...)"
    ti "（也许我现在可以了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4084
translate schinese story01_7_0593f6db:

    # li "My offer still stands."
    li "我的提议依然有效。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4087
translate schinese story01_7_4373b991:

    # mc "I'm afraid I'll have to decline. You're way outta my league."
    mc "恐怕我得拒绝。我高攀不起你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4088
translate schinese story01_7_42fb1f08:

    # mc "By the way, you returned the bike. Thanks."
    mc "对了，自行车你还回来了。谢谢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4089
translate schinese story01_7_ca28b613:

    # mc "So, are we even now?"
    mc "那么，我们算扯平了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4091
translate schinese story01_7_fc704d3d:

    # li "Perhaps you and I are."
    li "你和我之间大概是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4093
translate schinese story01_7_f8f2cad0:

    # li "She still owes us."
    li "她还欠着我们。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4097
translate schinese story01_7_1b88ee20:

    # r "I ALREADY PAID YA BACK!"
    r "我早就还过了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4098
translate schinese story01_7_7163c3f4:

    # r "WITH INTEREST! A WHOLE DAMN LOT OF IT!"
    r "还带利息！他妈一大笔！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4101
translate schinese story01_7_a2655c2c:

    # mc "Rose, I'll handle it."
    mc "罗丝，我来处理。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4104
translate schinese story01_7_6f498755:

    # an "(I-interest?)"
    an "（利、利息？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4105
translate schinese story01_7_836bbaf7:

    # an "(M-mom said loan sharks are b-bad people.)"
    an "（妈、妈妈说放高利贷的是坏、坏人。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4107
translate schinese story01_7_69bda339:

    # an "(S-so... am I allowed to k-kill 'em?)"
    an "（那、那……我可以杀掉他们吗？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4109
translate schinese story01_7_725beb8e:

    # r "(There's a hundred-percent chance punchin' her would be completely justified.)"
    r "（有一百概率可以名正言顺地揍她一顿。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4111
translate schinese story01_7_a6c8614b:

    # r "(And a two-hundred-percent chance it'd end real badly for me.)"
    r "（也有两百概率我会被狠狠干翻。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4113
translate schinese story01_7_9e717813:

    # li "..."
    li "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4119
translate schinese story01_7_fa7cdc9b:

    # mc "How much?"
    mc "多少？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4122
translate schinese story01_7_cb5d6e04:

    # mc "Two thousand?"
    mc "两千？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4123
translate schinese story01_7_02926d2a:

    # mc "Fine. I can pay you right no—"
    mc "行。我马上——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4126
translate schinese story01_7_c2c89539:

    # li "Twenty thousand."
    li "两万。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4128
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4130
translate schinese story01_7_476663c9:

    # mc "With interest?"
    mc "带利息？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4132
translate schinese story01_7_aaf68b3d:

    # li "Without."
    li "不带。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4134
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4138
translate schinese story01_7_eb64368d:

    # mc "Pleasure doing business with you."
    mc "很高兴与你做生意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4141
translate schinese story01_7_4f2043d6:

    # mc "And on that note, I'm outta here."
    mc "话说如此，我先走了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4144
translate schinese story01_7_4762c42e:

    # r "Where the hell d'ya think you're goin'?!"
    r "你他妈以为你要去哪儿？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4145
translate schinese story01_7_ec76fc95:

    # mc "Home."
    mc "回家。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4146
translate schinese story01_7_b1868408:

    # r "Ya said you'd handle it!"
    r "你说了你会处理！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4147
translate schinese story01_7_7222bac4:

    # mc "I did."
    mc "我处理了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4148
translate schinese story01_7_7ff7f2c8:

    # mc "The situation's hopeless."
    mc "局面没救了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4150
translate schinese story01_7_5c724f47:

    # mc "Twenty thousand, Rose."
    mc "两万，罗丝。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4151
translate schinese story01_7_7dcfdfa5:

    # mc "I don't have twenty thousand!"
    mc "我没有两万！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4153
translate schinese story01_7_ffca7872:

    # r "Neither do I!"
    r "我也没有！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4155
translate schinese story01_7_3c660cc3:

    # r "(Whispering) I paid 'em everythin'..."
    r "（低声）我都全付了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4156
translate schinese story01_7_f93e19d7:

    # r "(Whispering) Paid that whole damn amount back ages ago. But they just won't leave me alone."
    r "（低声）很久以前就还清了那一大笔。可他们就是不肯放过我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4158
translate schinese story01_7_f35f758f:

    # mc "(Whispering) Rose, listen. I don't have twenty thousand..."
    mc "（低声）罗丝，听我说。我没有两万……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4159
translate schinese story01_7_b9b755e5_6:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4161
translate schinese story01_7_31828b53_1:

    # mc "*Sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/story01en.rpy:4164
translate schinese story01_7_7696b302:

    # mc "(On my side, I've got two B-ranks and Rose.)"
    mc "（我这边有两个B级和罗丝。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4165
translate schinese story01_7_d6268de9:

    # mc "(On their side...)"
    mc "（她们那边……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4167
translate schinese story01_7_b893d6b1:

    # mc "(Judging by Lena's reaction, Lia's at least A-rank.)"
    mc "（看莉娜的反应，莉娅至少是A级。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4168
translate schinese story01_7_149c2300:

    # mc "(Meaning she could probably take all of us by herself.)"
    mc "（也就是说，她大概能一个人打倒我们全部。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4170
translate schinese story01_7_a5ef61d1:

    # mc "(And there's still no telling what rank that pervert is.)"
    mc "（而那个色狼是什么等级还完全说不准。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4171
translate schinese story01_7_98cd2e82:

    # mc "(We're not exactly in a winning position.)"
    mc "（我们处境可不妙。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4173
translate schinese story01_7_d87a454d:

    # li "Ria, stand guard."
    li "莉娅，警戒。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4174
translate schinese story01_7_0893804e:

    # li "I would rather the teachers did not interfere."
    li "我不希望老师插手。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4176
translate schinese story01_7_fde46db9:

    # a "As you wish, young lady!"
    a "遵命，小姐！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4178
translate schinese story01_7_606422b6:

    # mc "(She's not actually planning to fight us... right?)"
    mc "（她其实没打算真跟我们打……对吧？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4179
translate schinese story01_7_83d7e3d3:

    # mc "Y'know, Lia, I'm really not liking the vibe in here."
    mc "你知道，莉娅，这里的气氛我真的很不喜欢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4180
translate schinese story01_7_df4bd635:

    # mc "Kinda feels like we're about to throw hands!"
    mc "总感觉马上就要打起来了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4182
translate schinese story01_7_9e717813_1:

    # li "..."
    li "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4183
translate schinese story01_7_42bab480:

    # li "(Whispering) Tia. Do not interfere."
    li "（低声）蒂娅。别插手。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4185
translate schinese story01_7_e8dbe650:

    # li "(Let us see what made you think you could afford to refuse me.)"
    li "（让我看看你凭什么觉得可以拒绝我。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4193
translate schinese story01_7_6bd256d0:

    # an "Wh—"
    an "什——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4199
translate schinese story01_7_f8ddcf64:

    # an "I-I won't let ya..."
    an "我、我不会让你……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4201
translate schinese story01_7_cc467d97:

    # li "(Not bad.)"
    li "（不错。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4202
translate schinese story01_7_1f8211f5:

    # an "(W-weaker than I th-thought.)"
    an "（比、比我想的弱。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4203
translate schinese story01_7_9cac687b:

    # r "(My legs... Why ain't they...?)"
    r "（我的腿……怎么不……？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4205
translate schinese story01_7_48bb62c2:

    # r "(Whispering) For a second there, I lost track of where I even was."
    r "（低声）刚才那一瞬间，我连自己在哪儿都搞不清了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4211
translate schinese story01_7_cf248adc:

    # r "(A card?)"
    r "（一张牌？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4213
translate schinese story01_7_c2269189:

    # mc "(I didn't imagine it. At the last second, she stopped...)"
    mc "（我没看错。在最后一刻，她停住了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4214
translate schinese story01_7_cbb292cc:

    # mc "(And Alice can actually stop her.)"
    mc "（而且艾丽西亚真的能拦住她。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4219
translate schinese story01_7_c642cf68:

    # mc "(No idea what'd happen in a real fight. But for now, this is enough.)"
    mc "（真打起来会怎样完全不知道。但眼下这样就够了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4220
translate schinese story01_7_9e717813_2:

    # li "..."
    li "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4222
translate schinese story01_7_46161f1a:

    # li "We're leaving."
    li "我们走了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4223
translate schinese story01_7_7c3e3421:

    # ti "Wh— Sis! What about takin' him home with us?!"
    ti "什——姐姐！把他带回家去怎么样？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4224
translate schinese story01_7_4566c67d:

    # li "Oi, jester. My offer still stands."
    li "喂，小丑。我的提议依然有效。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4226
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_7:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4229
translate schinese story01_7_dfa1aba5:

    # mc "Why'd you stop?"
    mc "你为什么停手？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4230
translate schinese story01_7_159dd7e5:

    # r "Hold up. Ya mean she stopped?"
    r "等等。你的意思是她停了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4231
translate schinese story01_7_5bab9cfa:

    # an "H-her strength..."
    an "她、她的力量……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4232
translate schinese story01_7_7e674666:

    # an "Th-that wasn't an A-rank ability."
    an "那、那不是A级能力。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4233
translate schinese story01_7_9e717813_3:

    # li "..."
    li "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4236
translate schinese story01_7_ed26bd05:

    # mc "Hold up."
    mc "等一下。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4237
translate schinese story01_7_e02ab79a:

    # mc "How about a deal?"
    mc "做个交易怎么样？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4239
translate schinese story01_7_c2209595:

    # mc "A temporary alliance. Just until the exams are over."
    mc "临时同盟。只到考试结束为止。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4240
translate schinese story01_7_a808d0fb:

    # mc "What d'ya say?"
    mc "怎么样？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4242
translate schinese story01_7_d4ae7812:

    # r "(Whispering) What the hell're ya doin'?! With them?!"
    r "（低声）你他妈在干嘛？！跟她们？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4244
translate schinese story01_7_6ff0416d:

    # an "I-I don't like 'em..."
    an "我、我不喜欢她们……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4245
translate schinese story01_7_fe5a9db8:

    # mc "I'll handle it."
    mc "我来处理。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4250
translate schinese story01_7_29ba421e:

    # mc "(She's gonna refuse anyway. There's nothing in it for her.)"
    mc "（她反正也会拒绝。对她没有任何好处。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4252
translate schinese story01_7_d8fb23d4:

    # li "And what, precisely, do we gain from it?"
    li "那么，我们具体能得到什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4254
translate schinese story01_7_4d427813:

    # mc "Let's be honest."
    mc "打开天窗说亮话。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4255
translate schinese story01_7_f60fa4e8:

    # mc "Yeah, you're Dellaymens. But in here, you're on hostile ground."
    mc "没错，你们是德拉伊姆家。但在这儿，你们是客场作战。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4256
translate schinese story01_7_4b52781c:

    # mc "Look around. People have been glaring at you since the second you walked in."
    mc "看看四周。你从进门那一刻起，就一直被人家瞪着。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4258
translate schinese story01_7_a53f37c1:

    # li "Askance?"
    li "嗯？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4261
translate schinese story01_7_684c928d:

    # mc "Oh, sorry, sorry..."
    mc "哦，抱歉抱歉……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4262
translate schinese story01_7_3edff017:

    # mc "Better?"
    mc "这样好些了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4263
translate schinese story01_7_2cc56f80:

    # li "(It was empty a moment ago. I'm certain of it...)"
    li "（刚才明明还是空的。我很确定……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4265
translate schinese story01_7_75a3147d:

    # mc "Think anyone else in here is gonna wanna work with you?"
    mc "你觉得这里还有别人愿意跟你合作吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4267
translate schinese story01_7_a2c9e407:

    # li "(Is he implying that he concealed everyone else's presence?)"
    li "（他的意思是，他把其他人的存在也藏起来了？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4268
translate schinese story01_7_60cecdf0:

    # li "You stand to gain rather more from this arrangement than we do."
    li "比起我们，这个安排对你更有利。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4270
translate schinese story01_7_2034c056:

    # mc "Maybe."
    mc "也许吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4271
translate schinese story01_7_d5bc459e:

    # mc "But unlike everyone else, I hate all elites equally."
    mc "不过跟所有人不同，我对所有精英一视同仁地讨厌。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4274
translate schinese story01_7_d72bf4ff:

    # li "(Using an illusion to strengthen his position?)"
    li "（他在用幻术强化自己的立场？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4275
translate schinese story01_7_a68c0215:

    # li "(So, you're an illusionist.)"
    li "（所以，你是幻术师。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4277
translate schinese story01_7_62efd56e:

    # li "Well, well. You've come rather far in a single day."
    li "啧啧。一天之内你就进步了这么多。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4279
translate schinese story01_7_684b7f69:

    # mc "Y'know, having a katana at your throat really clears the mind."
    mc "你知道，刀抵在喉咙上最能让人清醒。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4281
translate schinese story01_7_4eefabd0:

    # L "WHAT?!"
    L "什么？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4284
translate schinese story01_7_62711a69:

    # mc "LENA, WAI-"
    mc "莉娜，等——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4285
translate schinese story01_7_567cc413:

    # L "I'M GONNA TEAR HER TO PIECES!"
    L "我要把她撕成碎片！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4288
translate schinese story01_7_caa9993d:

    # mc "Calm down. If she'd wanted to kill me back then, she would've done it already."
    mc "冷静。她当时要是想杀我，早就动手了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4289
translate schinese story01_7_81328fed:

    # mc "(Whispering) Besides... that was partly my fault."
    mc "（低声）再说了……那也有我的责任。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4291
translate schinese story01_7_18b2b43e:

    # mc "So quit looking at her like you're about to slit her throat."
    mc "所以别用那种要割她喉咙的眼神看她。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4293
translate schinese story01_7_c50dd4a2:

    # L "(How dare she... And—)"
    L "（她怎么敢……而且——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4294
translate schinese story01_7_243c985a:

    # L "(Easy, Lena. Easy. You'll deal with her later.)"
    L "（冷静，莉娜。冷静。以后有的是机会收拾她。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4297
translate schinese story01_7_5a9e126c:

    # L "(Whispering) Why didn't ya tell me sooner?"
    L "（低声）为什么不早点告诉我？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4299
translate schinese story01_7_09d385f8:

    # L "I would've torn her apart right then and—"
    L "我当时就会把她撕了——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4301
translate schinese story01_7_301afac8:

    # mc "I know. That's exactly why I didn't tell you."
    mc "我知道。所以我才没告诉你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4305
translate schinese story01_7_07a1668e:

    # mc "Don't rush your answer."
    mc "别急着回答。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4306
translate schinese story01_7_9e717813_4:

    # li "..."
    li "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4307
translate schinese story01_7_9a305d7e:

    # mc "You're probably gonna refuse. But on the off chance..."
    mc "你八成会拒绝。不过万一……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4310
translate schinese story01_7_3d36faf3:

    # mc "(Expected. Too proud.)"
    mc "（果然。太骄傲了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4313
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_8:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4314
translate schinese story01_7_0b12840e:

    # ti "I'll give ya a call, handsome."
    ti "帅哥，我会给你打电话的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4315
translate schinese story01_7_baf021b1:

    # ti "And we'll have ourselves a grand wee time..."
    ti "到时候俺们好好爽一把……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4325
translate schinese story01_7_0b60bc87:

    # mc "(...she gives me the creeps.)"
    mc "（……她让我起鸡皮疙瘩。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4326
translate schinese story01_7_759f8223:

    # ti "Next time, handsome, we're definitely havin' ourselves some fun!"
    ti "下次吧帅哥，俺们肯定玩得更开心！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4329
translate schinese story01_7_fcadb93c:

    # li "One last thing."
    li "最后还有一件事。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4330
translate schinese story01_7_de87c5c3:

    # li "You ought to work on your illusions."
    li "你的幻术还得再练。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4332
translate schinese story01_7_786045fa:

    # mc "Worked on everyone else."
    mc "已经用在别人身上了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4333
translate schinese story01_7_cba5a8c9:

    # li "Do not compare me to the others."
    li "不要把我和别人相提并论。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4334
translate schinese story01_7_611f42c3:

    # li "Good day."
    li "告辞。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4337
translate schinese story01_7_6b87e983:

    # "The two elves leave the room."
    "两个精灵离开了房间。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4340
translate schinese story01_7_fa0de77e:

    # an "(Th-that smell...)"
    an "（那、那味道……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4341
translate schinese story01_7_92ffffe5:

    # r "Alright, now explain why the hell ya decided to get mixed up with THEM?!"
    r "好，现在给我解释清楚，你他妈为什么要跟那种人混在一起？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4342
translate schinese story01_7_7c31e77e:

    # r "Yeah, my analysis says it was the right call seventy-eight percent of the time."
    r "我的分析显示，这个决定有百分之七十八是对的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4343
translate schinese story01_7_400e4ce1:

    # r "But I'm with the other twenty-two!"
    r "但剩下那百分之二十二我站另一边！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4346
translate schinese story01_7_d650e7b2:

    # an "I can't resist!"
    an "我忍不住！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4347
translate schinese story01_7_d1e63dd2:

    # mc "Wh—"
    mc "什——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4350
translate schinese story01_7_7f5f2110:

    # mc "(Alice? What the hell's happening?!)"
    mc "（艾丽西亚？到底怎么回事？！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4351
translate schinese story01_7_45f03589:

    # an "[mc], oh, [mc]..."
    an "[mc]，哦，[mc]……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4352
translate schinese story01_7_15f1b532:

    # an "How come ya smell sooo good?"
    an "你怎么这么香啊？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4353
translate schinese story01_7_bdf62ae9:

    # mc "(What is she... This isn't Alice—)"
    mc "（她怎么了……这不对劲——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4354
translate schinese story01_7_0e7b869d:

    # mc "(A side effect...)"
    mc "（副作用……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4356
translate schinese story01_7_4012b880:

    # an "We're family, aren't we, [mc]...?"
    an "我们是家人，对吧，[mc]……？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4357
translate schinese story01_7_e0bd907e:

    # an "Let's make some babies."
    an "生个孩子吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4358
translate schinese story01_7_07a8b58a:

    # an "Right now!"
    an "现在就生！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4359
translate schinese story01_7_38939344:

    # L "What?! Get off—"
    L "什么？！放开——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4360
translate schinese story01_7_81636e5f:

    # mc "Don't interfere."
    mc "别插手。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4363
translate schinese story01_7_e9a843e2:

    # mc "Some beastfolk get overly emotional when their senses overload..."
    mc "有些兽人在感官过载时会情绪失控……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4364
translate schinese story01_7_c8d9648b:

    # mc "Give her a couple minutes."
    mc "给她几分钟。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4365
translate schinese story01_7_a26f2ac6:

    # L "How do you even know tha—"
    L "你怎么知道这种事——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4366
translate schinese story01_7_0e9b598a:

    # an "(These feelings... this body...)"
    an "（这种感觉……这具身体……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4367
translate schinese story01_7_3f78c8e8:

    # an "(He's sooo firm... a-and strong.)"
    an "（他好结实……又、好有力。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4369
translate schinese story01_7_0e7f9c0b:

    # an "(We'd definitely...)"
    an "（我们肯定能……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4374
translate schinese story01_7_9d75fbb2:

    # an "(...definitely...)"
    an "（……肯定能……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4378
translate schinese story01_7_faf9c1b4:

    # an "(Wh-what am I...)"
    an "（我、我在干什么……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4379
translate schinese story01_7_8dceaad5:

    # mc "Welcome back. You with us again?"
    mc "欢迎回来。清醒了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4381
translate schinese story01_7_9f05ec97:

    # an "(J-just now... I-I actually...)"
    an "（刚、刚才……我、我真的……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4382
translate schinese story01_7_0e96b1d3:

    # an "(Wh-what did I s-s-say to him?!)"
    an "（我、我跟他说、说了什么？！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4385
translate schinese story01_7_e8e38ec1_1:

    # an "..."
    an "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4386
translate schinese story01_7_ddfa34a3:

    # r "Oh. She's blushin'."
    r "哦。她脸红了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4387
translate schinese story01_7_b3b08eb7:

    # L "Looks like she's back to her senses."
    L "看来她恢复理智了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4390
translate schinese story01_7_afd3fef8:

    # mc "(And straight into the corner she goes...)"
    mc "（然后直接被赶到墙角……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4392
translate schinese story01_7_a835896a:

    # L "*Tugs his nipple*"
    L "*拽他的乳头*"

# game/story01en.rpy:4394
translate schinese story01_7_9fd762a2:

    # mc "(Whispering) Ow... What was that for?!"
    mc "（低声）疼……你干嘛？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4395
translate schinese story01_7_36c346c7:

    # L "There are way too many women around you."
    L "你身边女人太多了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4396
translate schinese story01_7_9a8bcab7:

    # mc "And how's that my fault?"
    mc "这怎么是我的错？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4397
translate schinese story01_7_c1088e0d:

    # L "You're involved."
    L "因为你有毛病。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4398
translate schinese story01_7_7d4da3b9:

    # L "Your cards messed with her sixth sense."
    L "你的牌搅乱了她的第六感。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4404
translate schinese story01_7_ffb900eb:

    # mc "Hey, Alice?"
    mc "喂，艾丽西亚？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4405
translate schinese story01_7_91d8a70c:

    # mc "You okay?"
    mc "你没事吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4407
translate schinese story01_7_305d3d01:

    # an "Wh-what I d-did..."
    an "我、我都干了什么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4408
translate schinese story01_7_0975567a:

    # an "I-I'm sooo embarrassed..."
    an "我、我太丢人了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4410
translate schinese story01_7_ba3ba255:

    # an "I-I told ya..."
    an "我、我告诉过你的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4411
translate schinese story01_7_ba483272:

    # an "Wh-when I use my ability, I-I can't really control myself."
    an "我、我一用能力就、就控制不住自己。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4412
translate schinese story01_7_92c08e8c:

    # an "A-and... m-my instincts kinda take over."
    an "而、而且……我、本能就会占上风。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4414
translate schinese story01_7_b977edc4:

    # an "I-I'm soh-ry..."
    an "我、我对不起……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4416
translate schinese story01_7_af9fc76e:

    # mc "Hm? What for?"
    mc "嗯？道什么歉？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4417
translate schinese story01_7_50fda40d:

    # mc "Seriously, why does everyone assume I'm gonna get mad over something this small?"
    mc "说真的，为什么所有人都觉得我会为这点小事生气？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4419
translate schinese story01_7_5bf2aca2:

    # r "Statistically speakin', there's a forty-eight-percent chance folks start gettin' annoyed over the dumbest little things."
    r "按概率算，有百分之四十八的人会为最蠢的小事开始烦躁。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4420
translate schinese story01_7_16151387:

    # L "Can't exactly blame 'em."
    L "也不能怪他们。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4421
translate schinese story01_7_647fa265:

    # L "You're unpredictable."
    L "你太难以预测了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4422
translate schinese story01_7_4c9a0141:

    # r "Agreed."
    r "同意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4423
translate schinese story01_7_f2fdec31:

    # mc "Hey! Thought that was part of my charm."
    mc "喂！我还以为这是我的魅力之一呢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4425
translate schinese story01_7_9fcb314a:

    # an "*Giggles softly*"
    an "*轻轻笑起来*"

# game/story01en.rpy:4426
translate schinese story01_7_d1b563a0:

    # mc "(Looks like she's feeling better. Good.)"
    mc "（看起来好多了。不错。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4428
translate schinese story01_7_5be8b40f:

    # mc "Back to the original question."
    mc "回到原来的问题。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4429
translate schinese story01_7_36d1dc56:

    # mc "This exam is supposed to test our brains."
    mc "这场考试考验的是我们的脑子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4431
translate schinese story01_7_fb320fe5:

    # mc "And that's our strong suit."
    mc "而这正是我们的强项。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4432
translate schinese story01_7_c2e28b18:

    # mc "Even then, we barely scraped into the top ten percent."
    mc "就这样，我们也才勉强挤进前百分之十。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4434
translate schinese story01_7_e2a5b6df:

    # r "Hate to admit it, but he's right."
    r "虽然不想承认，但他说得对。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4436
translate schinese story01_7_144cbfca:

    # an "Mhm..."
    an "嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4437
translate schinese story01_7_4bd91f87:

    # mc "Second, we got no clue what tomorrow's stages are gonna look like."
    mc "第二，我们完全不知道明天的阶段会是什么样。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4438
translate schinese story01_7_7f643ed3:

    # mc "So we need to be ready for anything."
    mc "所以得做好应对任何情况的准备。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4441
translate schinese story01_7_1f324065:

    # r "You're writin' us off way too damn quick."
    r "你下结论也太快了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4443
translate schinese story01_7_d3cc59f0:

    # mc "Us?"
    mc "我们？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4444
translate schinese story01_7_5207046a:

    # mc "C'mon. I'm not even counting myself. Just you."
    mc "得了吧。我连自己都没算。只算了你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4446
translate schinese story01_7_88e3fad2:

    # r "What d'ya mean, me? What about Alice?"
    r "什么意思，只算我？那艾丽西亚呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4448
translate schinese story01_7_491ae134:

    # mc "She's an assassin, not a pack mule."
    mc "她是刺客，不是驮马。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4450
translate schinese story01_7_42d712c8:

    # r "Huh? So I'm the pack mule now?"
    r "啥？所以驮马变我了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4452
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_9:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4453
translate schinese story01_7_209b8e76:

    # mc "For the record, I never said that!"
    mc "声明一下，我可从没这么说过！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4455
translate schinese story01_7_e7c032c9:

    # r "But ya sure as hell thought it."
    r "但你心里肯定这么想。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4457
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_10:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4459
translate schinese story01_7_c7b17e93:

    # L "He's definitely right about one thing."
    L "他有一点肯定说对了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4460
translate schinese story01_7_902f1892:

    # L "The second exam is all about strength."
    L "第二场考试全考力量。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4461
translate schinese story01_7_82e05227:

    # L "Pure, brute strength."
    L "纯粹的蛮力。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4463
translate schinese story01_7_e161e9c7:

    # mc "I may be cocky, but I'm not suicidal."
    mc "我是狂，但不傻。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4464
translate schinese story01_7_9754b5fa:

    # mc "Tomorrow's stage is on you two."
    mc "明天那关就看你们俩了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4465
translate schinese story01_7_ae403f6c:

    # an "U-um... a-and what about ya?"
    an "那、那个……那、那你呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4467
translate schinese story01_7_9e6f11df:

    # mc "Me?"
    mc "我？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4468
translate schinese story01_7_1e10c5bd:

    # mc "I'll be about as useful as a regular punching bag."
    mc "我大概跟普通沙包差不多有用。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4470
translate schinese story01_7_b04e1568:

    # mc "Need a hand?"
    mc "要帮忙吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4473
translate schinese story01_7_6b1e314e:

    # an "Th-thank ya..."
    an "谢、谢谢你……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4474
translate schinese story01_7_7e18e5ac:

    # r "Then I don't get why we need 'em at all."
    r "那我就搞不懂为什么还需要她们了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4475
translate schinese story01_7_6db8ec31:

    # mc "Lienara might end up useless."
    mc "莉娅说不定派不上用场。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4476
translate schinese story01_7_5b04d51b:

    # mc "But her younger sister..."
    mc "但她妹妹……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4478
translate schinese story01_7_0af0465d:

    # L "She's strong."
    L "她很强。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4479
translate schinese story01_7_c77b6265:

    # L "Like, ridiculously strong."
    L "强得离谱那种。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4482
translate schinese story01_7_4766a570:

    # r "Even stronger than you?"
    r "比你还强？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4483
translate schinese story01_7_a309b9ec:

    # L "That's the thing. I got no clue."
    L "问题就在这儿。我也不知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4485
translate schinese story01_7_9055266e:

    # an "I-I'm not s-soh sure Lienara is actually th-that strong."
    an "我、我不太确定莉娅真有那么强。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4486
translate schinese story01_7_2a948b02:

    # an "Ph-physically, sh-she's B-rank."
    an "单论体术，她、她是B级。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4488
translate schinese story01_7_84d83055:

    # an "B-but that's j-just how it f-felt to me."
    an "可、可那只是我自己的感觉。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4489
translate schinese story01_7_4a9b132c:

    # mc "Hm? She's not a physical type anyway."
    mc "嗯？她本来就不是走体术的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4490
translate schinese story01_7_6aeefe52:

    # mc "That's why she carries a katana."
    mc "所以她才带太刀。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4491
translate schinese story01_7_42397dfe:

    # an "B-but... wh-what about the f-final exam?"
    an "可、可是……那最后一场考试怎么办？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4493
translate schinese story01_7_67010270:

    # mc "I'm not taking part in that one."
    mc "那一场我不参加。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4495
translate schinese story01_7_caa64833:

    # r "WHAT?!"
    r "什么？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4496
translate schinese story01_7_2a2d744e:

    # r "What d'ya mean?!"
    r "你什么意思？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4497
translate schinese story01_7_f9efb5c5:

    # an "Wh-why...?"
    an "为、为什么……？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4502
translate schinese story01_7_2b35b6fe_11:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4504
translate schinese story01_7_c45b4128:

    # mc "Personal reasons."
    mc "私人原因。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4506
translate schinese story01_7_1cd0d057:

    # r "So that's why you're goin' all out right now."
    r "原来你现在才这么拼命。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4509
translate schinese story01_7_390021a7:

    # mc "Investing in the future!"
    mc "这是为未来投资！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4511
translate schinese story01_7_f118b22e:

    # r "Unbelievable..."
    r "真是难以置信……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4514
translate schinese story01_7_da728f75:

    # an "Th-then I'll g-give it everything I've got tomorrow!"
    an "那、那明天我就全力以赴！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4515
translate schinese story01_7_ccf48f68:

    # an "A-and... w-we won't have to work with them."
    an "而、而且……我们不用跟她们合作。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4517
translate schinese story01_7_58e3d259:

    # L "Cute."
    L "真可爱。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4518
translate schinese story01_7_65b0d133:

    # L "Y'know..."
    L "你知道不……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4519
translate schinese story01_7_6b21c301:

    # L "You're talkin' like they've already agreed."
    L "你说得好像她们已经答应了似的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4520
translate schinese story01_7_be0f4cc8:

    # L "And judging by their reaction, that ain't exactly a sure thing."
    L "从她们的反应看，可一点都不一定。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4523
translate schinese story01_7_60c7f830:

    # mc "Lia's not stupid."
    mc "莉娅不傻。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4524
translate schinese story01_7_1c777fa4:

    # mc "She knows she doesn't have much of a choice."
    mc "她知道自己没什么选择。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4526
translate schinese story01_7_b765e248:

    # L "Well, damn."
    L "嚯。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4527
translate schinese story01_7_6cfeb313:

    # L "We are talkin' about the same Lia, right?"
    L "我们说的是同一个莉娅吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4529
translate schinese story01_7_c72e2021:

    # mc "She already invited me to join her team."
    mc "她已经邀请我加入她的队伍了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4530
translate schinese story01_7_1d72d2d1:

    # mc "Figure that might work in our favor."
    mc "我觉得这对我们有利。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4548
translate schinese story01_7_aa2aae49:

    # bot "YOU?!"
    bot "就你？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4549
translate schinese story01_7_d8e0e88f:

    # mc "That was pretty much my face when it happened."
    mc "当时我的表情基本就是这样。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4551
translate schinese story01_7_074f9a85:

    # L "If it weren't for your ability, I wouldn't believe ya."
    L "要不是知道你的能力，我才不信。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4552
translate schinese story01_7_9d8ae7da:

    # mc "Mean. What happened to all that faith you had in me?"
    mc "真是的。你对我的信任都哪儿去了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4554
translate schinese story01_7_98c1a456:

    # L "Did ya forget what kinda reputation she's got?"
    L "你忘了她是什么名声？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4555
translate schinese story01_7_722a774b:

    # L "Not just in the city. Across the whole kingdom."
    L "不只是在这座城里。整个王国都是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4557
translate schinese story01_7_b1615bd0:

    # mc "Not too long ago, an F-rank ability was practically a myth."
    mc "就在不久前，F级能力还几乎是传说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4558
translate schinese story01_7_e20cff82:

    # mc "And yet, here it is. Standing right in front of you."
    mc "可现在它就在你面前。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4561
translate schinese story01_7_557f65b9:

    # "All applicants, please proceed to your examination rooms."
    "全体考生请前往各自的考场。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4562
translate schinese story01_7_3b0dda0c:

    # mc "Alright. Don't overthink it."
    mc "好。别想太多。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4563
translate schinese story01_7_7e355e0d:

    # mc "We should get going."
    mc "我们该走了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4566
translate schinese story01_7_f67aa45b:

    # L "I'm rootin' for ya."
    L "我给你加油。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4576
translate schinese story01_8_e20435cc:

    # r "By the way, ya never counted this stage. Why's that?"
    r "对了，你一直没算这一阶段。为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4577
translate schinese story01_8_c0e9c5c9:

    # mc "C'mon. A couple morality questions, a few math problems, and that's it."
    mc "得了。几道道德题，几个数学题，就这样。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4578
translate schinese story01_8_5ac5cc4f:

    # mc "Anyone can pass that."
    mc "谁都能过。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4581
translate schinese story01_8_c7a80c62:

    # r "Don't go underratin' it. Math trips a whole lotta folks up."
    r "别小看它。数学能坑倒一大票人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4582
translate schinese story01_8_042f1ecb:

    # r "For some, it's worse than a duel."
    r "对有些人来说，比决斗还可怕。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4583
translate schinese story01_8_9d9ec9ce:

    # r "Statistically speakin', seventy-two percent fail the written stage."
    r "按概率算，百分之七十二的人笔试不及格。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4584
translate schinese story01_8_be3ee095:

    # mc "Fail as in get kicked out?"
    mc "不及格是被淘汰那种吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4585
translate schinese story01_8_23edae16:

    # r "Fail as in score below the benchmark."
    r "是分数低于基准线。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4586
translate schinese story01_8_c2f54e09:

    # r "They still move on. Just with fewer points."
    r "他们照样晋级。只是分数少一些。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4588
translate schinese story01_8_e9e23aca:

    # mc "I don't care about anyone else."
    mc "我不在乎别人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4589
translate schinese story01_8_c367a8a2:

    # mc "How are you two with math?"
    mc "你们俩数学怎么样？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4590
translate schinese story01_8_8403c651:

    # mc "Actually, Rose, you don't have to answer. Alice?"
    mc "算了，罗丝你不用答。艾丽西亚？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4591
translate schinese story01_8_f6cda8a0:

    # an "I-it's hard..."
    an "很、很难……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4592
translate schinese story01_8_209b8429:

    # an "I-I understand it... w-well enough, I think..."
    an "我、我能理解……应、应该够用吧……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4593
translate schinese story01_8_6f82f395:

    # an "B-but it t-takes me a l-long time."
    an "可、可是要花很长、很长时间。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4595
translate schinese story01_8_bf4a2086:

    # mc "That's enough."
    mc "那就够了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4596
translate schinese story01_8_9ce0a7dd:

    # mc "Then we'll survive the written stage."
    mc "那我们笔试能过。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4597
translate schinese story01_8_c4e97800:

    # mc "And since we've got a few minutes before the Academy's next attempt to ruin my day..."
    mc "反正学院离再一次毁掉我心情还有几分钟……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4598
translate schinese story01_8_443a73b2:

    # mc "Team meeting time!"
    mc "队伍会议时间！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4599
translate schinese story01_8_b572f02c:

    # mc "We're kinda a team now, right? Which means we need a superhero name!"
    mc "我们现在算是支队伍了吧？那就得有个超级英雄式的队名！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4601
translate schinese story01_8_d4ab14aa:

    # r "Statistically, teams with names win fifty-two percent more often than teams without one."
    r "按概率算，有队名的队伍胜率高百分之五十二。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4602
translate schinese story01_8_1b390592:

    # r "Purely theoretically, gettin' one wouldn't be a bad idea."
    r "纯理论上，取一个也不坏。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4603
translate schinese story01_8_b4242e0c:

    # r "Also, it's cool."
    r "而且很酷。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4605
translate schinese story01_8_a1840de5:

    # an "I-I... d-don't mind."
    an "我、我……不、不介意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4608
translate schinese story01_8_4c756cb1:

    # mc "A name, right..."
    mc "队名啊……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4610
translate schinese story01_8_bfaa9506:

    # mc "(Something dramatic, maybe. Black Hawk? White Wolves? Swift Blade?)"
    mc "（要够震撼的。黑鹰？白狼？疾风之刃？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4613
translate schinese story01_8_b75b7da9:

    # mc "(No, sounds weird... Akatsuki? Nah, too fancy.)"
    mc "（不行，太怪了……晓？算了，太中二。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4614
translate schinese story01_8_4d3eddad:

    # mc "(Gotei 13? Wrong setting. Survey Corps, maybe? We do have titans, kinda...)"
    mc "（护德十三队？画风不对。调查兵团？不过我们倒是有“巨人”……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4616
translate schinese story01_8_519c8a5e:

    # mc "(Nope. Doesn't fit. Last thing we need is for people to think we've got eighth-grader syndrome.)"
    mc "（不行。不搭。我们最不需要的就是被人当成中二病。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4624
translate schinese story01_8_aaa0670f:

    # mc "(Technically, we could just call ourselves clowns. Kinda original.)"
    mc "（严格来说，我们直接叫“小丑”也行。挺有创意的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4627
translate schinese story01_8_5a8b3201:

    # mc "Circus? Honestly, I got no clue."
    mc "马戏团？说实话，我完全没主意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4628
translate schinese story01_8_8d2877a1:

    # mc "I've always been terrible with names."
    mc "我起名字一直很烂。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4630
translate schinese story01_8_91c8e45d:

    # mc "Any ideas?"
    mc "有人有想法吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4632
translate schinese story01_8_6e9b2353:

    # r "That's Alice's department."
    r "那是艾丽西亚的领域。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4633
translate schinese story01_8_c640e51c:

    # r "Unless ya wanna call us Team Pi."
    r "除非你想叫“π队”。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4635
translate schinese story01_8_44525895:

    # an "A n-name..."
    an "队、队名……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4638
translate schinese story01_8_80cae697:

    # an "M-maybe... instead of m-making something up..."
    an "或、或许……与其自己编一个……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4639
translate schinese story01_8_34cfded6:

    # an "W-we could name ourselves after s-something that... y'know..."
    an "我、我们可以拿某样东西命名……就、就是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4640
translate schinese story01_8_789dae37:

    # an "R-represents us?"
    an "能、能代表我们的东西？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4641
translate schinese story01_8_b82645c9:

    # an "O-or... maybe s-some kind of object..."
    an "或、或者……某种物品……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4646
translate schinese story01_8_08929c61:

    # mc "Hm... Now that's actually useful advice."
    mc "嗯……这倒是个有用的建议。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4647
translate schinese story01_8_45142189:

    # mc "Naming ourselves after an object is pretty original. What d'ya think, Rose?"
    mc "用物品命名挺有创意。罗丝，你怎么看？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4649
translate schinese story01_8_5b3a8d46:

    # r "Theoretically, it's a good idea."
    r "理论上是个好主意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4650
translate schinese story01_8_aa38713f:

    # r "Practically, it depends on the object."
    r "实际上，取决于那是什么东西。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4652
translate schinese story01_8_a19d2ac7:

    # mc "Hm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4664
translate schinese story01_8_eac00dea:

    # an "N-nothing's c-coming to mind?"
    an "没、没有东西想到吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4666
translate schinese story01_8_ab135ad0:

    # mc "(I do have one idea, but...)"
    mc "（我倒是有一个想法，可是……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4668
translate schinese story01_8_5e332167:

    # mc "Hmm......................."
    mc "嗯………………"

# game/story01en.rpy:4672
translate schinese story01_8_30cc7efe:

    # mc "Alright, I'll find something suitable."
    mc "好吧，我去找个合适的东西。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4677
translate schinese story01_8_4a692e62:

    # mc "(Brick, bat, furry collection—)"
    mc "（砖头、球棒、毛绒玩具收藏——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4678
translate schinese story01_8_faf11543:

    # r "Hic— Ma!"
    r "嗝——妈！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4681
translate schinese story01_8_2c347998:

    # mc "(Beer? Eh, whatever.)"
    mc "（啤酒？算了，无所谓。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4682
translate schinese story01_8_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4686
translate schinese story01_8_c57d09cf:

    # r "(I'm keepin' this.)"
    r "（这个我记下了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4687
translate schinese story01_8_2da192c9:

    # an "S-soh-ry if this is a s-silly question, b-but..."
    an "对、对不起，这个问题可能很傻，可、可是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4688
translate schinese story01_8_5bd6977d:

    # an "Wh-where do ya even keep all that stuff?"
    an "你、你到底把那些东西放哪儿啊？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4689
translate schinese story01_8_1ac45cec:

    # mc "Let's just say I'm pretty good at packing things."
    mc "就说我很擅长收拾东西吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4692
translate schinese story01_8_6318f1e4:

    # k "Mm?"
    k "嗯？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4693
translate schinese story01_8_456ff01f:

    # r "(A woman?)"
    r "（女人？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4696
translate schinese story01_8_0f40f45a:

    # "The woman swallowed whatever she had been chewing."
    "女人把嘴里的东西咽了下去。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4698
translate schinese story01_8_2598a943:

    # k "Morning."
    k "早上好。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4701
translate schinese story01_8_311b6c22:

    # k "Bye."
    k "再见。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4718
translate schinese story01_8_b9b755e5_1:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4719
translate schinese story01_8_3548d788:

    # r "(Optics are actin' up again...)"
    r "（视觉系统又出问题了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4722
translate schinese story01_8_c07a973d:

    # r "(But the beer sure feels real enough.)"
    r "（不过啤酒的触感倒是够真实。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4723
translate schinese story01_8_25cb6a6f:

    # r "(Or maybe...)"
    r "（又或者……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4726
translate schinese story01_8_1a2554ae:

    # r "...nice an' cold."
    r "……冰凉爽口。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4728
translate schinese story01_8_bd884cdf:

    # mc "Yo, hate to interrupt your, let's call it emotional ecstasy, but..."
    mc "喂，虽然不想打断你——姑且称之为情感高潮吧——但是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4729
translate schinese story01_8_5be25474:

    # mc "The exam's right around the cor—"
    mc "考试马上就在转角那——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4731
translate schinese story01_8_f3a1502a:

    # mc "Actually, y'know what? Forget it."
    mc "算了，当我没说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4732
translate schinese story01_8_0c8d042f:

    # mc "Enjoy it! I guess."
    mc "你就好好享受吧！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4734
translate schinese story01_8_cefa0115:

    # mc "(If it helps her even a little, fine by me.)"
    mc "（只要能让她好受一点，我也无所谓。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4735
translate schinese story01_8_8c0a5110:

    # mc "(Still, hopefully one bottle's not enough to get her wasted...)"
    mc "（不过但愿一瓶还灌不醉她……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4736
translate schinese story01_8_34e3c2dd:

    # mc "(Right?)"
    mc "（对吧？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4737
translate schinese story01_8_93ea4742:

    # r "Analyzin' your behavior, there's an eighty-four percent chance ya wanna ask me somethin'."
    r "分析你的行为，有百分之八十四的概率你想问我什么。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4739
translate schinese story01_8_9c3c28fa:

    # mc "See, I was thinking..."
    mc "你看，我在想……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4740
translate schinese story01_8_182d8abf:

    # mc "I know this question is awful, but now it's living in my head rent-free."
    mc "我知道这问题很蠢，但它现在在我脑子里免费住了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4741
translate schinese story01_8_e1c78822:

    # mc "You're an android, right? So where do all the liquids go?"
    mc "你是安卓机器人对吧？那喝下去的水都去哪了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4743
translate schinese story01_8_ae483323:

    # r "...are ya askin' if I go to the bathroom?"
    r "……你是在问我会不会上厕所吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4744
translate schinese story01_8_e19e004f:

    # r "Seriously?"
    r "认真的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4746
translate schinese story01_8_fbc0a425:

    # mc "I'll admit, I'm a little curious."
    mc "我承认，我有点好奇。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4755
translate schinese story01_8_43765197:

    # r "Statistically, nobody asks that."
    r "按概率算，没人会问这个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4756
translate schinese story01_8_8b4899fc:

    # r "Not that straight-up, anyway... which makes you guys weird."
    r "至少不会问得这么直接……所以你们很奇怪。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4758
translate schinese story01_8_cc6cf84c:

    # mc "Well, you'd know better than me."
    mc "这个你比我懂。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4762
translate schinese story01_8_ed1b2186:

    # mc "Anyway, here it is."
    mc "总之，给你看个东西。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4763
translate schinese story01_8_d5163dff:

    # mc "The perfect symbol for our team."
    mc "我们队伍最完美的象征。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4766
translate schinese story01_8_461e9506:

    # "Ta-da! The clown nose gleamed."
    "锵！小丑鼻子闪闪发亮。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4767
translate schinese story01_8_737794f9:

    # r "...you're kiddin', right?"
    r "……你开玩笑吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4768
translate schinese story01_8_099dda0f:

    # mc "Not exactly."
    mc "不完全是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4772
translate schinese story01_8_dc31bd2a:

    # mc "This is for tomorrow's stage."
    mc "这是为明天准备的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4773
translate schinese story01_8_5c0f4212:

    # mc "Best kind of fight is the one you win before anyone swings."
    mc "最好的战斗，是在没人出手之前就赢下。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4775
translate schinese story01_8_a19d2ac7_1:

    # mc "Hm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4776
translate schinese story01_8_08ae22a5:

    # an "(I-it's cute...)"
    an "（好、好可爱……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4777
translate schinese story01_8_e9fc3391:

    # an "(Th-that little nose looks kinda cute.)"
    an "（那、那个小鼻子还挺可爱的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4778
translate schinese story01_8_9a2bf62f:

    # r "I don't get how a clown nose ties into tomorrow's physical trial."
    r "我不明白小丑鼻子跟明天体测有什么关系。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4779
translate schinese story01_8_91538c23:

    # r "Let alone our team symbol."
    r "更别说当队徽了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4781
translate schinese story01_8_00b35bdc:

    # mc "Tell me, clanker. What would you do if you saw a team of clowns?"
    mc "告诉我，铁皮。如果你看到一支小丑队伍会怎么做？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4782
translate schinese story01_8_30edb818:

    # r "I'd freeze up."
    r "我会愣在原地。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4783
translate schinese story01_8_00c5a493:

    # mc "Exactly!"
    mc "正是！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4786
translate schinese story01_8_6e9b3078:

    # r "Still, percentage-wise, the payoff's way too low to wreck our reputation over it."
    r "可从概率上看，这收益太低了，不值得为它搭上我们的名声。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4787
translate schinese story01_8_281aa649:

    # mc "Tomorrow, everyone's gonna be flexing."
    mc "明天所有人都会秀肌肉。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4788
translate schinese story01_8_abd58f1f:

    # mc "Which means everyone'll be looking for the strong, the dangerous, the confident."
    mc "也就是所有人都会去找强的、危险的、气势十足的人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4790
translate schinese story01_8_ad4d2762:

    # mc "Now picture this: a team of clowns walks out."
    mc "现在想象一下：一支小丑队伍走了出来。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4791
translate schinese story01_8_7bd37e1e:

    # mc "You laugh. You lose a second. You underestimate them."
    mc "你笑了。你慢了一秒。你低估了他们。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4792
translate schinese story01_8_49862142:

    # mc "And in a fight, one second is a luxury."
    mc "而在战斗里，一秒是奢侈的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4794
translate schinese story01_8_a19d2ac7_2:

    # mc "Hm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4804
translate schinese story01_8_6d91bdd4:

    # mc "Well, that's the main idea. The second one is..."
    mc "嗯，这是主要想法。第二个理由是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4805
translate schinese story01_8_8ee1ad77:

    # mc "I just kinda wanted to see how you two looked wearing it."
    mc "我只是想看看你们俩戴上的样子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4807
translate schinese story01_8_689800fc:

    # mc "And if I'm being honest..."
    mc "而且要我说实话……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4810
translate schinese story01_8_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4822
translate schinese story01_8_a19d2ac7_3:

    # mc "Hm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4823
translate schinese story01_8_3a31133f:

    # mc "(Alright, there's something to this.)"
    mc "（好吧，好像确实有点道理。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4833
translate schinese story01_8_956b9028:

    # mc "Okay, then..."
    mc "那就这样……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4834
translate schinese story01_8_3496a142:

    # mc "Working title: Circus."
    mc "暂定名：马戏团。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4836
translate schinese story01_8_b18b2162:

    # r "I'm against it."
    r "我反对。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4837
translate schinese story01_8_27f00744:

    # an "I-I like it..."
    an "我、我喜欢……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4838
translate schinese story01_8_5c95c965:

    # mc "Two against one. Democracy wins."
    mc "二比一。民主万岁。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4840
translate schinese story01_8_1365e649:

    # r "With a hundred-percent certainty, I do not wanna be associated with a clown nose."
    r "我百分之百确定，我一点也不想跟小丑鼻子扯上关系。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4841
translate schinese story01_8_6b61a803:

    # mc "(Wait...)"
    mc "（等等……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4842
translate schinese story01_8_18abefa0:

    # mc "(White hair...)"
    mc "（白头发……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4849
translate schinese story01_8_6ccc9c5f:

    # mc "(No. Please, not her.)"
    mc "（不。求你了，别是她。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4856
translate schinese story01_8_d320f3d4:

    # mc "(Whispering) Iza..."
    mc "（低声）伊莎……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4858
translate schinese story01_8_5aaaf1e3:

    # i "Why did you run away, [mc]?"
    i "你为什么要逃跑，[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4861
translate schinese story01_8_0c375632:

    # "[mc] collapses to the floor."
    "[mc]倒在地上。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4865
translate schinese story01_8_455b7d46:

    # r "Hey, [mc]?!"
    r "喂，[mc]？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4866
translate schinese story01_8_5e7534ec:

    # an "H-he..."
    an "他、他……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4868
translate schinese story01_8_36a46f4d:

    # i "(Whispering) [mc]?"
    i "（低声）[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4872
translate schinese story01_8_e843b011:

    # "A few years earlier."
    "几年前。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4878
translate schinese story01_8_f1afe47f:

    # i "Tell me, [mc]... what did you dream of becoming?"
    i "告诉我，[mc]……你曾经梦想成为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4879
translate schinese story01_8_0b7c6b0a:

    # mc "Why'd you bring that up all of a sudden, Iza?"
    mc "伊莎，你怎么突然问这个？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4881
translate schinese story01_8_5786d35a:

    # i "Dream, so that you may love... and love, so that you may dream."
    i "梦想，让你能够去爱……而爱，让你能够去梦想。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4883
translate schinese story01_8_2b42a320:

    # mc "And what's that supposed to mean?"
    mc "这话是什么意思？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4885
translate schinese story01_8_ab3eb59e:

    # i "I would very much like to hear your answer!"
    i "我非常想听你的回答！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4886
translate schinese story01_8_d56324b9:

    # mc "(Dreams, huh...)"
    mc "（梦想啊……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4888
translate schinese story01_8_25c01bbd:

    # mc "Without dreams, love turns into habit."
    mc "没有梦想，爱就会变成习惯。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4889
translate schinese story01_8_a4084746:

    # mc "And without love, a dream is just a pretty way to run from emptiness."
    mc "没有爱，梦想不过是逃避空洞的好听说法。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4890
translate schinese story01_8_eae9f439:

    # mc "Kinda like yin and yang. They complete each other."
    mc "有点像阴阳。两者互相补足。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4893
translate schinese story01_8_5bc985eb:

    # i "Then why are you so afraid to dream?"
    i "那你为什么这么害怕做梦？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4894
translate schinese story01_8_9d470139:

    # mc "Sentimentality, that's all. I don't see the point."
    mc "不过是感伤罢了。我看不出意义。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4897
translate schinese story01_8_a7926118:

    # i "There, you see? You simply have not realised it yet."
    i "看吧？你只是还没意识到。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4899
translate schinese story01_8_e593eb8d:

    # mc "(That smile of hers... They weren't kidding. Women are terrifying creatures.)"
    mc "（她那个笑……果然不是说着玩。女人真是可怕的生物。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4900
translate schinese story01_8_9d33d0fe:

    # mc "(One smile, and I'm already ready to spend my whole life for her.)"
    mc "（一个笑容，就够我为她付出一辈子。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4903
translate schinese story01_8_449dacdf:

    # mc "A beauty. No other word for it."
    mc "美人。找不到更合适的词。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4904
translate schinese story01_8_f2ad8375:

    # i "How cruel of you..."
    i "你真残忍……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4905
translate schinese story01_8_d499abe0:

    # mc "Manipulator."
    mc "操纵高手。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4907
translate schinese story01_8_87e909c3:

    # i "I am simply far too in love."
    i "我只是陷得太深。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4908
translate schinese story01_8_f59104d5:

    # mc "Which makes it even scarier..."
    mc "这就更可怕了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4910
translate schinese story01_8_c0e28778:

    # mc "I can't think straight because of you."
    mc "因为你，我根本没法正常思考。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4911
translate schinese story01_8_7a297ee5:

    # i "Was that... a confession?"
    i "那是……告白吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4913
translate schinese story01_8_85cec14c:

    # mc "You wanna hear it again?"
    mc "想再听一遍吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4914
translate schinese story01_8_b89f8997:

    # i "Yes... my prince."
    i "嗯……我的王子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4916
translate schinese story01_8_40626120:

    # mc "Your eyes are like emeralds, shining brighter than the stars in the night sky. Their—"
    mc "你的眼睛像翡翠，比夜空中的星辰还耀眼。它——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4919
translate schinese story01_8_9b3f66a6:

    # i "From the heart!"
    i "从心里说！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4921
translate schinese story01_8_bf35a87b:

    # i "*Pouts*"
    i "*鼓起腮帮子*"

# game/story01en.rpy:4922
translate schinese story01_8_5c090e89:

    # mc "...."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4924
translate schinese story01_8_96bd6acc:

    # i "[mc]?"
    i "[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4927
translate schinese story01_8_6befbc86:

    # mc "(Whispering) Love you."
    mc "（低声）我爱你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4928
translate schinese story01_8_1e76ada9:

    # mc "Is that enough?"
    mc "这样够了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4930
translate schinese story01_8_999b216a:

    # i "Yes."
    i "是的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4932
translate schinese story01_8_1a2ad125:

    # mc "Okay, that's enough. I'm getting embarrassed."
    mc "好了够了。我要不好意思了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4934
translate schinese story01_8_342ddecc:

    # i "A little more courage."
    i "再勇敢一点。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4935
translate schinese story01_8_12eeb335:

    # i "And believe in yourself..."
    i "还有相信自己……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4938
translate schinese story01_8_3d406cc3:

    # mc "Believe? Please. There's nobody better than me in this whole world!"
    mc "相信？得了吧。这世上没人比我更好了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4939
translate schinese story01_8_9f348a3a:

    # mc "In my imagination, anyway."
    mc "当然，这是在我自己的想象里。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4942
translate schinese story01_8_69683108:

    # i "I know. But you still have not answered me."
    i "我知道。可你还是没回答我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4944
translate schinese story01_8_e1311343:

    # mc "What I dreamed of becoming, huh..."
    mc "我梦想成为什么啊……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4945
translate schinese story01_8_fe95ada1:

    # mc "(Right. What did I dream of becoming? Becoming...)"
    mc "（对。我梦想成为什么？成为……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4946
translate schinese story01_8_6604cccb:

    # mc "(I don't even remember anymore...)"
    mc "（我都快不记得了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4947
translate schinese story01_8_5b665076:

    # mc "Maybe... a hero?"
    mc "也许……英雄？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4950
translate schinese story01_8_cfcf5fae:

    # i "Why?"
    i "为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4951
translate schinese story01_8_8b9bd535:

    # mc "It's cool. I'd be like a prince on a white horse!"
    mc "很酷啊。我会像白马王子一样！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4954
translate schinese story01_8_7ab67b8f:

    # i "But you are already that prince to me..."
    i "可你对我来说已经是那个王子了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4956
translate schinese story01_8_77aba508:

    # mc "Hey, Isabella, careful!"
    mc "喂，伊莎贝拉，小心！"

# game/story01en.rpy:4958
translate schinese story01_8_4181b65e:

    # i "Tell me, [mc]... is this not wonderful?"
    i "告诉我，[mc]……这样不美好吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4961
translate schinese story01_8_3bbae0c4:

    # i "Far away from the rest of the world... from doubt, from judgement... free."
    i "远离整个世界……远离怀疑、远离评判……自由自在。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4963
translate schinese story01_8_4cb6f3a6:

    # i "If this is not happiness... then what is?"
    i "如果这都不算幸福……那什么才算？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4965
translate schinese story01_8_d28608a7:

    # mc "A journey? Though, y'know, I think I like your version better."
    mc "一段旅程？不过说真的，我更喜欢你那个版本。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4966
translate schinese story01_8_92d7dc94:

    # i "A journey? You know... I rather like that."
    i "一段旅程？知道吗……我还挺喜欢的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4969
translate schinese story01_8_2f9a1447:

    # mc "You're mocking me, aren't you?"
    mc "你在笑话我，对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4970
translate schinese story01_8_0cdea309:

    # i "There is a little piece of you in that word... and to me, that matters most of all."
    i "那个词里有一点你的影子……而对我来说，这才是最重要的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4972
translate schinese story01_8_0c5746e3:

    # mc "(Even with my ability, she still...)"
    mc "（哪怕有那样的能力，她还是……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4973
translate schinese story01_8_a08cb26d:

    # mc "(Loves...)"
    mc "（爱着……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4975
translate schinese story01_8_bdcf30ce:

    # mc "You don't care about my ability?"
    mc "你不在意我的能力？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4976
translate schinese story01_8_f8e85ab8:

    # i "No. If it brings you joy, then it brings me joy as well."
    i "不在意。如果它能让你快乐，那对我而言也是快乐。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4978
translate schinese story01_8_1ea1bb10:

    # mc "Yeah, right. Your father seems pretty against me."
    mc "是啊，好吧。你父亲似乎很反对我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4980
translate schinese story01_8_84b64c72:

    # i "Is that truly what stops you?"
    i "真的是那让你退缩吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:4981
translate schinese story01_8_98b7095b:

    # mc "Then I wouldn't be here."
    mc "否则我就不会来了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4984
translate schinese story01_8_3a0ca21f:

    # i "I know."
    i "我知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4985
translate schinese story01_8_977734e7:

    # mc "(Something smells burnt...)"
    mc "（有股烧焦的味道……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4987
translate schinese story01_8_b63c1e60:

    # i "That is why we are here... far from everyone. Only you and me."
    i "所以我们才来这里……远离所有人。只有你和我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4988
translate schinese story01_8_199ca820:

    # mc "(Where's all this smoke coming from?)"
    mc "（这些烟是从哪儿来的？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4990
translate schinese story01_8_498757c1:

    # mc "(A house? What's happening?!)"
    mc "（房子？发生什么了？！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4992
translate schinese story01_8_47ecf030:

    # mc "Iza, we need to get ou—"
    mc "伊莎，我们得出去——"

# game/story01en.rpy:4995
translate schinese story01_8_4466d3f0:

    # i "Tell me, [mc]... why..."
    i "告诉我，[mc]……为什么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4996
translate schinese story01_8_bc9998ee:

    # mc "(Why?)"
    mc "（为什么？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:4998
translate schinese story01_8_497ab91c:

    # mc "W-what happened to your face..."
    mc "你、你脸上怎么回事……"

# game/story01en.rpy:4999
translate schinese story01_8_aac3bab2:

    # mc "(M-my body... won't move. Come on, damn it...)"
    mc "（我、我的身体……动不了。求你了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5000
translate schinese story01_8_22c18128:

    # mc "(Get her out...)"
    mc "（把她带出去……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5002
translate schinese story01_8_13750b47:

    # i "...run, [mc]."
    i "……快跑，[mc]。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5003
translate schinese story01_8_ca67667b:

    # mc "(Come on, move! Move, you useless damn body! MOVE!)"
    mc "（动起来！快点，你这个没用的身体！动啊！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5019
translate schinese story01_9_e6cf4c11:

    # mc "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!"
    mc "不————————！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5020
translate schinese story01_9_1cde4af7:

    # "A couple of hours later."
    "几小时后。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5022
translate schinese story01_9_5afd6d33:

    # mc "(That dream... ARE YOU KIDDING ME?!)"
    mc "（那个梦……你开什么玩笑？！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5023
translate schinese story01_9_a701efff:

    # mc "(WHY CAN'T I DO ANYTHING EVEN IN A DREAM?!)"
    mc "（为什么我连在梦里都什么都做不了？！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5027
translate schinese story01_9_99e2d892:

    # mc "(If I'd been even a little stronger, she would've...)"
    mc "（要是我当时再强一点，她就会……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5028
translate schinese story01_9_4eb40151:

    # mc "*Exhales*"
    mc "*呼出一口气*"

# game/story01en.rpy:5029
translate schinese story01_9_71c8146c:

    # mc "(Where am I?)"
    mc "（我在哪儿？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5030
translate schinese story01_9_9eba85f4:

    # mc "(Looks like an infirmary... Smells like...)"
    mc "（看着像医务室……闻起来像……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5031
translate schinese story01_9_c647cc01:

    # mc "...familiar stink."
    mc "……熟悉的臭味。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5033
translate schinese story01_9_b68ee876:

    # "Looking around, [mc] noticed Curator Mia reading a book."
    "[mc]环顾四周，发现策展人米娅正在看书。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5034
translate schinese story01_9_4a8b8217:

    # mc "Well, well. Came to steal my phone again? Or just to gloat?"
    mc "哟，哟。又来偷我手机？还是来炫耀的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5035
translate schinese story01_9_de6654df:

    # mc "Either way, I'm against it."
    mc "不管哪种，我都反对。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5037
translate schinese story01_9_2b6b6cc3:

    # Mi "We're alone here. So be a good lad and drop the little act."
    Mi "这里没别人。乖乖的，别演了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5039
translate schinese story01_9_77aef47f:

    # mc "Don't remember adding you to my friends list."
    mc "我可不记得把你加进好友列表。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5041
translate schinese story01_9_b47c885f:

    # Mi "Trust me, love, ya really don't want me for an enemy."
    Mi "相信我，亲爱的，你真不想把我当敌人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5043
translate schinese story01_9_fcc27345:

    # mc "Fair enough. So, what happened?"
    mc "有道理。那么，发生了什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5045
translate schinese story01_9_5b50f4a0:

    # Mi "First, you're not dead. Which is grand."
    Mi "第一，你没死。真是可喜可贺。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5046
translate schinese story01_9_859d32db:

    # Mi "Second, ya failed. Didn't pass the written test."
    Mi "第二，你挂了。笔试没过。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5048
translate schinese story01_9_7e6b5ca7:

    # mc "What about the others?"
    mc "其他人呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5052
translate schinese story01_9_41a9a828:

    # Mi "Does that really matter right now?"
    Mi "这现在真的重要吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5054
translate schinese story01_9_3535e975:

    # mc "And why do you care?"
    mc "你为什么这么在意？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5056
translate schinese story01_9_c526e13e:

    # Mi "I'll say it one last time. Enough with the act."
    Mi "我最后说一遍。别演了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5059
translate schinese story01_9_7abd3f61:

    # mc "(No. Calm down. Drop the emotions. We've been through this already.)"
    mc "（不。冷静。把情绪放下。我们早就经历过了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5060
translate schinese story01_9_4e5a0352:

    # mc "(A cold head and pragmatism. That's the key to success.)"
    mc "（冷静的头脑和务实。这是成功的关键。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5062
translate schinese story01_9_28655c44:

    # mc "They trusted me as their leader."
    mc "他们信任我，把我当队长。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5063
translate schinese story01_9_92b948c2:

    # mc "And if they failed because of me..."
    mc "要是他们因为我才失败……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5064
translate schinese story01_9_16467dd0:

    # mc "Let's just say I wouldn't be thrilled."
    mc "我想我大概不会太高兴。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5066
translate schinese story01_9_c4a4d126:

    # Mi "(First thing he asks about... is my daughter?)"
    Mi "（他开口第一句……就问我女儿？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5069
translate schinese story01_9_9e1931a9:

    # Mi "You're not a bad lad, are ya, [mc]?"
    Mi "你小子人还不错嘛，[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5072
translate schinese story01_9_0e71044e:

    # mc "Don't get your hopes up. I just don't like abandoning my people."
    mc "别高兴太早。我只是不喜欢丢下自己人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5074
translate schinese story01_9_f935a515:

    # Mi "They passed."
    Mi "他们过了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5075
translate schinese story01_9_365f6124:

    # Mi "Both of 'em scored enough."
    Mi "两个都够线了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5076
translate schinese story01_9_bb0eeaf4:

    # mc "Thank you."
    mc "谢谢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5078
translate schinese story01_9_6e17bf1f:

    # Mi "(Cute.)"
    Mi "（真可爱。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5080
translate schinese story01_9_54a305d0:

    # Mi "Right then. What happened to ya?"
    Mi "好了。你这是怎么了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5082
translate schinese story01_9_c1b99d29:

    # mc "You already know, so why ask?"
    mc "你明明知道，还问？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5085
translate schinese story01_9_207e8997:

    # Mi "I'm beastkin, love. And we... like hearin' every little detail straight from the victim's mouth."
    Mi "我是兽裔，亲爱的。我们……喜欢听受害者亲口讲出每一个细节。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5087
translate schinese story01_9_4b76dac4:

    # mc "And I, as a human being and Academy student, have every right to remain completely silent."
    mc "而我，作为一个人类兼学院学生，完全有权保持沉默。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5088
translate schinese story01_9_2a505aae:

    # mc "Article 13.2 of the stud—"
    mc "学生手册第十三——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5090
translate schinese story01_9_9dcdc3b2:

    # Mi "Don't start."
    Mi "别来这套。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5092
translate schinese story01_9_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5096
translate schinese story01_9_d6e33064:

    # Mi "D'ya know who brought ya here?"
    Mi "你知道是谁把你送来的吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5097
translate schinese story01_9_2e55d601:

    # Mi "Isabella."
    Mi "伊莎贝拉。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5099
translate schinese story01_9_081caa91:

    # mc "(She...)"
    mc "（她……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5101
translate schinese story01_9_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "我明白了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5103
translate schinese story01_9_a7ff52d1:

    # Mi "Not quite the reaction I was expectin'. Bit dull, that."
    Mi "跟我预想的反应不一样。真无聊。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5105
translate schinese story01_9_6bb0f4fa:

    # mc "The circus already performed today. Come back tomorrow."
    mc "马戏团今天已经演过了。明天再来吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5110
translate schinese story01_9_c3e89b71:

    # mc "(So I failed?)"
    mc "（所以我挂了？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5111
translate schinese story01_9_76c92501:

    # mc "Tell me, is there really no way to retake this part of the exam?"
    mc "告诉我，这部分真的没有补考机会吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5112
translate schinese story01_9_33138198:

    # Mi "One attempt. No exceptions."
    Mi "一次机会。没有例外。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5115
translate schinese story01_9_dcf87ede:

    # Mi "On the other hand... I'm curious what keeps ya movin'."
    Mi "不过话说回来……我很好奇是什么支撑着你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5116
translate schinese story01_9_342bfd4f:

    # mc "Same thing as everyone else."
    mc "跟所有人一样的东西。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5121
translate schinese story01_9_530655fd:

    # Mi "Here's some advice for ya. Drop it."
    Mi "给你个建议。放下吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5124
translate schinese story01_9_35f065a4:

    # mc "Run that by me again?"
    mc "你再说一遍？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5126
translate schinese story01_9_5fad6839:

    # Mi "I checked your profile. F-rank hero, good head on your shoulders... and that's about it."
    Mi "我查过你的档案。F级英雄，脑子不错……也就这些了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5127
translate schinese story01_9_af54ff26:

    # Mi "No skill, no talent. A loser."
    Mi "没技能，没天赋。是个输家。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5129
translate schinese story01_9_d714a7e4:

    # mc "Tell me, teacher..."
    mc "老师，告诉我……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5130
translate schinese story01_9_3f8efb00:

    # mc "Do you have a dream?"
    mc "你有梦想吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5131
translate schinese story01_9_da3fdbf1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5133
translate schinese story01_9_26059999:

    # mc "I'd recommend getting yourself a couple."
    mc "我建议你给自己也找一个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5134
translate schinese story01_9_b2fe09e0:

    # mc "Have a good day."
    mc "祝你今天愉快。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5137
translate schinese story01_9_cb24e69c:

    # Mi "(Sorry, love. Had to see what you'd do after losin'.)"
    Mi "（抱歉，亲爱的。得看看你输的时候会怎么做。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5143
translate schinese story01_9_dbb97f81:

    # Mi "Y'know, Charles doesn't like people meddlin' with the system."
    Mi "你知道，查尔斯不喜欢有人动手脚改制度。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5144
translate schinese story01_9_746eaf44:

    # Mi "And when he finds out someone changed the exam result, I'll be in trouble."
    Mi "而一旦他发现有人改了考试成绩，我就麻烦了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5146
translate schinese story01_9_cdfe20b3:

    # Mi "He scored enough even without ya."
    Mi "没有你，他分数也够了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5147
translate schinese story01_9_a836d5ec:

    # Mi "Ya didn't save him."
    Mi "你并没有救他。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5148
translate schinese story01_9_9702bbd4:

    # Mi "Ya changed the outcome without knowin' what the outcome was."
    Mi "你在不知道结果的情况下改变了结果。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5149
translate schinese story01_9_6a7ed7cf:

    # Mi "That's worse. It leaves a pattern."
    Mi "这更糟。会留下规律。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5157
translate schinese story01_9_d0ab2077:

    # b "I'll have a word with Charles meself."
    b "我自己去找查尔斯谈。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5158
translate schinese story01_9_9a9d6c56:

    # b "Cheers, Mia."
    b "谢了，米娅。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5160
translate schinese story01_9_d9d42106:

    # Mi "Why didn't ya tell him yourself?"
    Mi "你为什么不自己去告诉他？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5163
translate schinese story01_9_af06ff70:

    # b "He'd bloody hate me."
    b "他会恨死我的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5165
translate schinese story01_9_da1ae991:

    # Mi "He'll hate you either way."
    Mi "反正他都会恨你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5166
translate schinese story01_9_258605c6:

    # Mi "Lad's too sharp not to."
    Mi "那小子太聪明，不可能发现不了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5168
translate schinese story01_9_edfd392b:

    # b "Yeah. I know."
    b "嗯。我知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5171
translate schinese story01_9_fc673bdc:

    # Mi "(Imagine that. Third of the Seven Heroes... turns out to be an F-rank's big sister.)"
    Mi "（瞧瞧。七英雄中的第三位……居然是个F级的姐姐。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5172
translate schinese story01_9_9dc2a5e8:

    # Mi "(World's a bloody unfair place.)"
    Mi "（这世界真他妈不公平。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5175
translate schinese story01_9_7513715f:

    # "The Third of the Seven Heroes, Beatrice."
    "七英雄中的第三位，碧翠丝。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5177
translate schinese story01_9_7b88330c:

    # b "He's my whole bleedin' world. As for the rest? I couldn't give a fuck."
    b "他就是我整个该死的世界。至于其他？我一点都不在乎。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5179
translate schinese story01_9_d8be13cd:

    # Mi "Trust me, I can see that. You kicked up such a storm back there, we barely managed to bury it."
    Mi "相信我看得很清楚。你刚才闹出那么大动静，我们差点压不下去。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5180
translate schinese story01_9_94d9be8d:

    # Mi "But y'know, he despises methods like that. Adam, I mean."
    Mi "但你知道，他最恨这种手段。我是说，亚当。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5182
translate schinese story01_9_1b3a7d26:

    # b "He's got a clean heart."
    b "他心地干净。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5183
translate schinese story01_9_9c7bac1c:

    # b "No need for him to know about the dirty work."
    b "没必要让他知道那些脏活。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5184
translate schinese story01_9_7facab68:

    # Mi "Suit yourself. I've warned ya."
    Mi "随你。我可提醒过你了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5187
translate schinese story01_9_f5a19125:

    # "Director's office."
    "校长办公室。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5188
translate schinese story01_9_808b8db8:

    # npc1 "Sir, someone interfered with our testing system!"
    npc1 "报告！有人干扰了我们的考试系统！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5190
translate schinese story01_9_e31b2e2a:

    # c "Find whoever did this. You have thirty minutes."
    c "找出是谁。你有三十分钟。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5196
translate schinese story01_9_8aa9ee4e:

    # c "(What was the point of shaving off two marks?)"
    c "（扣两分有什么意义？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5197
translate schinese story01_9_4ef4ab63:

    # c "(If they knew his actual result...)"
    c "（要是他们知道他的真实成绩……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5198
translate schinese story01_9_2e8691fa:

    # c "(they wouldn't have touched him at all.)"
    c "（根本不会动他。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5199
translate schinese story01_9_bd2cc65f:

    # c "(Which means they tampered with it blind.)"
    c "（也就是说，他们是盲改的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5201
translate schinese story01_9_080db25d:

    # c "(Curious.)"
    c "（有意思。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5211
translate schinese story01_9_31828b53:

    # mc "*Sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/story01en.rpy:5214
translate schinese story01_9_7f24091b:

    # mc "(And here I am.)"
    mc "（而我又在这儿。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5215
translate schinese story01_9_362b4786:

    # mc "(Same as a year ago.)"
    mc "（跟一年前一模一样。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5217
translate schinese story01_9_eee46ffa:

    # mc "(Failed again.)"
    mc "（又失败了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5218
translate schinese story01_9_e4030b4a:

    # mc "(Days pass, years fly by, and I'm still as useless as ever.)"
    mc "（日子一天天过去，年头飞逝，我还是一如既往地没用。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5220
translate schinese story01_9_70060d0e:

    # mc "(Dreams, luck, why... WHY IS THE WHOLE WORLD AGAINST ME?!)"
    mc "（梦想也好，运气也罢，凭什么……为什么全世界都在跟我作对？！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5221
translate schinese story01_9_5826ca0b:

    # mc "(What the hell did I do to deserve all this?!)"
    mc "（我到底做了什么才要承受这些？！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5223
translate schinese story01_9_296955cd:

    # mc "(Whispering) Yeah... what did I do..."
    mc "（低声）对啊……我做了什么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5229
translate schinese story01_9_8a4b79d2:

    # mc "(I should be grateful to them, so why... why am I so damn angry?)"
    mc "（我本该感谢他们，可为什么……为什么我他妈这么愤怒？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5232
translate schinese story01_9_3f3eb2c8:

    # mc "(At myself... and my own weakness.)"
    mc "（气的是自己……还有自己的软弱。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5235
translate schinese story01_9_31bf8824:

    # "He starts laughing louder."
    "他的笑声越来越大。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5236
translate schinese story01_9_ca136281:

    # npc1 "Has he lost his mind?"
    npc1 "他疯了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5238
translate schinese story01_9_be10ba9d:

    # npc2 "Forget it. Guess he failed today's exam and now he's throwing a tantrum."
    npc2 "算了。八成是今天考试没过，在这儿撒泼。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5239
translate schinese story01_9_68a64d4b:

    # npc2 "C'mon. That clown's giving me the creeps."
    npc2 "走了。那小丑看得我发毛。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5241
translate schinese story01_9_d4695390:

    # mc "(I really am awful.)"
    mc "（我真的很差劲。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5245
translate schinese story01_9_b0bdedeb:

    # mc "(Whispering) Maybe I should jump?"
    mc "（低声）也许我该跳楼？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5247
translate schinese story01_9_16411555:

    # mc "(No.)"
    mc "（不。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5248
translate schinese story01_9_6cb699af:

    # mc "(Not yet.)"
    mc "（还不到。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5256
translate schinese story01_9_24859831:

    # mc "*Spits blood*"
    mc "*吐出一口血*"

# game/story01en.rpy:5257
translate schinese story01_9_36b8447f:

    # mc "(Get it together, you spineless mess. Who said the path of a hero was gonna be easy?)"
    mc "（振作起来，你这个没骨气的废物。谁说英雄之路会好走了？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5262
translate schinese story01_9_5c2375ed:

    # mc "(Yeah, you failed. Fell face-first into the dirt. But you still scored more than half the points.)"
    mc "（是啊，你失败了，脸先着地。但你还是拿到了超过一半的分数。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5264
translate schinese story01_9_56b80b05:

    # mc "(There's still one day left. I'll get enough points to make it in, whatever it cos—)"
    mc "（还剩一天。不管付出什么代价，我都要拿到足够的分数挤进去——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5273
translate schinese story01_9_47636daa:

    # an "A-alive..."
    an "还、还活着……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5274
translate schinese story01_9_dad7896f:

    # an "W-we were s-soh worried."
    an "我、我们好担心。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5275
translate schinese story01_9_555f1911:

    # an "(I-I got so scared wh-when he fell...)"
    an "（他、他倒下去的时候，我吓得……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5276
translate schinese story01_9_c08e036e:

    # an "(A-and I'm sooo glad h-he's okay.)"
    an "（而、而我好高兴他没事。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5278
translate schinese story01_9_10dd808a:

    # mc "(She... What are they doing here?)"
    mc "（她们……怎么会在这儿？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5279
translate schinese story01_9_f6a94ded:

    # r "Analyzin' your reaction, ya definitely weren't expectin' to see us."
    r "分析你的反应，你明显没想到会看见我们。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5281
translate schinese story01_9_52aeb5e4:

    # mc "Clanker? What are you two..."
    mc "铁皮？你俩怎么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5283
translate schinese story01_9_21a218cd:

    # r "Statistically, seventy-four percent of applicants fail the final stage."
    r "从统计数据上看，百分之七十四的考生会倒在最后一关。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5284
translate schinese story01_9_bd3b441d:

    # r "And don't look at me. I don't care."
    r "别看我。我才不在乎。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5286
translate schinese story01_9_d8d45448:

    # r "(There's a ninety-three percent chance I'm lyin' to him right now.)"
    r "（我现在有百分之九十三的概率在骗他。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5287
translate schinese story01_9_ce6bfb8d:

    # r "(Analysis says I look like an idiot.)"
    r "（分析结果显示，我看起来像个白痴。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5290
translate schinese story01_9_c689e1b4:

    # r "Well... maybe there was a 0.0001 percent chance I was worried."
    r "好吧……也许我担心的概率只有百分之零点零零零一。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5291
translate schinese story01_9_de4a493b:

    # r "Repeatin' myself, only 0.001 percent."
    r "我是有点啰嗦，但也才百分之零点零零一。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5292
translate schinese story01_9_a5ddf5a6:

    # mc "(She bumped it up a whole decimal in one sentence...)"
    mc "（她一句话就把概率提了整整一个数量级……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5295
translate schinese story01_9_fb91d839:

    # mc "You two are something else. I'm perfectly fi..."
    mc "你们两个真是绝了。我完全没……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5299
translate schinese story01_9_5942fafc:

    # mc "(Come on... do it.)"
    mc "（拜托……发作啊。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5300
translate schinese story01_9_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5301
translate schinese story01_9_2c47e48a:

    # an "[mc]?"
    an "[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5303
translate schinese story01_9_2485f494:

    # mc "I..."
    mc "我……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5305
translate schinese story01_9_c6cf83a1:

    # mc "I'm sorry. I let you down..."
    mc "对不起。是我拖了大家的后腿……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5307
translate schinese story01_9_b9b755e5:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5310
translate schinese story01_9_e8e38ec1:

    # an "..."
    an "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5312
translate schinese story01_9_63a924a3:

    # r "So... what're ya talkin' about?"
    r "所以……你们在说什么呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5314
translate schinese story01_9_afbba442:

    # an "I-I don't understand..."
    an "我、我听不懂……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5315
translate schinese story01_9_d3c13a38:

    # mc "We failed the third stage... didn't we?"
    mc "我们第三关没过……对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5317
translate schinese story01_9_742feea4:

    # r "Huh? Who told ya that?"
    r "哈？谁跟你说的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5318
translate schinese story01_9_81d01a3e:

    # mc "Mia?"
    mc "米娅？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5321
translate schinese story01_9_6b90ab3b:

    # r "HAH?!"
    r "哈？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5322
translate schinese story01_9_0383f76f:

    # r "ALICE?"
    r "艾丽西亚？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5325
translate schinese story01_9_cb36fe75:

    # an "Sh-she likes playing with p-people's emotions sometimes..."
    an "她、她有时候就是喜欢玩弄别、别人的感情……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5326
translate schinese story01_9_061e9953:

    # an "A-always..."
    an "一、一向如此……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5327
translate schinese story01_9_e29a46e3:

    # an "B-but... when it comes to e-exams..."
    an "可、可是……一到考、考场就……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5328
translate schinese story01_9_1309e8c5:

    # an "Th-this is the f-first time."
    an "这、这是第、第一次。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5330
translate schinese story01_9_1665ba1d:

    # mc "But I dragged everyone down with me."
    mc "可我把所有人都拖下水了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5332
translate schinese story01_9_3f71d394:

    # r "You passed out before finishing the written part."
    r "你笔试还没写完就晕过去了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5333
translate schinese story01_9_bbbff7c5:

    # r "But this year, the points are team-based."
    r "但今年是按团体算分的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5337
translate schinese story01_9_1098b6a1:

    # an "Wh-what are ya—"
    an "你、你要干什——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5338
translate schinese story01_9_3ed60e29:

    # mc "You really carried me through..."
    mc "今天真是多亏了你们……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5339
translate schinese story01_9_d2efecf2:

    # mc "Thank you..."
    mc "谢谢……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5343
translate schinese story01_9_7ebe9925:

    # an "N-no..."
    an "不、不是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5344
translate schinese story01_9_817615ef:

    # an "I-it's because of ya..."
    an "是、是因为你……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5345
translate schinese story01_9_fd94c303:

    # an "A-and your face..."
    an "还、还有你的脸……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5346
translate schinese story01_9_a70820f1:

    # an "Y-you're bleeding..."
    an "你、你在流血……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5348
translate schinese story01_9_6efe9cf9:

    # mc "Am I?"
    mc "是吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5349
translate schinese story01_9_937e3c97:

    # r "*Sighs*"
    r "*叹气*"

# game/story01en.rpy:5352
translate schinese story01_9_62d7e0e3:

    # an "D-does it hurt?"
    an "很、很疼吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5353
translate schinese story01_9_eaf7af77:

    # an "I-I'll... I'll fix it..."
    an "我、我来……我来处理……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5356
translate schinese story01_9_e157b71e:

    # an "W-wait, w-we need to patch up your wound..."
    an "等、等一下，我、我们得先把伤口包扎好……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5359
translate schinese story01_9_d1c0310d:

    # r "The preliminary test a couple weeks ago was harder than today's."
    r "几周前的初试比今天还难。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5360
translate schinese story01_9_903cb9ce:

    # r "So we talked the teacher into countin' part of your preliminary score toward today's written stage."
    r "所以我们说服老师，把你初试的一部分分数算进今天的笔试。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5361
translate schinese story01_9_446d858a:

    # r "With Mia's help, obviously."
    r "当然啦，这得谢谢米娅。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5363
translate schinese story01_9_3ebfb46c:

    # r "Just thinkin' about it... the best entrance-exam result..."
    r "光是想想……入学考试的最佳成绩……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5365
translate schinese story01_9_75d94696:

    # r "Man, you're a mons—"
    r "天啊，你真是个怪——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5367
translate schinese story01_9_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5368
translate schinese story01_9_bd56207f:

    # r "(What was that just now...)"
    r "（刚才那是什么……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5370
translate schinese story01_9_b9b755e5_1:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5371
translate schinese story01_9_3c133644:

    # r "(For a second, his smile...)"
    r "（刚才那一瞬间，他的笑容……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5372
translate schinese story01_9_859751a2:

    # r "(No. Must've imagined it.)"
    r "（不。一定是我的错觉。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5375
translate schinese story01_9_4028d1f2:

    # mc "YOU TWO ARE THE BEST!"
    mc "你们两个最棒了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5376
translate schinese story01_9_3ee85854:

    # r "HEY hey, I never gave ya permission to hug me!"
    r "喂、喂，我可没允许你抱我！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5377
translate schinese story01_9_cc5fd4cd:

    # an "(I-it's... not that bad...)"
    an "（没、没有……没那么严重……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5381
translate schinese story01_9_1b0703a6:

    # "Isabella watches from afar."
    "伊莎贝拉在远处注视着。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5382
translate schinese story01_9_00ced6f1:

    # i "(His smile... it is still as beautiful as it was back then.)"
    i "（他的笑容……依然和当年一样美丽。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5384
translate schinese story01_9_9e51b981:

    # i "(And... I know you, [mc]. You will overcome this. I am certain of it...)"
    i "（而且……我了解你，[mc]。你一定能跨越这道坎。我确信。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5385
translate schinese story01_9_d5c6675c:

    # npc1 "My lady, it is time."
    npc1 "小姐，该走了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5387
translate schinese story01_9_826fbf70:

    # i "Please, take care of yourself, [mc]."
    i "请您务必保重，[mc]。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5393
translate schinese story01_9_02c43cb2:

    # r "Alright, so what now?"
    r "好了，接下来干嘛？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5395
translate schinese story01_9_6cca1325:

    # mc "Honestly? No clue."
    mc "说实话？不知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5397
translate schinese story01_9_782f106f:

    # an "M-m-maybe... a café?"
    an "咖、咖、咖啡馆？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5399
translate schinese story01_9_64434043:

    # r "Can't. I gotta check on my mother."
    r "不行。我得去看看我妈。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5402
translate schinese story01_9_2c47e48a_1:

    # an "[mc]?"
    an "[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5404
translate schinese story01_9_4ce9c553:

    # mc "I'm going to Lena's tonight, so I can't."
    mc "我今晚要去莉娜家，所以不行。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5406
translate schinese story01_9_7c8c9525:

    # an "Oh..."
    an "哦……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5408
translate schinese story01_9_b9e9d9e1:

    # r "Is there somethin' between you two?"
    r "你们两个之间是不是有什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5409
translate schinese story01_9_b6f1ff0f:

    # r "Or are ya just friends?"
    r "还是说你们只是朋友？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5410
translate schinese story01_9_54aca855:

    # an "A-are you two n-not dating?"
    an "你、你们两个不、不是在交往吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5412
translate schinese story01_9_57b81167:

    # mc "No, nothing like that."
    mc "没有，没那回事。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5413
translate schinese story01_9_7ceb5a28:

    # mc "Where's all this curiosity coming from?"
    mc "你哪来这么大的好奇心？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5414
translate schinese story01_9_08fd406d:

    # r "Nothin'. Just askin'."
    r "没什么。随口问问。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5417
translate schinese story01_9_ac4554f1:

    # an "Oh...!"
    an "哦……！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5418
translate schinese story01_9_f6db12bf:

    # an "R-reeeally?!"
    an "真、真的假的？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5420
translate schinese story01_9_08df6d9e:

    # mc "(She's reacting a little too strongly to that...)"
    mc "（她对这事的反应有点过于激动了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5421
translate schinese story01_9_8a25663b:

    # an "Th-then... y-you don't have a girlfriend, r-right?"
    an "那、那么……你、你还没有女朋友，对、对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5423
translate schinese story01_9_b67afa92:

    # r "The probability of him havin' a girlfriend is extremely low."
    r "他有女朋友的概率极低。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5424
translate schinese story01_9_c7a09a28:

    # r "And even if he did have one, what difference would that make to you?"
    r "就算真有了，对你又有什么区别？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5427
translate schinese story01_9_d4a06133:

    # an "...y-you're right."
    an "……你、你说得对。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5428
translate schinese story01_9_606dee0f:

    # an "I-I just..."
    an "我、我只是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5429
translate schinese story01_9_5eafe30d:

    # an "(Wh-what's gotten into me all of a sudden?)"
    an "（我、我这是怎么了？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5431
translate schinese story01_9_ccb38c19:

    # mc "Wow. Nice to know you think so highly of me, firecracker."
    mc "哇。真高兴知道你这么看重我，小爆竹。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5433
translate schinese story01_9_ea385e21:

    # r "If ya walked around without makeup more often, your chances would be higher."
    r "你要是能多素颜出门，胜算会高一点。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5434
translate schinese story01_9_56ca794d:

    # r "As it stands, your face mostly causes either laughter or grief."
    r "就现在这样，你那张脸不是惹人发笑就是惹人悲伤。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5436
translate schinese story01_9_4858c8e0:

    # an "D-don't listen to her, [mc]..."
    an "别、别听她的，[mc]……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5437
translate schinese story01_9_9e441a2a:

    # an "Y-you're already very..."
    an "你、你已经很……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5438
translate schinese story01_9_fc21eedd:

    # an "V-very..."
    an "非、非常……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5440
translate schinese story01_9_dcd54147:

    # an "(Whispering) h-h-handsome."
    an "（低声）很、很、很帅。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5441
translate schinese story01_9_8f214892:

    # r "(Is it just me, or did I just get framed as the bitch here?)"
    r "（是我多心了，还是我刚被当成那个坏女人了？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5443
translate schinese story01_9_1bf8e337:

    # r "Anyway, I made us a group in the Academy app."
    r "总之，我在学院APP上建了个群。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5447
translate schinese story01_9_0b7358ad:

    # r "Check if everything's workin' on your end."
    r "看看你那边能不能正常用。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5448
translate schinese story01_9_dc3e686b:

    # an "Y-yeah, e-everything's there..."
    an "嗯、嗯，都、都看到了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5449
translate schinese story01_9_d70433c3:

    # an "B-but the g-group name..."
    an "可、可是群、群名……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5450
translate schinese story01_9_0942db43:

    # an "A-and wh-who's ThiccSaveLives?"
    an "还、还有谁、是ThiccSaveLives？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5452
translate schinese story01_9_11d89d4b:

    # mc "That's me. And you must be... Wait, sugarmommy3412?"
    mc "就是我。而你一定是……等等，sugarmommy3412？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5453
translate schinese story01_9_49e85ff4:

    # mc "Is that you, Alice?"
    mc "是你吗，艾丽西亚？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5455
translate schinese story01_9_b3143317:

    # an "I-it's a l-long story..."
    an "这、这是个很、很长很长的故事……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5456
translate schinese story01_9_f94ef199:

    # an "B-but... R-Rose?"
    an "可、可是……罗、罗丝？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5457
translate schinese story01_9_d180755a:

    # an "I-is that... ya?"
    an "那、那个人……是、是你？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5459
translate schinese story01_9_31ec6114:

    # mc "LickMyMagina? Seriously?"
    mc "LickMyMagina？不是吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5462
translate schinese story01_9_95e7e0a2:

    # r "Well, great then. We'll text later. I gotta go."
    r "行，那就这样，回头再聊。我先走了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5465
translate schinese story01_9_ed26bd05:

    # mc "Hold up."
    mc "等一下。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5466
translate schinese story01_9_9d612c04:

    # mc "About what happened earlier. Everything okay?"
    mc "刚才发生的事。你没事吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5467
translate schinese story01_9_2fa459c7:

    # r "Be more specific, would ya?"
    r "说具体点行不行？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5469
translate schinese story01_9_8abbeecb:

    # mc "The thing with the beer."
    mc "就是啤酒那件事。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5470
translate schinese story01_9_b9b755e5_2:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5471
translate schinese story01_9_26ef0d08:

    # r "(He's worried? Nah. More like he feels guilty.)"
    r "（他在担心？不，更像是内疚。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5473
translate schinese story01_9_c0ac35a3:

    # r "We already cleared that up between us."
    r "那件事我们之间已经说开了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5474
translate schinese story01_9_70731b08:

    # r "So no hard feelin's, alright?"
    r "所以别放在心上，好吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5476
translate schinese story01_9_6fadf795:

    # mc "No hard feelings."
    mc "没有芥蒂。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5477
translate schinese story01_9_b9b755e5_3:

    # r "..."
    r "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5480
translate schinese story01_9_b536929f:

    # mc "Good luck, clanker."
    mc "祝你好运，铁皮。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5481
translate schinese story01_9_1183f5d4:

    # an "G-go get 'em, R-Rose..."
    an "罗、罗丝，加油……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5483
translate schinese story01_9_f3e88998:

    # mc "(We've only known each other for a few hours... and somehow, so much has already changed.)"
    mc "（我们才认识几个小时……却好像已经改变了这么多。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5484
translate schinese story01_9_d9c204bb:

    # mc "(Strange thing, this Academy of yours.)"
    mc "（你们这学院，还真是奇怪。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5487
translate schinese story01_9_dfae3a4f:

    # an "Y-y'know, [mc]..."
    an "那、那个，[mc]……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5488
translate schinese story01_9_c3b56aee:

    # an "I-I reeeally liked t-today..."
    an "我、我真的很喜欢今、今天……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5489
translate schinese story01_9_562d39a8:

    # an "A-and..."
    an "还、还有……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5490
translate schinese story01_9_1d14c399:

    # an "I-I hope we can k-keep going like this!"
    an "我、我希望我们能这、这样一直下去！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5494
translate schinese story01_9_d514aba3:

    # an "D-did I say s-something wrong?"
    an "我、我说错什、什么话了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5496
translate schinese story01_9_6cdcbf2e:

    # mc "You're cute."
    mc "你很可爱。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5501
translate schinese story01_9_1c73c485:

    # an "I-I-I—I-I-I-I..."
    an "我、我、我——我、我、我……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5502
translate schinese story01_9_24f73384:

    # an "C-c-c-cute?!"
    an "可、可、可爱？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5507
translate schinese story01_9_1052df98:

    # an "I-it's... k-kinda embarrassing h-hearing that from ya..."
    an "从、从你嘴里听到这种话……有、有点让人难为情……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5508
translate schinese story01_9_ce6a7272:

    # an "M-me? C-cute?!"
    an "我、我？可、可爱？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5509
translate schinese story01_9_fbcfde4d:

    # an "I..."
    an "我……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5511
translate schinese story01_9_1a8c8859:

    # mc "A little more confidence, okay?"
    mc "再自信一点，好吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5512
translate schinese story01_9_144cbfca:

    # an "Mhm..."
    an "嗯……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5513
translate schinese story01_9_34c099f6:

    # mc "Good girl. Well, I should get going too. See you tomorrow, Alice."
    mc "乖。那我也该走了。明天见，艾丽西亚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5519
translate schinese story01_9_e8e38ec1_1:

    # an "..."
    an "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5522
translate schinese story01_9_2b79eea3:

    # mc "Hm? Forget something?"
    mc "嗯？忘了什么吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5528
translate schinese story01_9_99185615:

    # an "T-take care of yourself!"
    an "要、要保重啊！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5530
translate schinese story01_9_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5531
translate schinese story01_9_7a8bfc12:

    # mc "You too!"
    mc "你也是！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5537
translate schinese story01_9_9fb4a2d2:

    # mc "(I don't know what's gonna happen tomorrow, or how any of this is gonna turn out, but right now...)"
    mc "（我不知道明天会发生什么，也不知道这一切会走向何方，但是此刻……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5539
translate schinese story01_9_30602ed5:

    # mc "(It doesn't get much better than this.)"
    mc "（已经没有比这更好的了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5544
translate schinese story01_9_3e70fabb:

    # mc "(Now, Lena.)"
    mc "（接下来，莉娜。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5551
translate schinese story01_10_116496e6:

    # "Meanwhile, on the other side of the city."
    "与此同时，城市的另一头。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5554
translate schinese story01_10_d240328e:

    # a "...I had no choice, ma chère."
    a "……我别无选择，亲爱的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5555
translate schinese story01_10_978b6504:

    # a "Beatrice forced my hand."
    a "是碧翠丝逼我的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5556
translate schinese story01_10_ffd5013b:

    # a "Made me alter the exam documents."
    a "她逼我改了考试文件。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5557
translate schinese story01_10_fbc99c53:

    # li "Let her."
    li "随她吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5558
translate schinese story01_10_3e48eaa8:

    # li "That little favour may yet play in our favour."
    li "这点小人情，日后说不定能派上用场。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5559
translate schinese story01_10_39841483:

    # li "And Tia."
    li "还有蒂娅。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5560
translate schinese story01_10_e3caa9b0:

    # li "Get dressed. We have guests."
    li "穿好衣服。我们有客人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5561
translate schinese story01_10_19a855a6:

    # ti "Nope. Don't wanna."
    ti "不要。不想穿。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5562
translate schinese story01_10_620f5742:

    # ti "I'm still mad at ye."
    ti "俺还在生你的气呢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5564
translate schinese story01_10_27ef3307:

    # a "Lady Lia had her reasons, ma chère—"
    a "莉娅小姐自有她的理由，亲爱的——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5566
translate schinese story01_10_b818472a:

    # ti "Love ya, bunny, but be a dear and stay out of it."
    ti "俺爱你，小兔子，不过乖一点，别掺和进来。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5567
translate schinese story01_10_1e38d046:

    # ti "I had plans for that clown..."
    ti "俺本来对那个小丑另有打算……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5568
translate schinese story01_10_6dcedc5c:

    # ti "And you—"
    ti "还有你——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5570
translate schinese story01_10_da4b47a3:

    # li "You spoilt little degenerate."
    li "你这被宠坏的下等种。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5571
translate schinese story01_10_dbfef71d:

    # li "Far too many eyes are on him at the moment."
    li "现在盯着他的眼睛实在太多了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5573
translate schinese story01_10_b582884e:

    # a "Curator Mia, Director Charles, and..."
    a "策展人米娅、理事长查尔斯，还有……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5574
translate schinese story01_10_5862f0d2:

    # a "Madame herself."
    a "以及夫人本人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5576
translate schinese story01_10_60bd6d54:

    # ti "Oi, sis."
    ti "喂，姐姐。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5577
translate schinese story01_10_2feef604:

    # ti "Why didn't ye tell me Mother had her eye on him?"
    ti "你为什么没告诉我，母亲也盯上他了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5579
translate schinese story01_10_d887db54:

    # li "Because you would have lost what little sense you possess?"
    li "因为你会连仅剩的那点理智都丢掉？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5581
translate schinese story01_10_01cfee47:

    # ti "I need to have me fun with him before she gets interested!"
    ti "得赶在母亲上心之前，先跟俺的玩具玩个够！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5583
translate schinese story01_10_548f6176:

    # li "Do not rush. You will have your chance."
    li "别急。你的机会会有。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5585
translate schinese story01_10_dce83578:

    # ti "And what's stoppin' me from takin' him by force right now?"
    ti "那俺现在直接把他抢走，谁拦得住俺？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5587
translate schinese story01_10_03f0cdfd:

    # li "Try it."
    li "试试看。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5588
translate schinese story01_10_e20226ec:

    # li "There are at least two B-ranks hovering around him, not to mention that irritating A-rank slime."
    li "他身边至少有两个B级在徘徊，更别提那个碍眼的A级黏液怪了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5591
translate schinese story01_10_3151ac4c:

    # ti "Oi, don't take me for a fool."
    ti "喂，别把俺当傻子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5592
translate schinese story01_10_be213d8b:

    # ti "I don't recall a few B-ranks ever stoppin' us."
    ti "几个B级可从来没能拦住过我们。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5593
translate schinese story01_10_20c6532d:

    # ti "Father's mixed up in this, isn't he?"
    ti "父亲也掺和进去了，对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5595
translate schinese story01_10_c9a02d6a:

    # li "Well, well. You surprise me. So that head of yours can think after all."
    li "哦？真意外。看来你那颗脑袋还挺能思考的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5596
translate schinese story01_10_a60d4a9e:

    # ti "..."
    ti "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5597
translate schinese story01_10_4cc6a229:

    # ti "(That smirk of hers...)"
    ti "（她那副坏笑……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5598
translate schinese story01_10_ddf58096:

    # ti "(Like she knows everythin'...)"
    ti "（好像她什么都知道似的……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5599
translate schinese story01_10_2bc30e81:

    # ti "(Wonder what'd happen if I wiped it off her face...)"
    ti "（要是能把她那笑给抹掉就好了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5601
translate schinese story01_10_640140c8:

    # li "We have guests. Be so kind as to keep your bloodlust under control."
    li "我们有客人。劳驾把你的嗜血欲收一收。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5603
translate schinese story01_10_a3702665:

    # ti "Aye, aye. Sorry, sis."
    ti "是是是。对不起，姐姐。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5604
translate schinese story01_10_45f7dcb0:

    # ti "I keep forgettin'..."
    ti "我老是忘……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5607
translate schinese story01_10_2fd2ecd2:

    # li "Now is not the time to play the fool."
    li "现在不是装傻的时候。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5608
translate schinese story01_10_454d17fb:

    # li "Why did you take that clown's card?"
    li "你为什么拿走那个小丑的卡？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5610
translate schinese story01_10_81ca5293:

    # ti "As if ye don't know."
    ti "你会不知道吗。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5611
translate schinese story01_10_9829f729:

    # ti "To have some fun, obviously."
    ti "当然是为了好玩啊。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5613
translate schinese story01_10_f9f4cad4:

    # li "Do not lie to me."
    li "别对我撒谎。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5614
translate schinese story01_10_a60d4a9e_1:

    # ti "..."
    ti "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5616
translate schinese story01_10_68acb97b:

    # ti "D'ya know what yer problem is, sis?"
    ti "你知道你的毛病是什么吗，姐姐？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5617
translate schinese story01_10_2bf158b4:

    # ti "In the combat stage, you're useless."
    ti "战斗关的时候，你就是个废物。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5619
translate schinese story01_10_170cc3e9:

    # li "We have you."
    li "有我们顶着。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5621
translate schinese story01_10_db3982da:

    # ti "And I don't fancy carryin' yer arse all by meself."
    ti "俺可不想一个人扛着你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5623
translate schinese story01_10_708938ba:

    # li "Mind your tongue. I carried you today."
    li "说话注意点。今天是我扛的你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5625
translate schinese story01_10_984b5c51:

    # ti "Of course ye did."
    ti "当然是你扛的啊。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5626
translate schinese story01_10_a158a43d:

    # ti "Wouldn't want to miss yer chance to show off for Daddy, now would ye?"
    ti "还不是想在爸爸面前表现一番，怎么舍得错过？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5627
translate schinese story01_10_6aad7d41:

    # ti "But unlike you, I couldn't care less."
    ti "可俺跟姐姐不一样，俺压根不在乎。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5629
translate schinese story01_10_9e717813:

    # li "..."
    li "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5630
translate schinese story01_10_18ee2c86:

    # ti "Ohhh, now that's a gorgeous look!"
    ti "哦——现在这表情可真漂亮！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5631
translate schinese story01_10_e875b5bb:

    # ti "What a thrill..."
    ti "真让人兴奋……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5632
translate schinese story01_10_450a00fc:

    # li "(Madwoman.)"
    li "（疯女人。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5634
translate schinese story01_10_edaaf281:

    # li "What do you want?"
    li "你到底想要什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5636
translate schinese story01_10_97591aae:

    # li "No, foolish question. The clown. Why?"
    li "不，问得蠢。那个小丑。为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5638
translate schinese story01_10_4f8bef65:

    # ti "Ye were starin' at him an awful lot."
    ti "你盯着他看好一会儿了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5639
translate schinese story01_10_01434050:

    # ti "And I don't like it when ye steal me toys."
    ti "而且俺不喜欢别人抢俺的玩具。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5641
translate schinese story01_10_4cc9363d:

    # li "(Trade him for a pass through tomorrow's stage?)"
    li "（拿他换一张明天关卡的通行证？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5642
translate schinese story01_10_7cc713a3:

    # li "(Very well.)"
    li "（很好。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5643
translate schinese story01_10_9afeabdd:

    # li "(But there is one thing I cannot quite grasp. Where did this obsession with claiming him come from?)"
    li "（不过有一点我实在想不明白。你这股非要把他占为己有的执念，是从哪来的？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5645
translate schinese story01_10_ee7d28bf:

    # li "Why are you so desperate to get into his trousers?"
    li "你就这么急着钻进他的裤子里？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5647
translate schinese story01_10_58e5b80a:

    # ti "I liked him."
    ti "我喜欢他啊。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5648
translate schinese story01_10_dcb2377d:

    # li "...are you mocking me?"
    li "……你在耍我吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5649
translate schinese story01_10_ac3ec4f9:

    # ti "*Laughs*"
    ti "*笑*"

# game/story01en.rpy:5650
translate schinese story01_10_b839f617:

    # ti "Who knows?"
    ti "谁知道呢。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5662
translate schinese story01_10_1cde4af7:

    # "A couple of hours later."
    "几小时后。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5663
translate schinese story01_10_2d8b8886:

    # mc "(So much happened today... How the hell have I not gone insane yet?)"
    mc "（今天发生了这么多事……我怎么还没疯掉？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5664
translate schinese story01_10_d1cc239b:

    # mc "(Then again, I already ended up in the hospital... Twice!)"
    mc "（不过说真的，我已经进过医院了……两次！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5666
translate schinese story01_10_94561533:

    # mc "In two days. And I've got a feeling that's not even the limit."
    mc "就两天。而且我有种感觉，这还没到头。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5668
translate schinese story01_10_0c92816e:

    # mc "(Still... that last dream.)"
    mc "（不过……最后那个梦。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5669
translate schinese story01_10_147e6545:

    # mc "(A dream...)"
    mc "（是个梦……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5672
translate schinese story01_10_92643356:

    # mc "Can a clown be a hero too?"
    mc "小丑也能成为英雄吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5673
translate schinese story01_10_f49c20a5:

    # mc "(What even makes someone a hero? Ability? Reputation? Money...)"
    mc "（究竟什么才算英雄？实力？名声？金钱……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5675
translate schinese story01_10_fd0bae52:

    # mc "(Fame? Strength...)"
    mc "（名气？力量……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5676
translate schinese story01_10_71a74ce8:

    # mc "(Or maybe...)"
    mc "（又或者……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5678
translate schinese story01_10_e12ccd3f:

    # mc "(Wonder if anything would change if I jumped.)"
    mc "（要是跳下去，会不会有什么改变。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5684
translate schinese story01_10_b2f69bcf:

    # "A few minutes passed."
    "几分钟后。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5685
translate schinese story01_10_42a3cc07:

    # mc "...brings back memories."
    mc "……让人想起一些事。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5688
translate schinese story01_10_c60b37ea:

    # mc "*Laughs*"
    mc "*笑*"

# game/story01en.rpy:5689
translate schinese story01_10_16411555:

    # mc "(No.)"
    mc "（不。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5690
translate schinese story01_10_a02fe3b2:

    # mc "(I actually kinda liked today.)"
    mc "（我其实还挺喜欢今天的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5692
translate schinese story01_10_68a66da5:

    # mc "Nah. I don't want to."
    mc "算了。我不想。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5693
translate schinese story01_10_97936a09:

    # mc "(Too easy.)"
    mc "（太轻松了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5696
translate schinese story01_10_2ef840b2:

    # mc "(Lena and Beatrice would be sad. And knowing that slime...)"
    mc "（莉娜和碧翠丝会难过的。而且以那个黏液怪的性子……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5697
translate schinese story01_10_53769178:

    # mc "(She'd drag me back from the afterlife just to make me regret it.)"
    mc "（她会把我从死后世界拖回来，就为了让我后悔。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5700
translate schinese story01_10_9c739a72:

    # mc "(Still, I should enjoy the world a little more!)"
    mc "（不过，我还是该多享受一下这个世界！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5703
translate schinese story01_10_6d624f21:

    # mc "(The world...)"
    mc "（这个世界……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5705
translate schinese story01_10_011c1399:

    # mc "(Yeah, but how?)"
    mc "（是啊，可怎么做？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5708
translate schinese story01_10_1f8d311e:

    # mc "(Gray buildings, sour sky, air that tastes like rust.)"
    mc "（灰色的楼房，发酸的天空，闻起来像铁锈的空气。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5709
translate schinese story01_10_d292cb87:

    # mc "(People who always need something.)"
    mc "（永远都在索求着什么的人。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5712
translate schinese story01_10_9dbbb05b:

    # mc "(Short on food, money, patience...)"
    mc "（缺食物、缺钱、缺耐心……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5714
translate schinese story01_10_438bd643:

    # mc "(Whispering) But Iza somehow managed it. How?"
    mc "（低声）可伊莎不知怎么就做到了。怎么做到的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5716
translate schinese story01_10_3d5bb71e:

    # npc1 "HEY! WHY THE HELL ARE YOU STANDING IN THE MIDDLE OF THE ROAD, CLOWN?!"
    npc1 "喂！你这混蛋小丑怎么站在马路中间？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5717
translate schinese story01_10_4e781f6a:

    # mc "(Hm...)"
    mc "（嗯……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5719
translate schinese story01_10_51ad0f7a:

    # mc "(Right. If I'm heading to Lena's...)"
    mc "（对。如果我要去莉娜家……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5720
translate schinese story01_10_4dcf4a1b:

    # mc "(I should stop by and get her something. Sweets? Or another bear?)"
    mc "（应该顺路买点东西给她。零食？还是再来一只熊？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5733
translate schinese story01_11_e632f479:

    # "As [mc] entered Lena's mansion."
    "[mc]走进了莉娜的宅邸。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5734
translate schinese story01_11_c4148fd3:

    # mc "...I'd almost forgotten how huge this place is."
    mc "……我都快忘了这地方有多大了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5735
translate schinese story01_11_3e5eca82:

    # mc "(Of course. Same as ever.)"
    mc "（当然了。一直是这样。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5736
translate schinese story01_11_b9464e3d:

    # mc "(Even the walls look expensive.)"
    mc "（连墙看起来都很贵。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5738
translate schinese story01_11_103b5e60:

    # mc "(Still don't know how Mom managed to befriend these people...)"
    mc "（还是不明白老妈是怎么和这些人混熟的……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5739
translate schinese story01_11_7831a98e:

    # mc "(Or, more importantly, what the hell they ever saw in us.)"
    mc "（或者更重要的问题是，他们到底看上我们哪一点。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5742
translate schinese story01_11_b2f716da:

    # mc "(Still...)"
    mc "（不过……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5744
translate schinese story01_11_32e9b5a4:

    # mc "(Whispering) Thanks for having me."
    mc "（低声）谢谢你收留我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5745
translate schinese story01_11_f2e592d2:

    # ad "Young master?"
    ad "少爷？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5746
translate schinese story01_11_735c3c11:

    # mc "(That voice...)"
    mc "（那声音……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5748
translate schinese story01_11_713067dc:

    # mc "Cut it out, Alfred. I'm about as much a young master as you are a gardener."
    mc "别这么叫，阿尔弗雷德。我当少爷的程度，就跟你当园丁一样。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5749
translate schinese story01_11_99396708:

    # mc "(Alfred. Officially, the gardener.)"
    mc "（阿尔弗雷德。名义上的园丁。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5750
translate schinese story01_11_b7f0bd4e:

    # mc "(In reality, the man who knows more about this house than all its owners put together.)"
    mc "（实际上，他对这个家的了解比历任主人加起来都多。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5751
translate schinese story01_11_36d8f6f1:

    # mc "(And the one person here who never makes me feel out of place.)"
    mc "（也是这里唯一不会让我觉得格格不入的人。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5752
translate schinese story01_11_6e56aaed:

    # mc "(Everyone here is nice, sure, but he's the best of the lot.)"
    mc "（这里的人当然都不错，但他是其中最好的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5755
translate schinese story01_11_5fed75bc:

    # ad "Why, I am the gardener, young master."
    ad "我确实是园丁，少爷。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5757
translate schinese story01_11_1b5c7f5a:

    # mc "No, you're not a gardener, Alfred. You're a wizard!"
    mc "不，你不是园丁，阿尔弗雷德。你是魔法师！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5766
translate schinese story01_11_b7b46521:

    # ad "YOUNG MASTER!"
    ad "少爷！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5767
translate schinese story01_11_4625028d:

    # ad "Oh, how terribly I've missed you..."
    ad "哦，真是想死您了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5769
translate schinese story01_11_835e091e:

    # ad "(Whispering) Strictly between us, Lady Lena is in the most wonderful spirits."
    ad "（低声）只在我们之间说，莉娜小姐今天心情好极了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5770
translate schinese story01_11_3388ba5e:

    # ad "(Whispering) And I rather suspect you, along with that fine mood of yours, may have had something to do with it."
    ad "（低声）我怀疑您，还有您那份好心情，跟这事脱不了关系。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5772
translate schinese story01_11_38aacb35:

    # mc "There's a reason for that. I guess I found the strength to keep moving."
    mc "那是有原因的。我想我是找到了继续走下去的力气。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5773
translate schinese story01_11_9230749c:

    # mc "Not without getting kicked in the ass first, but still."
    mc "虽然是在先挨了一脚之后。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5775
translate schinese story01_11_b8906359:

    # ad "That is splendid news, young master!"
    ad "这真是好消息，少爷！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5777
translate schinese story01_11_83523fbf:

    # mc "You don't sound all that surprised... Because of Lena, right?"
    mc "你听起来也没那么惊讶……是因为莉娜吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5779
translate schinese story01_11_6c4387b9:

    # mc "How much did she spill?"
    mc "她说了多少？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5782
translate schinese story01_11_599bb72e:

    # ad "Everything, young master."
    ad "全部，少爷。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5783
translate schinese story01_11_b5c1e742:

    # ad "Twice."
    ad "说了两遍。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5784
translate schinese story01_11_e5697e0c:

    # ad "With different intonations."
    ad "用两种不同的语气。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5786
translate schinese story01_11_747a7a40:

    # ad "I did tell her I wished to hear it all directly from you, but the young lady was quite unstoppable..."
    ad "我确实告诉过她，希望一切都能直接从您那里听到，可大小姐实在势不可挡……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5789
translate schinese story01_11_9775825e:

    # ad "Forgive me, young master."
    ad "请原谅我，少爷。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5792
translate schinese story01_11_86e84c95:

    # mc "Forget it. Knowing her, she does love to talk."
    mc "算了。以她的性格，本来就爱说话。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5793
translate schinese story01_11_fc896afd:

    # mc "But..."
    mc "不过……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5794
translate schinese story01_11_dba91358:

    # mc "What did I tell you?"
    mc "我跟你说过什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5796
translate schinese story01_11_e6164e0d:

    # ad "Not to call you young master."
    ad "不许叫您少爷。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5797
translate schinese story01_11_8d26c0a3:

    # mc "And yet you keep doing it. Why?"
    mc "可你还是一直叫。为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5798
translate schinese story01_11_75a8410b:

    # ad "You are my lady's friend."
    ad "您是我家小姐的朋友。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5799
translate schinese story01_11_2f09be84:

    # mc "I'm not gonna talk you out of this, am I?"
    mc "所以你是铁了心不听我对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5800
translate schinese story01_11_649f4c2a:

    # ad "No, young master!"
    ad "不，少爷！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5804
translate schinese story01_11_8f755e5a:

    # mc "The world stays standing because of people like you."
    mc "这个世界之所以还站着，就是因为有你这样的人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5805
translate schinese story01_11_36b2e2d6:

    # mc "See you around, Alfred."
    mc "回见，阿尔弗雷德。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5808
translate schinese story01_11_f1071ac8:

    # mc "(Count Victor's house.)"
    mc "（维克托伯爵家。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5809
translate schinese story01_11_6bce77bb:

    # mc "(Yeah, count. Not exactly a nickname. Or a joke.)"
    mc "（是啊，伯爵。这可算不上绰号。也不是玩笑。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5811
translate schinese story01_11_79fca907:

    # mc "(When abilities appeared, the old order started falling apart.)"
    mc "（异能让旧秩序开始崩塌。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5812
translate schinese story01_11_cf017778:

    # mc "(Armies, parliaments, corporations... None of it looked all that important next to one person who could wipe out half a city alone.)"
    mc "（军队、议会、企业……跟一个能独自抹掉半座城市的人比起来，全都不值一提。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5814
translate schinese story01_11_0f83f60b:

    # mc "(Then came wars. Then more wars.)"
    mc "（然后是战争。然后是更多的战争。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5815
translate schinese story01_11_919c2325:

    # mc "(And once the dust settled, the world somehow crawled right back to kings, counts, and family crests.)"
    mc "（而尘埃落定之后，世界不知怎么的，又爬回了国王、伯爵和家徽的老路。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5817
translate schinese story01_11_be007706:

    # mc "(Only now, every title came with a hero rank attached.)"
    mc "（只不过现在，每个头衔后面都还挂着一个英雄等级。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5818
translate schinese story01_11_63048894:

    # mc "(Progress, my ass.)"
    mc "（进步个屁。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5820
translate schinese story01_11_acae83cd:

    # mc "(And somehow, in the middle of all that progress... there's me.)"
    mc "（而就在这堆“进步”中间……还混着我一个。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5821
translate schinese story01_11_237ebb94:

    # mc "(Maybe I don't have powers, but hey, at least I know the right people!)"
    mc "（也许我没有异能，但嘿，我至少认识对的人！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5828
translate schinese story01_11_2e69cef7:

    # "A few minutes later, inside the mansion."
    "几分钟后，宅邸内。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5829
translate schinese story01_11_7f24091b:

    # mc "(And here I am.)"
    mc "（而我又在这儿。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5830
translate schinese story01_11_5e1d942b:

    # mc "(Feels like... last time I was here was two years ago?)"
    mc "（感觉……我上次来这儿是两年前了吧？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5832
translate schinese story01_11_4e09f308:

    # mc "(Can't say the place has changed much since then.)"
    mc "（这地方自那以后倒没怎么变。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5833
translate schinese story01_11_ac279f14:

    # mc "(Except it's quieter now... calmer.)"
    mc "（只是现在更安静了……更平和了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5835
translate schinese story01_11_59fc172e:

    # mc "(Calmer... It's been five years since Count Victor died.)"
    mc "（更平和……维克托伯爵已经去世五年了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5836
translate schinese story01_11_60e7bbae:

    # mc "(And Lena moved into her own apartment not too long ago...)"
    mc "（而莉娜前不久也搬进了自己的公寓……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5837
translate schinese story01_11_eef402f2:

    # mc "...kinda sad, actually."
    mc "……其实还挺让人难过的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5839
translate schinese story01_11_24b20fcb:

    # ver "Oh, my..."
    ver "哎呀……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5840
translate schinese story01_11_f0526f8f:

    # ver "Look at you, [mc]... what a handsome man you've grown into."
    ver "瞧瞧你，[mc]……长成这么俊的小伙子了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5842
translate schinese story01_11_f907eb8b:

    # ver "Just like your mother."
    ver "跟你妈妈一个模子刻出来的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5843
translate schinese story01_11_d4d10dd0:

    # mc "Please don't mention her..."
    mc "请别提她……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5844
translate schinese story01_11_d14637c4:

    # ver "..."
    ver "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5845
translate schinese story01_11_1b06fb3a:

    # ver "I'm sorry, dear."
    ver "对不起，孩子。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5846
translate schinese story01_11_12590d36:

    # ver "I didn't mean to hurt you."
    ver "我不是故意要伤你的心。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5847
translate schinese story01_11_a27da204:

    # mc "But I'm glad to see you, Miss Veron—"
    mc "不过能见到您我还是很高兴，维罗妮——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5850
translate schinese story01_11_0459a140:

    # ver "No!"
    ver "不！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5851
translate schinese story01_11_4afa1ef4:

    # ver "Ma-ma."
    ver "妈、妈妈。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5852
translate schinese story01_11_ff819a0d:

    # ver "Remember?"
    ver "记得吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5854
translate schinese story01_11_8cefe728:

    # mc "Miss Veronica."
    mc "维罗妮卡小姐。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5856
translate schinese story01_11_1573b50b:

    # ver "Mama."
    ver "妈妈。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5858
translate schinese story01_11_8cefe728_1:

    # mc "Miss Veronica."
    mc "维罗妮卡小姐。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5863
translate schinese story01_11_4de69ade:

    # mc "Y'know, sometimes I'm even more stubborn than Alfred."
    mc "您看，有时候我比阿尔弗雷德还固执。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5865
translate schinese story01_11_37f43a5d:

    # ver "That changes nothing!"
    ver "这改变不了任何事！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5866
translate schinese story01_11_fe2cd434:

    # ver "You promised, sweetheart, so—"
    ver "你答应过我的，宝贝，所以——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5868
translate schinese story01_11_b867caf1:

    # mc "I promised. But only for one day, or did you forget?"
    mc "我是答应过。可只答应了一天，还是您忘了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5869
translate schinese story01_11_9dd5393e:

    # mc "How much did you drink back then..."
    mc "那会儿您到底喝了多少……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5870
translate schinese story01_11_28fc87c8:

    # mc "Still, you put on one hell of a sho—"
    mc "但您那场戏演得真是绝——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5873
translate schinese story01_11_3122a8c3:

    # ver "Oh, don't remind me, dear."
    ver "哎呀，别提了，亲爱的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5874
translate schinese story01_11_44caa873:

    # ver "I really shouldn't have had that much to drink..."
    ver "我当时真不该喝那么多……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5876
translate schinese story01_11_d42dbf32:

    # mc "(Veronica.)"
    mc "（维罗妮卡。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5877
translate schinese story01_11_8f36bfdc:

    # mc "(Lena's mother. Count Victor's widow.)"
    mc "（莉娜的母亲。维克托伯爵的遗孀。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5878
translate schinese story01_11_bdfc527a:

    # mc "(And, according to her, my second mother.)"
    mc "（而且按她的说法，还是我的第二个妈妈。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5881
translate schinese story01_11_166b160c:

    # ver "Oh, dear... have I really grown that old?"
    ver "哎呀，亲爱的……我真的这么老了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5883
translate schinese story01_11_e939ec92:

    # mc "You're fishing for compliments, aren't you?"
    mc "您这是在讨夸奖吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5885
translate schinese story01_11_d1593f1c:

    # ver "Doesn't a beautiful woman deserve to hear at least one or two?"
    ver "漂亮女人难道不配多听几句夸奖吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5886
translate schinese story01_11_8511cc76:

    # ver "Especially from such a handsome young man..."
    ver "何况还是从这么俊的小伙子嘴里说出来的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5891
translate schinese story01_11_3a74cf0a:

    # mc "(And also... she's the one who taught me how not to be a punching bag.)"
    mc "（而且……还是她教会了我怎么不做沙包。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5892
translate schinese story01_11_87be44d5:

    # mc "(Training title: dodge or die.)"
    mc "（训练科目：闪避，否则挨打。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5894
translate schinese story01_11_274c759e:

    # mc "Mom always said beautiful women are terrifying women."
    mc "老妈总说，漂亮女人都是恐怖女人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5895
translate schinese story01_11_179b7cd2:

    # ver "Your mother was a wise woman."
    ver "你母亲是个智慧的女人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5904
translate schinese story01_11_59def5d4:

    # ver "Not bad."
    ver "不赖。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5905
translate schinese story01_11_0c428852:

    # mc "Ow, ow... Aren't you ashamed of bullying a weak little boy?"
    mc "哎哟、哎哟……欺负一个弱小男孩，您不害臊吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5906
translate schinese story01_11_34453862:

    # ver "Oh, sweetheart, bullying?"
    ver "哎呀，宝贝，这叫欺负？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5907
translate schinese story01_11_94fca0e2:

    # ver "We're only playing."
    ver "我们只是在玩而已。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5909
translate schinese story01_11_660f4601:

    # mc "Y'know, people can die from your games!"
    mc "您这游戏会玩死人的！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5910
translate schinese story01_11_ebd75006:

    # mc "And I kinda found a reason to li—"
    mc "而我还真因此找到了活下去的理——"

# game/story01en.rpy:5912
translate schinese story01_11_9c4cc716:

    # mc "(Now she's going to hit me—)"
    mc "（她要打我了——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5915
translate schinese story01_11_a0d5eaf2:

    # mc "(What is she...)"
    mc "（这是要干什……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5916
translate schinese story01_11_43507577:

    # mc "(...Wait. A hug?)"
    mc "（……等等。是个拥抱？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5918
translate schinese story01_11_8fa5b650:

    # ver "You did well!"
    ver "你表现很好！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5920
translate schinese story01_11_72f1c783:

    # mc "...what are you talking about?"
    mc "……您在说什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5922
translate schinese story01_11_3296ac79:

    # ver "My little girl has been buzzing my ears off..."
    ver "我家小丫头一直在跟我念叨……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5923
translate schinese story01_11_8941c5e8:

    # ver "The Hero Academy, hm?"
    ver "英雄学院，是吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5924
translate schinese story01_11_1cf06e82:

    # ver "I expected no less from you!"
    ver "我果然没看错你！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5926
translate schinese story01_11_47cbd228:

    # mc "I'm guessing the whole district knows by now..."
    mc "我猜整个区都已经知道了吧……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5927
translate schinese story01_11_07b88f13:

    # mc "(She really can't keep a secret.)"
    mc "（她真是藏不住话。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5929
translate schinese story01_11_22b545ac:

    # ver "Don't blame her."
    ver "别怪她。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5930
translate schinese story01_11_5d53396a:

    # ver "You know, that little bundle of nerves was terribly worried about you."
    ver "那小可怜担心你担心得不得了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5931
translate schinese story01_11_5fc18344:

    # ver "Alfred and I were, too."
    ver "我和阿尔弗雷德也是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5932
translate schinese story01_11_f722bf20:

    # ver "(Whispering) We're all rooting for you, dear."
    ver "（低声）我们都在为你加油呢，亲爱的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5934
translate schinese story01_11_41eb20bc:

    # mc "Hey, what kind of melodrama is this?! I'm not even accepted yet!"
    mc "喂，这是什么狗血剧情啊？！我连录取都还没拿到呢！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5935
translate schinese story01_11_22b83c74:

    # mc "(Whispering) And hearing that from an A-rank..."
    mc "（低声）而且这话还是从一个A级嘴里说出来的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5938
translate schinese story01_11_21f2c462:

    # ver "Hm?"
    ver "嗯？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5939
translate schinese story01_11_67ba7790:

    # ver "What was that, dear?"
    ver "你说什么呢，亲爱的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5940
translate schinese story01_11_965e7c77:

    # mc "(Ouch... she's gonna crush me—)"
    mc "（哎哟……她要捏死我了——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5942
translate schinese story01_11_a330a578:

    # mc "Did I say something wrong?"
    mc "我说错什么了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5943
translate schinese story01_11_d51f0283:

    # mc "(She's mad...)"
    mc "（她生气了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5944
translate schinese story01_11_931344c5:

    # ver "(There he goes again. My poor boy...)"
    ver "（又来了。我可怜的孩子……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5947
translate schinese story01_11_307d0cac:

    # ver "I didn't think you'd forget my lessons so quickly..."
    ver "没想到你这么快就把我教的东西忘了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5948
translate schinese story01_11_156ca248:

    # ver "Ranks don't make you a hero, sweetheart."
    ver "等级成就不了英雄，宝贝。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5949
translate schinese story01_11_48ef6bf8:

    # ver "A kind heart does."
    ver "善良的心才可以。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5950
translate schinese story01_11_f2bea205:

    # ver "And a big, honest smile!"
    ver "还有一个爽朗真诚的笑容！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5952
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5953
translate schinese story01_11_52c3711f:

    # mc "(Miss Veronica... you—)"
    mc "（维罗妮卡小姐……你——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:5958
translate schinese story01_11_6c187f19:

    # mc "Please marry me."
    mc "请嫁给我吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5959
translate schinese story01_11_d14637c4_1:

    # ver "..."
    ver "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5960
translate schinese story01_11_4696a19b:

    # mc "I can cook."
    mc "我会做饭。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5961
translate schinese story01_11_ac0e4b01:

    # mc "Sometimes."
    mc "偶尔。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5962
translate schinese story01_11_167cc8e3:

    # mc "Under supervision."
    mc "在有人监督下。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5965
translate schinese story01_11_af83717a:

    # ver "Oh, dear..."
    ver "哎呀，亲爱的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5966
translate schinese story01_11_bbe52e08:

    # ver "What are you saying?"
    ver "你在说什么呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5967
translate schinese story01_11_4bd2e999:

    # ver "I'm old enough to be your mother, you know."
    ver "我可是够得上当你妈妈了，你知道吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5970
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5972
translate schinese story01_11_d37c30d3:

    # L "What the hell are you doing?"
    L "你到底在搞什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5974
translate schinese story01_11_9120433d:

    # mc "Strengthening ties with your family."
    mc "我在和你们家加强关系。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5976
translate schinese story01_11_824332b4:

    # L "You're confessing to my mom."
    L "你是在向我妈告白。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5978
translate schinese story01_11_d1f16514:

    # mc "Terminology."
    mc "这是说法不同。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5980
translate schinese story01_11_62e3bd9f:

    # L "Again with that?"
    L "你又来这套？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5981
translate schinese story01_11_f94de23e:

    # mc "Persistence is a hero's virtue."
    mc "坚持是英雄的美德。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5984
translate schinese story01_11_82063d7a:

    # ver "Oh..."
    ver "哦……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5985
translate schinese story01_11_b9b0ba90:

    # ver "Lena, dear..."
    ver "莉娜，亲爱的……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5986
translate schinese story01_11_fcdd4643:

    # ver "Are you jealous?"
    ver "你吃醋了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5988
translate schinese story01_11_614746b2:

    # L "Of you?!"
    L "吃你的醋？！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5989
translate schinese story01_11_94d64b74:

    # mc "Don't worry."
    mc "别担心。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5990
translate schinese story01_11_c83f484c:

    # mc "I respect complicated family dynamics."
    mc "我很敬重复杂多样的家庭关系。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5991
translate schinese story01_11_334b0f93:

    # L "Shut up."
    L "闭嘴。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5993
translate schinese story01_11_e2d56d0d:

    # ver "Such passion..."
    ver "真是感人……"

# game/story01en.rpy:5995
translate schinese story01_11_c815461c:

    # L "Mom!"
    L "妈！"

# game/story01en.rpy:5997
translate schinese story01_11_92bc50aa:

    # ver "What?"
    ver "什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:5998
translate schinese story01_11_cd262455:

    # ver "I'm simply happy you two finally found a common interest."
    ver "我只是高兴你们终于有了共同话题。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6000
translate schinese story01_11_08ed6c73:

    # mc "Your happiness means more to me than anything."
    mc "您的幸福比什么都重要。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6001
translate schinese story01_11_57197df2:

    # L "Do not help her."
    L "别帮她。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6004
translate schinese story01_11_46896897:

    # ver "Now, now, don't be cross..."
    ver "好啦好啦，别生气嘛……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6005
translate schinese story01_11_07362ab5:

    # ver "Your jealousy is very fun to tease, dear."
    ver "你吃醋的样子逗起来太好玩了，亲爱的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6007
translate schinese story01_11_7dc041a0:

    # L "Weren't you heading to a meeting?"
    L "你不是要去开会吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6008
translate schinese story01_11_6897be2d:

    # L "Go, or you're gonna be late."
    L "快去，不然要迟到了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6011
translate schinese story01_11_eaef4d86:

    # ver "Oh, goodness, you're right."
    ver "哎呀，说得对。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6014
translate schinese story01_11_df7df894:

    # ver "All right, I'm off!"
    ver "好啦，我走了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6015
translate schinese story01_11_5d3969b3:

    # ver "Do try not to destroy the house while I'm gone."
    ver "我不在的时候，你们可别把房子拆了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6017
translate schinese story01_11_6b3e94e4:

    # L "Yeah, yeah, go-"
    L "行了行了，快——"

# game/story01en.rpy:6019
translate schinese story01_11_32a7c218:

    # ver "Oh, [mc]..."
    ver "哦，[mc]……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6020
translate schinese story01_11_057c5c6e:

    # ver "The condoms are in the kitchen."
    ver "保险套在厨房。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6023
translate schinese story01_11_0da53088:

    # L "MOM!"
    L "妈！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6026
translate schinese story01_11_af189a7d:

    # mc "Thank you, Mom!"
    mc "谢谢您，妈妈！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6027
translate schinese story01_11_5f0c0178:

    # mc "I promise I won't disappoint your expectations!"
    mc "我保证不会让您失望！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6030
translate schinese story01_11_eea51471:

    # L "[mc]!"
    L "[mc]！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6031
translate schinese story01_11_d14637c4_2:

    # ver "..."
    ver "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6032
translate schinese story01_11_2cab8686:

    # ver "(Hearing their voices in this house again...)"
    ver "（又在这个家里听到他们的声音了……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6033
translate schinese story01_11_bab6f929:

    # ver "(I'm glad you came, [mc].)"
    ver "（你来了真好，[mc]。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6035
translate schinese story01_11_fd34d6c0:

    # ver "Take care of each other."
    ver "你们要好好照顾对方。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6036
translate schinese story01_11_aab7ca54:

    # mc "Have a safe trip, Mom!"
    mc "一路平安，妈妈！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6037
translate schinese story01_11_38cc19e8:

    # "Veronica leaves the house."
    "维罗妮卡离开了家。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6039
translate schinese story01_11_6f465fd2:

    # L "Grown woman, and she still acts like..."
    L "都这么大的人了，还那样……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6040
translate schinese story01_11_b33336b1:

    # L "*Sighs*"
    L "*叹气*"

# game/story01en.rpy:6041
translate schinese story01_11_0ddda101:

    # L "Same as always."
    L "一如既往。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6043
translate schinese story01_11_1820b7c2:

    # mc "(Miss Veronica really did look incredible, but... that last look of hers.)"
    mc "（维罗妮卡小姐确实美极了，不过……她最后那一眼。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6044
translate schinese story01_11_4332fd9f:

    # mc "(You keep telling me to let go of the past, but you're all still stuck in it too...)"
    mc "（你总叫我放下过去，可你不也还困在里面……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6047
translate schinese story01_11_c581bca7:

    # mc "(Still. Looking at Lena...)"
    mc "（不过。看看莉娜……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6049
translate schinese story01_11_b994a483:

    # mc "(That dress... paired with that perfume of hers.)"
    mc "（那条裙子……还有她身上的香水。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6050
translate schinese story01_11_63370be4:

    # mc "(Okay, keep it together. KEEP IT TOGETHER!)"
    mc "（好，冷静。冷静下来！）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6051
translate schinese story01_11_b325c3eb:

    # mc "(Although...)"
    mc "（不过……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6053
translate schinese story01_11_f6ae5544:

    # mc "Lena..."
    mc "莉娜……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6054
translate schinese story01_11_60ebbd6e:

    # mc "You look absolutely gorgeous."
    mc "你真是美极了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6056
translate schinese story01_11_1e4e41b6:

    # L "Hm?"
    L "嗯？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6058
translate schinese story01_11_16b372ae:

    # L "Oh, you mean the dress."
    L "哦，你说裙子啊。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6059
translate schinese story01_11_4cc18be9:

    # L "You like it?"
    L "你喜欢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6060
translate schinese story01_11_65f0cdae:

    # mc "From head to toe..."
    mc "从头到脚……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6061
translate schinese story01_11_462ad7a2:

    # mc "I'd gladly enjoy every inch of it."
    mc "每一寸我都乐意欣赏。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6065
translate schinese story01_11_4bff1c62:

    # L "I know."
    L "我知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6066
translate schinese story01_11_d4d13b6d:

    # L "Pervert."
    L "变态。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6071
translate schinese story01_11_cfb0ccef:

    # L "Thanks."
    L "谢了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6073
translate schinese story01_11_5f14e90f:

    # mc "Thank you for the view."
    mc "谢你让我大饱眼福。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6074
translate schinese story01_11_7e00e9ab:

    # mc "Anyway..."
    mc "话说回来……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6075
translate schinese story01_11_b925c583:

    # mc "Why here? I thought we were meeting at your apartment."
    mc "怎么在这儿？我还以为是在你家公寓见面。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6078
translate schinese story01_11_a02bcaf6:

    # L "Plans changed a little, so I had to come back here."
    L "计划稍微有变，所以我得回这边来。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6079
translate schinese story01_11_57df9f3b:

    # L "But don't worry. It's nothing serious."
    L "不过别担心，不是什么大事。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6081
translate schinese story01_11_64e085b3:

    # mc "So, why'd you call me here?"
    mc "所以，你叫我来是为了什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6083
translate schinese story01_11_71b85ce8:

    # L "What do you think?"
    L "你觉得呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6085
translate schinese story01_11_33d4026c:

    # mc "To discuss your outfit."
    mc "讨论你的穿搭。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6086
translate schinese story01_11_0c300af5:

    # mc "Speaking of which, on your chest... are those stickers?"
    mc "说起来，你胸口那些……是贴纸吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6088
translate schinese story01_11_eaa2e101:

    # L "They sure are."
    L "当然是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6089
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6091
translate schinese story01_11_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "我明白了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6093
translate schinese story01_11_7b9646ab:

    # mc "So the whole structure is being held together by faith, hope, and adhesive backing?"
    mc "所以整套结构是靠信仰、希望和背胶撑起来的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6095
translate schinese story01_11_9cc86de4:

    # L "Mostly the adhesive backing."
    L "主要靠背胶。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6096
translate schinese story01_11_a92e7dcb:

    # mc "Incredible."
    mc "真是了不起。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6097
translate schinese story01_11_9a05ad8e:

    # L "Didn't really feel like wearing a bra."
    L "不太想穿内衣。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6098
translate schinese story01_11_18997bfa:

    # L "But flashing the goods wasn't exactly a genius idea either."
    L "但这么秀出来也不算高明。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6100
translate schinese story01_11_da908da7:

    # mc "Reasonable."
    mc "有道理。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6101
translate schinese story01_11_dee92200:

    # mc "Dangerous."
    mc "很危险。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6102
translate schinese story01_11_df9b8b6b:

    # mc "Effective."
    mc "但很有效。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6105
translate schinese story01_11_568d458e:

    # L "Knowing you, you'd spend the whole time trying to sneak a peek."
    L "以你的性子，整晚都会想方设法偷看吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6107
translate schinese story01_11_6f523b12:

    # mc "Lies!"
    mc "血口喷人！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6108
translate schinese story01_11_1f3e3ad2:

    # mc "I'd do it professionally."
    mc "我会专业地偷看。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6109
translate schinese story01_11_32de4d36:

    # mc "With respect for the engineering."
    mc "以示对这项工程的敬意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6113
translate schinese story01_11_d4d13b6d_1:

    # L "Pervert."
    L "变态。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6114
translate schinese story01_11_e0e1c712:

    # mc "An appreciator of engineering solutions."
    mc "这是对工程解决方案的鉴赏。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6115
translate schinese story01_11_62765140:

    # L "At least pretend you're ashamed."
    L "你至少装一下愧疚。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6117
translate schinese story01_11_85c8d543:

    # mc "Tried."
    mc "试过了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6118
translate schinese story01_11_ec4750ef:

    # mc "Didn't stick."
    mc "没装出来。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6121
translate schinese story01_11_04766eb0:

    # L "So you're not even denying it?"
    L "所以你连否认都不否认了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6122
translate schinese story01_11_a331fc6c:

    # mc "I'm disputing the wording."
    mc "我只是在质疑用词。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6123
translate schinese story01_11_e35a7299:

    # mc "The substance, unfortunately, is supported by evidence."
    mc "可惜实质内容有证据支持。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6125
translate schinese story01_11_a0114ab3:

    # L "What evidence, exactly?"
    L "什么证据？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6127
translate schinese story01_11_c5a3c2a8:

    # mc "My eyes."
    mc "我的眼睛。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6129
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_1:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6130
translate schinese story01_11_d4eea746:

    # mc "Caught red-handed."
    mc "人赃并获。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6132
translate schinese story01_11_cffc2835:

    # L "You caught yourself."
    L "是你自己把自己抓住了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6133
translate schinese story01_11_4fc72eac:

    # mc "I assisted the investigation."
    mc "我只是协助调查。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6135
translate schinese story01_11_0d43f4c0:

    # L "Dork."
    L "笨蛋。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6137
translate schinese story01_11_f6909e58:

    # mc "You like my attention, don't you?"
    mc "你就是喜欢我的关注，对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6139
translate schinese story01_11_5d10b4bc:

    # L "Maybe."
    L "也许吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6141
translate schinese story01_11_530f9c6a:

    # mc "So maybe you're the pervert here?"
    mc "所以变态的其实是你？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6144
translate schinese story01_11_cb7b6592:

    # L "Alright."
    L "行吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6145
translate schinese story01_11_89a0c229:

    # L "Enough of that..."
    L "够了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6147
translate schinese story01_11_1f29cabc:

    # L "That's not why I called you here."
    L "我叫你过来不是为了这个。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6148
translate schinese story01_11_90e6849f:

    # L "Isabella."
    L "伊莎贝拉。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6151
translate schinese story01_11_cd60638c:

    # mc "Going on a date to talk about another girl. Damn, Lena."
    mc "约会跑来说另一个女孩的事。真是的，莉娜。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6153
translate schinese story01_11_c1765188:

    # L "Cut it out."
    L "行了，别贫了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6154
translate schinese story01_11_0f14c9c0:

    # L "Beatrice called. You ended up in the infirmary again."
    L "碧翠丝打来电话。你又进医务室了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6155
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6156
translate schinese story01_11_f1392343:

    # L "(There he goes again... shutting down.)"
    L "（又来了……当场关机。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6160
translate schinese story01_11_b0c8a091:

    # L "[mc]?"
    L "[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6162
translate schinese story01_11_a868f5f3:

    # mc "That dream... again."
    mc "那个梦……又来了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6163
translate schinese story01_11_2454da47:

    # L "You know Isabella doesn't blame you for what happened."
    L "你知道伊莎贝拉并没有因为那件事怪你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6164
translate schinese story01_11_a5db38a2:

    # mc "Oh, her whole family sure does."
    mc "但她全家肯定怪你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6166
translate schinese story01_11_8fcba890:

    # L "Have you ever tried telling them the truth?"
    L "你试过把真相告诉他们吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6168
translate schinese story01_11_cf7dc0f7:

    # mc "Philip lost his mother, and his sister was horribly wounded."
    mc "菲利普失去了母亲，他妹妹也身受重伤。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6169
translate schinese story01_11_1417c544:

    # mc "And the old man..."
    mc "还有那位老先生……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6170
translate schinese story01_11_07081ab2:

    # mc "You know it wouldn't change anything."
    mc "你也知道那改变不了什么。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6172
translate schinese story01_11_461bcb77:

    # mc "(If I'd been just a little stronger back then, maybe...)"
    mc "（如果当时我再强一点，也许……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6173
translate schinese story01_11_74a20105:

    # L "(You've suffered enough already.)"
    L "（你已经受够苦了。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6174
translate schinese story01_11_c51dd520:

    # L "(You shouldn't have to carry this alone...)"
    L "（你不该一个人扛着这些……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6177
translate schinese story01_11_b78fd8bb:

    # L "(No. I have to...)"
    L "（不。我必须……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6178
translate schinese story01_11_da1cfe97:

    # L "(Even if it hurts him.)"
    L "（哪怕那会伤到他。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6179
translate schinese story01_11_20c30dce:

    # L "You get this can't keep going, right?"
    L "你又开始那套“我撑不下去了”，对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6180
translate schinese story01_11_1f136f23:

    # L "Or are you just gonna keep running from her-"
    L "还是说你打算一直躲着她——"

# game/story01en.rpy:6183
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6184
translate schinese story01_11_cfcc2293:

    # mc "I know."
    mc "我知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6185
translate schinese story01_11_da891744:

    # mc "(Whispering) I know..."
    mc "（低声）我知道……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6188
translate schinese story01_11_3c845a7d:

    # L "(Whispering) Then why?"
    L "（低声）那为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6190
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6193
translate schinese story01_11_bf299a90:

    # mc "(Whispering) Every time I see her face in front of me."
    mc "（低声）每次我看到她的脸。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6194
translate schinese story01_11_7d0ce261:

    # mc "Her screams... her burned face, the scars..."
    mc "她的尖叫……她烧伤的脸，那些疤痕……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6196
translate schinese story01_11_e9748d74:

    # L "(His hands... they're shaking.)"
    L "（他的手……在抖。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6198
translate schinese story01_11_dc5b0b8c:

    # L "(Easy... easy. I'm not going anywhere.)"
    L "（没事……没事。我哪儿也不去。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6199
translate schinese story01_11_69c72ffb:

    # L "(Not now. Not ever.)"
    L "（现在不会。以后也不会。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6201
translate schinese story01_11_cdc5d848:

    # mc "(Whispering) ...watching her suffer."
    mc "（低声）……看着她受苦。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6202
translate schinese story01_11_56246a19:

    # mc "(Whispering) And not being able to do a damn thing..."
    mc "（低声）却什么都做不了……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6204
translate schinese story01_11_2d64832f:

    # mc "(Whispering) I despise myself. And my own helplessness."
    mc "（低声）我厌恶自己。也厌恶自己的无能。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6206
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_2:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6208
translate schinese story01_11_96b358d4:

    # L "Why?"
    L "为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6210
translate schinese story01_11_a707f59d:

    # mc "Ever since I was a kid..."
    mc "从小时候起……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6211
translate schinese story01_11_4a1050d1:

    # mc "I always dreamed of becoming a hero."
    mc "我就一直梦想成为英雄。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6215
translate schinese story01_11_6f3ab7a0:

    # mc "Something like... wanting to help people."
    mc "大概就是……想要帮助别人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6216
translate schinese story01_11_4b9234f3:

    # mc "And in the end? When I actually had to do something..."
    mc "可到头来？等我真的必须做点什么的时候……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6217
translate schinese story01_11_8d059e76:

    # mc "I was useless."
    mc "我却是个废物。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6220
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6222
translate schinese story01_11_177d3eb2:

    # mc "What are you doing?"
    mc "你在干什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6224
translate schinese story01_11_5dab32b2:

    # L "Don't say that."
    L "别这么说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6225
translate schinese story01_11_1f7d3aca:

    # L "You're not useless."
    L "你不是废物。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6226
translate schinese story01_11_dba9be3f:

    # L "You never were."
    L "你从来都不是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6228
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6231
translate schinese story01_11_4cf9fcc7:

    # L "(Wh-)"
    L "（什——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6234
translate schinese story01_11_948e11de:

    # mc "...let's just lie here."
    mc "……我们就这样躺着吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6236
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_3:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6237
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_7:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6239
translate schinese story01_11_2b683e89:

    # L "Remember..."
    L "还记得吗……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6240
translate schinese story01_11_6f8a772c:

    # L "Back when we were kids... because of my illness, you used to protect me all the time."
    L "我们小时候……因为我的病，你总是护着我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6241
translate schinese story01_11_3abfde05:

    # L "They picked on you, laughed at you..."
    L "他们欺负你、嘲笑你……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6242
translate schinese story01_11_2f0854f4:

    # L "And still..."
    L "而你还是……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6244
translate schinese story01_11_5022eb1f:

    # mc "I was just planning to marry your mom one day."
    mc "我只是打算有朝一日娶你妈。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6245
translate schinese story01_11_6202bd6b:

    # mc "Needed a solid political base."
    mc "得有个稳固的政治根基。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6247
translate schinese story01_11_c84c5b41:

    # mc "Or did you think I endured all that bullying for free?"
    mc "不然你以为那些欺负是白挨的？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6248
translate schinese story01_11_7798857c:

    # mc "Of course I had a goal!"
    mc "我当然是有目的的！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6249
translate schinese story01_11_5af3ece2:

    # mc "Sort of..."
    mc "算是吧……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6252
translate schinese story01_11_dffaf346:

    # L "Yeah."
    L "嗯。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6253
translate schinese story01_11_ce292553:

    # L "That sounds like you."
    L "这很像你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6254
translate schinese story01_11_fffdfb77:

    # L "Though getting beaten up every day wasn't exactly required."
    L "虽然每天挨打倒不是非做不可。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6256
translate schinese story01_11_36e86f71:

    # L "You could've just stood on the sidelines and taken their words."
    L "你本来可以袖手旁观，忍下他们的话。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6257
translate schinese story01_11_22066001:

    # L "You didn't have to hit them."
    L "你没必要动手。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6259
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_8:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6261
translate schinese story01_11_e4ff0566:

    # mc "Well, maybe you shouldn't have knighted me."
    mc "那或许你不该封我当骑士。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6262
translate schinese story01_11_a8b00898:

    # mc "Then maybe I wouldn't have had to take the hits for you."
    mc "那我就用不着替你挨打了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6264
translate schinese story01_11_efb25d59:

    # L "(...God, he's such a dork.)"
    L "（……天啊，他真是个笨蛋。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6267
translate schinese story01_11_27fd5c2e:

    # L "(But still...)"
    L "（但即便如此……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6268
translate schinese story01_11_df004f0f:

    # L "(He's my dork.)"
    L "（他是我的笨蛋。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6270
translate schinese story01_11_ca9dd457:

    # L "(Whispering) Love you."
    L "（低声）我爱你。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6272
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_9:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6273
translate schinese story01_11_dfe43cc9:

    # mc "Hm? Did you say something?"
    mc "嗯？你说什么了吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6276
translate schinese story01_11_61212a1d:

    # L "Nothing."
    L "没什么。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6277
translate schinese story01_11_a66a6da1:

    # L "Just thinking you're still a total idiot."
    L "只是在想你依然是个彻底的笨蛋。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6279
translate schinese story01_11_40325f5b:

    # mc "Getting personal now?"
    mc "开始人身攻击了？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6280
translate schinese story01_11_7a71cd52:

    # mc "How have I upset you, my queen?"
    mc "我哪里惹您不高兴了，我的女王陛下？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6282
translate schinese story01_11_2382b231:

    # L "Lemme think..."
    L "让我想想……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6283
translate schinese story01_11_1775c4b8:

    # L "You're my knight."
    L "你是我的骑士。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6284
translate schinese story01_11_575ecb5a:

    # L "And as my knight, you're supposed to be braver than that."
    L "而作为我的骑士，你该比这更勇敢才对。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6286
translate schinese story01_11_b5dd938b:

    # L "Deal?"
    L "成交？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6288
translate schinese story01_11_8676cfa1:

    # mc "And whose punches am I supposed to take this time..."
    mc "所以这次我又该挨谁的拳头……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6289
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_4:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6291
translate schinese story01_11_d354f8bc:

    # L "Hey, [mc]..."
    L "喂，[mc]……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6292
translate schinese story01_11_79364089:

    # L "Wanna take a walk?"
    L "想去散个步吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6293
translate schinese story01_11_e3ca9e6d:

    # mc "...sure."
    mc "……好啊。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6298
translate schinese story01_11_0bf0f477:

    # "A few minutes later, in the mansion's backyard."
    "几分钟后，宅邸的后院。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6303
translate schinese story01_11_77828a76:

    # mc "Beautiful, isn't it?"
    mc "漂亮吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6304
translate schinese story01_11_2701657b:

    # L "You can spot Alfred's work a mile away."
    L "一眼就能看出是阿尔弗雷德的手笔。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6305
translate schinese story01_11_2923643e:

    # L "He lives for this garden."
    L "他这辈子就为这个院子活着。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6307
translate schinese story01_11_ea3a9fef:

    # mc "And yours too. You helped him with the flowers, remember?"
    mc "也包括你的。你还帮他弄过花呢，记得吗？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6308
translate schinese story01_11_6120c94e:

    # mc "No need to sell yourself short."
    mc "不用妄自菲薄。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6310
translate schinese story01_11_9779b53d:

    # L "How'd you put it?"
    L "你怎么说来着？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6311
translate schinese story01_11_df5d5284:

    # L "Learning from the best?"
    L "向最优秀的人学习？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6312
translate schinese story01_11_bbc94858:

    # L "You're the same way, y'know."
    L "你也一样，知道吗。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6314
translate schinese story01_11_a7d41df2:

    # mc "Terrible."
    mc "糟透了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6315
translate schinese story01_11_a1c1dcbb:

    # mc "We're starting to sound like a normal couple."
    mc "我们开始像一对普通情侣了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6318
translate schinese story01_11_5c794a6a:

    # L "I wouldn't mind."
    L "我倒不介意。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6319
translate schinese story01_11_7c842379:

    # L "Though..."
    L "不过……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6320
translate schinese story01_11_b0b27fc8:

    # L "If Beatrice heard that, you wouldn't get off that easy."
    L "这话要是被碧翠丝听到，你可没那么容易脱身。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6322
translate schinese story01_11_06d43142:

    # mc "I'd flee the city."
    mc "我会直接逃出城。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6324
translate schinese story01_11_e403e019:

    # L "Another country?"
    L "换个国家？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6326
translate schinese story01_11_ff58c98f:

    # mc "Another planet."
    mc "换个星球。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6327
translate schinese story01_11_1c980eaf:

    # mc "Preferably a direct flight."
    mc "最好有直飞航班。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6330
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_10:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6332
translate schinese story01_11_7fde028f:

    # mc "(Speaking of that evil slime... She still hasn't replied.)"
    mc "（说到那个邪恶的黏液怪……她还没回我。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6333
translate schinese story01_11_fff3516d:

    # mc "(Sure, she's ignored me for hours before, but...)"
    mc "（虽然她以前也冷落我好几个小时，但是……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6334
translate schinese story01_11_a7fbfe1c:

    # mc "(Maybe I should at least send her a mess—)"
    mc "（要不我至少给她发条消——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6336
translate schinese story01_11_dfa7a691:

    # L "Hey, [mc]?"
    L "喂，[mc]？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6337
translate schinese story01_11_9084b690:

    # mc "Ye—"
    mc "嗯——"

# game/story01en.rpy:6339
translate schinese story01_11_c8b1deeb:

    # L "Watch what I can do..."
    L "看我能做什么……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6340
translate schinese story01_11_f8f68094:

    # L "Nnngh."
    L "唔嗯。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6348
translate schinese story01_11_02dacf4f:

    # mc "For the memories."
    mc "为了留个纪念。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6349
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_5:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6352
translate schinese story01_11_b634283c:

    # L "What are you..."
    L "你到底要干什……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6353
translate schinese story01_11_185e1592:

    # L "Hey, cut it out!"
    L "喂，住手！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6354
translate schinese story01_11_d98f30ed:

    # L "Delete it!"
    L "删掉！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6355
translate schinese story01_11_9808f106:

    # mc "No! You were too cute!"
    mc "不行！太可爱了！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6358
translate schinese story01_11_5fcea748:

    # L "Give me the phone!"
    L "把手机给我！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6365
translate schinese story01_11_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6367
translate schinese story01_11_b6484648:

    # L "Wh- [mc]!"
    L "什——[mc]！"

# game/story01en.rpy:6370
translate schinese story01_11_80801f6a:

    # mc "All good! Alive, more or less."
    mc "一切正常！还活着，或者说勉强活着。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6371
translate schinese story01_11_07a695f7:

    # L "(Why is he like this...)"
    L "（他怎么是这样的人……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6372
translate schinese story01_11_7a182adc:

    # L "(Thank God he didn't get hurt.)"
    L "（谢天谢地他没受伤。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6375
translate schinese story01_11_e1c1d32f:

    # mc "(Warm... Since the opportunity presented itself, maybe I should take a bathroom break?)"
    mc "（好温暖……既然机会难得，是不是该去趟洗手间？）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6378
translate schinese story01_11_1fd188fd:

    # mc "(Bliss...)"
    mc "（幸福……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6379
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_6:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6380
translate schinese story01_11_97cd304b:

    # mc "Why're you looking at me like that?"
    mc "你干嘛那样看着我？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6382
translate schinese story01_11_65b0d133:

    # L "Y'know..."
    L "你知道不……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6383
translate schinese story01_11_39c3a88b:

    # L "The water's transparent."
    L "水是透明的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6385
translate schinese story01_11_955ca3dc:

    # mc "I was checking the lighting."
    mc "我在检查光线。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6387
translate schinese story01_11_096e26d8:

    # L "What?"
    L "什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6389
translate schinese story01_11_d5954f2c:

    # mc "For safety reasons."
    mc "出于安全考虑。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6390
translate schinese story01_11_b611fdff:

    # mc "You never know. The depth might be deceptive."
    mc "谁知道呢。水深可能是假的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6392
translate schinese story01_11_74e011ad:

    # L "You didn't have to pee."
    L "你没必要尿出来。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6393
translate schinese story01_11_f8043e64:

    # L "You're standing waist-deep in water."
    L "你正站在齐腰深的水里。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6395
translate schinese story01_11_274879f4:

    # mc "The danger was closer than I thought."
    mc "危险比我想象的来得近。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6397
translate schinese story01_11_f9f43f4c:

    # L "You're standing in the water trying to look innocent."
    L "你站在水里装无辜。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6399
translate schinese story01_11_f36e5aec:

    # mc "Exactly."
    mc "正是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6400
translate schinese story01_11_83e0ce90:

    # mc "Because guilty people usually run."
    mc "因为心虚的人才会跑。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6402
translate schinese story01_11_be9ea6d1:

    # L "You would've run if you weren't soaked."
    L "你要是没湿透，早跑了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6404
translate schinese story01_11_5e3697e1:

    # mc "Objection."
    mc "反对。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6405
translate schinese story01_11_ff273a87:

    # mc "I would've made a strategic retreat."
    mc "我早就战略转移了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6406
translate schinese story01_11_dd0690c2:

    # L "(Maybe...)"
    L "（也许吧……）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6409
translate schinese story01_11_36aeced6:

    # L "(Screw it.)"
    L "（管他的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6412
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_11:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6413
translate schinese story01_11_b7fc04e7:

    # mc "(This feels... weird.)"
    mc "（这感觉……怪怪的。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6417
translate schinese story01_11_2544ed23:

    # mc "Ten points for the dramatic entrance, obviously."
    mc "这场拉风登场当然值十分。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6418
translate schinese story01_11_5c47b26f:

    # mc "But allow me one question. Why?"
    mc "但允许我问一个问题。为什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6421
translate schinese story01_11_eb5e51f7:

    # L "Figured I'd check if it was really as deep as you claimed."
    L "我就是想看看是不是真有你说的那么深。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6423
translate schinese story01_11_b5b54b27:

    # mc "And how is it...?"
    mc "感觉怎么样……？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6425
translate schinese story01_11_caf52fe8:

    # L "Eh."
    L "嗯。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6426
translate schinese story01_11_5429c158:

    # L "Kinda warm."
    L "有点暖和。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6428
translate schinese story01_11_c1ad1745:

    # mc "...you do know the water is—"
    mc "……你知道水是——"

# game/story01en.rpy:6430
translate schinese story01_11_eef0c40d:

    # L "Transparent. Yeah, I know."
    L "透明的。我知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6432
translate schinese story01_11_c8e80eb0:

    # mc "...I can feel that."
    mc "……我能感觉到。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6434
translate schinese story01_11_a2389f8d:

    # L "No idea what you're talking about."
    L "不知道你在说什么。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6436
translate schinese story01_11_73b71bbc:

    # mc "(Same degenerate as always.)"
    mc "（一如既往的变态。）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6437
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_12:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6438
translate schinese story01_11_5a72de8a:

    # mc "So basically, we both peed—"
    mc "所以基本上，我们俩都尿了——"

# game/story01en.rpy:6440
translate schinese story01_11_130363d2:

    # L "We're not talking about this."
    L "这事不许再提。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6448
translate schinese story01_11_177d3eb2_1:

    # mc "What are you doing?"
    mc "你在干什么？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6450
translate schinese story01_11_d437a267:

    # L "Listening to your heartbeat."
    L "听你的心跳。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6452
translate schinese story01_11_855d2c72:

    # mc "Let me know when it stops."
    mc "停了就告诉我。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6454
translate schinese story01_11_a8fa9f13:

    # L "...not funny."
    L "……不好笑。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6455
translate schinese story01_11_dc0ff26a:

    # mc "Sorry."
    mc "抱歉。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6457
translate schinese story01_11_3fa20fce:

    # mc "Kinda strange hearing that after what happened a second ago."
    mc "刚发生那种事之后听到这话，还挺奇怪的。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6459
translate schinese story01_11_9beda999:

    # L "Gross?"
    L "恶心？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6461
translate schinese story01_11_01195881:

    # mc "I didn't say that."
    mc "我可没这么说。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6462
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_7:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6464
translate schinese story01_11_73f89e76:

    # L "Same as always..."
    L "一如既往……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6466
translate schinese story01_11_b4bd7f4e:

    # mc "Degenerates, right?"
    mc "变态，对吧？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6468
translate schinese story01_11_c51d5bab:

    # L "Those are the ones."
    L "那种人就是。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6477
translate schinese story01_11_ebd4feab:

    # L "Rose was way too interested in you today."
    L "罗丝今天对你太上心了。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6479
translate schinese story01_11_f90998aa:

    # mc "Hard not to notice."
    mc "很难不注意到。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6480
translate schinese story01_11_16870885:

    # mc "Speaking of which, explain something. Why were you teasing her?"
    mc "说起来，解释一下。你刚才为什么逗她？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6482
translate schinese story01_11_71b85ce8_1:

    # L "What do you think?"
    L "你觉得呢？"

# game/story01en.rpy:6484
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_13:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6486
translate schinese story01_11_483a3a63:

    # L "Don't play dumb."
    L "别装傻。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6487
translate schinese story01_11_3b4a3af2:

    # L "You know exactly wha-"
    L "你明明知——"

# game/story01en.rpy:6489
translate schinese story01_11_78566a32:

    # mc "That's exactly why I act this way."
    mc "所以我才这样。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6490
translate schinese story01_11_4477e98d:

    # mc "Because I do know."
    mc "因为我确实知道。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6492
translate schinese story01_11_b0ea7e96:

    # mc "Lena, you should have someone better than me."
    mc "莉娜，你应该找个比我更好的人。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6494
translate schinese story01_11_9b513dbd:

    # mc "I'm the worst possible choice, Len—"
    mc "我是最糟糕的选择，莉——"

# game/story01en.rpy:6499
translate schinese story01_11_d2ca5654:

    # "The slap came out quieter than it should have."
    "那一巴掌的声响，比它应有的要轻。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6500
translate schinese story01_11_2b35b6fe_14:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6504
translate schinese story01_11_87b33293:

    # mc "(Wh—)"
    mc "（什——）"

# game/story01en.rpy:6506
translate schinese story01_11_9993b94e_8:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/story01en.rpy:6508
translate schinese story01_11_beafb8fb:

    # L "(Whispering) That hurt..."
    L "（低声）疼死了……"

