# game/story01en.rpy:4015
translate schinese story01_7_88fa54a1:

    # L "Seventy-three points outta eighty."
    L "八十分里给了七十三分。"

# game/story01en.rpy:4018
translate schinese story01_7_454b5743:

    # r "Thirty-six and a half per stage on average, if ya wanna be precise."
    r "要说精确点的话，平均每关三十六点五分。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5212
translate schinese story01_9_63453f4d:

    # "Original score: 107 out of 120."
    "原分数：满分120分中的107分。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5213
translate schinese story01_9_9242ea32:

    # "Altered score: 105 out of 120."
    "改分后：满分120分中的105分。"

# game/story01en.rpy:5354
translate schinese story01_9_5725f13e:

    # r "And for the written stage, we got thirty-four outta forty."
    r "笔试那边，我们拿了四十分中的三十四分。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6533
translate schinese story01_11_0e9c888a:

    # nn "Yo! That's all for now, the first part of Act One is officially done. Hope you enjoyed it, at least a little bit xD"
    nn "喂！暂时就到这里了，第一幕上篇正式完结。希望你至少有那么一点点喜欢 xD"

# game/story01en.rpy:6534
translate schinese story01_11_3b25244f:

    # nn "The second part should be out within the next couple of months, so... yeah."
    nn "下篇应该会在接下来几个月内推出，所以……就这样吧。"

# game/story01en.rpy:6535
translate schinese story01_11_40a72c7e:

    # nn "And hey! If you liked the game, I'd really appreciate your feedback. And honestly, I'm grateful for all the support you've given me. You guys are the best!"
    nn "还有！如果你喜欢这款游戏，我真的很希望能看到你的反馈。老实说，你们一路以来的支持我全都感激不尽。你们是最棒的！"

